Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.25,0:01:21.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨 我叫彼得 帕克
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.25,0:01:21.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi. My name is Peter Parker.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:23.92,0:01:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不记得我 但是我有些事要告诉你……
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.92,0:01:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't remember me, but I have something to tell you
Dialogue: 2,0:01:26.96,0:01:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这听起来很疯狂
Dialogue: 1,0:01:26.96,0:01:28.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}that's gonna sound crazy.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.76,0:01:32.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是是事实
Dialogue: 1,0:01:31.76,0:01:32.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But it's the truth.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:34.84,0:01:36.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你会相信我·
Dialogue: 1,0:01:34.84,0:01:36.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And I know you're gonna believe me,
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你擅长识破我的谎言
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-because you're very good at telling. . .   -. . . when I'm lying.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.64,0:01:44.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}EV 你能检查一下 目标矩阵的校准情况吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.64,0:01:44.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}E. V. , can you check the calibration of my targeting matrix?
Dialogue: 2,0:01:44.23,0:01:45.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得它还不够精准
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.23,0:01:45.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That doesn't feel zeroed in to me.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}检查目标校准情况
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.94,0:01:47.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Checking target calibration.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:48.90,0:01:50.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（我们很乐意为您服务）
Dialogue: 2,0:01:56.74,0:01:57.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}EV 休息一会
Dialogue: 1,0:01:56.74,0:01:57.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, E. V. , take five.
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.70,0:01:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}待命中
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.70,0:01:59.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Standing by.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:05.46,0:02:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们以前是认识的
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.46,0:02:06.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We used to know each other.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:08.25,0:02:10.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们曾经一起
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.25,0:02:10.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We were together.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.30,0:02:12.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是不好的事情要发生
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.30,0:02:12.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But something bad was gonna happen,
Dialogue: 2,0:02:12.97,0:02:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而阻止它发生的唯一方法 就是让所有人忘记我
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.97,0:02:16.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and the only way to stop it -was to make everyone forget me.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.64,0:02:18.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}刚在他的动态里发帖了）
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.43,0:02:23.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第一天在麻省理工 我们走吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.43,0:02:23.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}First day at MIT, let's go!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:23.77,0:02:25.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天！ 我们在这里！ 我们成功了！
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.77,0:02:25.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh! We're here! We made it!
Dialogue: 2,0:02:25.98,0:02:27.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}MJ 过来
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.98,0:02:27.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, MJ, come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:27.81,0:02:28.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}包括你
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.81,0:02:28.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}lncluding you.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:28.98,0:02:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}假装你现在不是你一生中……
Dialogue: 1,0:02:28.98,0:02:30.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Pretend like you're not the happiest you've ever been
Dialogue: 2,0:02:30.44,0:02:31.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最快乐的时候
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.44,0:02:31.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}in your entire life right now.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:32.78,0:02:33.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.78,0:02:33.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-!can't.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.94,0:02:36.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们干吧！ 你很开心！  -好
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.94,0:02:36.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let's just do this!   -Okay, okay, okay. You're happy! Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.82,0:02:38.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我不只是彼得 帕克
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.82,0:02:38.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I'm not just Peter Parker.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:40.58,0:02:41.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.58,0:02:41.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'mSpider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.00,0:02:43.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很清楚
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.00,0:02:43.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}'m really, really understanding the culture
Dialogue: 2,0:02:43.66,0:02:45.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}波士顿这里的文化很不同
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.66,0:02:45.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}out here in Boston is just so different.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:45.33,0:02:48.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候蜘蛛侠必须做艰难的事·
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.33,0:02:48.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And sometimes, Spider-Man has to do the hard thing,
Dialogue: 2,0:02:48.25,0:02:50.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使它伤了彼得 帕克的心
Dialogue: 1,0:02:48.25,0:02:50.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}even if it breaks Peter Parker's heart.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:50.34,0:02:53.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里每个人都说：把车停在码头边
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.34,0:02:53.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And everyone here is like, "Pahk the cah by the hahba. "
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.88,0:02:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许那就是我的责任
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.88,0:02:56.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And maybe that's my responsibility.
Dialogue: 2,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}独自面对真相
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}To live alone with the truth.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.89,0:03:04.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是真相是 MJ 我爱你
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.89,0:03:04.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But the truth is, MJ, that I love you.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:05.94,0:03:07.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望在你内心深处……
Dialogue: 1,0:03:05.94,0:03:07.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And I hope that deep down,
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.19,0:03:09.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还记得你也爱我
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.19,0:03:09.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}something inside of you remembers that you love me, too.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:09.98,0:03:11.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(犯罪进行中）
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.27,0:03:13.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嫌疑人身高173至178厘米 中等身材
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.27,0:03:13.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Suspect is 5'8", 5'10", medium build.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:14.03,0:03:16.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但在此之前 我还是会继续做蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,0:03:14.03,0:03:16.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But until then, I'm just gonna be Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:03:22.83,0:03:24.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有危险！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.83,0:03:24.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Incoming!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:27.21,0:03:29.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}干掉他！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.21,0:03:29.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, get him!
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.63,0:03:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂！
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.63,0:03:31.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey, hey. Whoa, whoa,
Dialogue: 2,0:03:43.97,0:03:45.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}曼弗雷迪犯罪集团的成员……
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.97,0:03:45.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Members of the Manfredi crime syndicate
Dialogue: 2,0:03:46.06,0:03:48.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}昨天被蜘蛛侠逮捕了 （蜘蛛侠捣毁犯罪团伙）
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.06,0:03:48.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}were apprehended by Spider-Man yesterday.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:01.24,0:04:02.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（梅 帕克 当你帮助某人 就是在帮助所有人)
Dialogue: 2,0:04:10.00,0:04:13.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们住在同一层楼
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.00,0:04:13.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, we live on the same floor.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:13.88,0:04:16.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.88,0:04:16.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Cool.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:19.84,0:04:21.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}平时有人会来这儿吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.84,0:04:21.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Does anybody ever come up here?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除非他们喜欢石棉
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.05,0:04:24.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Not unless they like asbestos.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:24.64,0:04:27.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们一直只把它当作储藏空间来用
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.64,0:04:27.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We've just been using it for storage.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:28.39,0:04:29.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}完美
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.39,0:04:29.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It'sperfect.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:31.27,0:04:33.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大家好 大二时期的内德回来了
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.27,0:04:33.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, everyone, sophomore-year Ned is back.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:34.27,0:04:37.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更年长 更睿智 更出众
Dialogue: 1,0:04:34.27,0:04:37.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Older, wiser, flyer.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:37.19,0:04:39.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧！
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.19,0:04:39.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let'sgo!   -Whoa.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:39.99,0:04:42.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你脸上是什么？ 一你觉得怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.99,0:04:42.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-What is on your face? How do you feel about it?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:42.45,0:04:44.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看起来像个助理教练
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.45,0:04:44.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you look like an assistant coach.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:44.66,0:04:45.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.66,0:04:45.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh.
Dialogue: 2,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蝎子 你确定要这么做吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You sure you wanna do this, Scorpion?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:51.37,0:04:52.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛仔 你想念我吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.37,0:04:52.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you miss me, Spidey?
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.76,0:05:00.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我把你从这里扔下去.·
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.76,0:05:00.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If I drop you from here,
Dialogue: 2,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得要多久才会着地？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.18,0:05:02.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}how long you think it will take you to hit the ground?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:03.43,0:05:05.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道 你告诉我
Dialogue: 1,0:05:03.43,0:05:05.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I don't know.／-You tell me.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.22,0:05:07.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}咱们以圆满的方式收场 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.22,0:05:07.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's end this on a high note, huh?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.73,0:05:14.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}朗尼！
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.73,0:05:14.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yo, Lonnie!
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发生什么事？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wha ha happened?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}德沃尔夫 你需要的所有证据……
Dialogue: 1,0:05:16.73,0:05:18.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}DeWolff, all the evidence you're gonna need
Dialogue: 2,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都在他车的后备箱里
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.78,0:05:20.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}is in the trunk of his car.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠 你是想抢我的饭碗吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.36,0:05:22.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You tryin' to take my job, Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,0:05:22.57,0:05:24.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿 你们才是专业人士 我只是个志愿者
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.57,0:05:24.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you guys are the professionals, I'm just a volunteer.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:25.91,0:05:26.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(麦克唐纳 加根)
Dialogue: 2,0:05:35.29,0:05:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是一个新纽约 (给梅送花)
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.29,0:05:37.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a new New York.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.42,0:05:41.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感谢蜘蛛侠…… 犯罪率已降至历史最低水平
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.42,0:05:41.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks to Spider-Man, crime rates have dropped to a record low.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警方和损管部门将大部分功劳归于·
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.09,0:05:43.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Police and Damage Control give much of the credit
Dialogue: 2,0:05:43.55,0:05:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这位蒙面英雄
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.55,0:05:44.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}to the masked hero.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:44.72,0:05:47.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}启动 HUD 测试／市民联合银行发生持械抢劫案 (犯罪正在进行中）／在过去六个月里
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.72,0:05:47.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Initiate HUD test.／Armed robbery at Civic Union
Dialogue: 2,0:05:47.47,0:05:50.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他拿下了……
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.47,0:05:50.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bank.／n the past six months, he has taken down
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.31,0:05:53.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}横跨五大行政区的 每一位主要犯罪头目……
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.31,0:05:53.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}every major crime lord across the five boroughs,
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.35,0:05:56.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其中包括拥有超能力的 忍者组织 手合会
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.35,0:05:56.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}including the superpowered ninja group The Hand.
Dialogue: 2,0:05:59.28,0:06:00.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（能力越大 责责任越大)
Dialogue: 2,0:06:00.65,0:06:06.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(蜘蛛侠获颁城市钥匙）／他是纽约市的骄傲／每个成年人都依赖 每个孩子都渴望成为的英雄
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.65,0:06:06.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He is the pride of New York City.／The hero every grown-up relies on and every kid wants to be.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:07.74,0:06:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}麻省理工学院的最后一个学期
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.74,0:06:10.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Final semester, MIT.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:10.20,0:06:12.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪 我们下个月就要毕业了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.20,0:06:12.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh, we're graduating in a month.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:12.91,0:06:16.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们留下了那么多回忆 该从何说起呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.91,0:06:16.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We've made so many memories. Where do I begin?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:16.21,0:06:19.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和吉姆、威利一起在查尔斯河夜泳
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.21,0:06:19.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Night swimming in the Charles River with Jim and Wiley.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:19.46,0:06:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在臭名昭著的香蕉餐厅美食大战
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.46,0:06:22.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The infamous food fight at the Banana Lounge.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:22.34,0:06:26.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和MJ、内特 道格一起 在五楼自习室通宵夜读
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.34,0:06:26.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Pulling all-nighters in Stud with MJ and Nate Dawg.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.72,0:06:29.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(您的订单已送达） 感觉就像昨天 我和MJ坐在屋顶上·
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.72,0:06:29.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It feels like yesterday I was sitting on a roof with MJ,
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.56,0:06:32.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梦想着能一起来到这里· 直到现在 我仍不敢相信我们真的做到了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.56,0:06:32.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}dreaming about coming here together, and I still can't believe we did it.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.98,0:06:35.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我非常感激我结识的所有朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.98,0:06:35.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so grateful for all the friends that I've made.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:35.77,0:06:38.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我无法想象和除了你以外的人 一起经历这一切
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.77,0:06:38.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I couldn't imagine going through this with anyone else.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:38.19,0:06:40.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}内德 你觉得还有谁会看这些东西？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.19,0:06:40.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ned, who do you think is actually watching these?
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.28,0:06:42.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不知道 不过也许某个人 一好
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.28,0:06:42.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-don't know.   -But maybe someone. Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:42.90,0:06:44.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 再见了 某个人
Dialogue: 1,0:06:42.90,0:06:44.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, bye, someone.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.28,0:06:46.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么？ 不！  -再见 我们结束了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.28,0:06:46.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Bye. We're done. No! Yeah, we're done.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:57.21,0:06:59.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(外卖放门口）
Dialogue: 2,0:07:04.47,0:07:07.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们谈论的可是布鲁克林市中心· 在大白天
Dialogue: 1,0:07:04.47,0:07:07.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, we're talking about downtown Brooklyn in broad daylight.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:07.76,0:07:10.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像那样备受瞩目的工作…… 你知道福斯韦尔牵涉其中
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.76,0:07:10.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}High-profile job like that, you know that Foswell was involved.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:10.76,0:07:12.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 我明白 但是你能证明吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.76,0:07:12.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I hear you, but can you prove it?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:13.06,0:07:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 我正在查他的金融记录……
Dialogue: 1,0:07:13.06,0:07:14.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm going through his financial records
Dialogue: 2,0:07:15.02,0:07:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且每晚跟踪他的手下
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.02,0:07:16.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm following his crew every night.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:16.60,0:07:19.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了工作 你还有做别的事情吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.60,0:07:19.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you do anything besides work?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.61,0:07:21.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有句话说：做你热爱的事……
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.61,0:07:21.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know the saying, "You do something you love,
Dialogue: 2,0:07:21.23,0:07:22.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就等于这辈子一天都不工作”
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.23,0:07:22.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"you don't work a day in your life. "
Dialogue: 2,0:07:24.07,0:07:26.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-妈 我的电脑在哪里？  -我不知道
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.07,0:07:26.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Mom, where's my calculator?   -I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.15,0:07:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我好吗？ 嫁给工作没有好结果
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.15,0:07:30.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me, aight? Being married to the job never ends well.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不必担心 我会没事的
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.20,0:07:32.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, don't worry about it. I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:32.28,0:07:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？ 然而你还是有头疼 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.28,0:07:34.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah? You still getting them headaches, though?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:36.33,0:07:38.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 但是我会没事的
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.33,0:07:38.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, yeah. But, um. . . But I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.83,0:07:40.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm, I don't know, man.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:40.08,0:07:42.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想你的身体尝试提示你
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.08,0:07:42.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I think your body's tryin' to tell you somethin'.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:42.17,0:07:44.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}例如你需要时不时脱掉那服饰
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.17,0:07:44.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like you need to get outta that suit every once in a while.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈 你知道我的电脑在哪里吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Mom, do you know where my calculator is?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道 宝贝
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.68,0:07:47.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, Papi.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:48.13,0:07:50.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要的是一些真正的人类联系
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.13,0:07:50.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What you need is some real human connection.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.01,0:07:52.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？ 我们不是在联系吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.01,0:07:52.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, what? And we're not connecting?
Dialogue: 2,0:07:52.72,0:07:57.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 朋友 我不知道你的名字…… 你的样貌或任何关于你的事
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.72,0:07:57.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Nah, dude. I don't know your name, your face, or nothing about you.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:57.52,0:07:59.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得你从来没问过我 关于我人生的问题
Dialogue: 1,0:07:57.52,0:07:59.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think you've ever asked me a question about my life.
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当然有
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure, I have.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:01.06,0:08:02.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我的孩子叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.06,0:08:02.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, what are my kids' names?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:02.52,0:08:05.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}作为开始 你儿子的名字是宝贝
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.52,0:08:05.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, well, for starters, your son's name's Papi.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:06.82,0:08:07.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是蜘蛛侠吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.82,0:08:07.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能告诉你 宝贝
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.99,0:08:09.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't tell you that, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这表示是蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That means it's Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.87,0:08:13.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Gosh.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:15.54,0:08:18.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(犯罪进行中） 一辆被劫持的坦克正向南驶过第34街
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.54,0:08:18.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A hijacked tank is heading southbound past 34th Street.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.71,0:08:20.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有单位全体出动
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.71,0:08:20.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All available units respond.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:20.46,0:08:21.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你收到吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.46,0:08:21.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you getting this?
Dialogue: 2,0:08:21.63,0:08:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}更多的工作 你真幸运
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.63,0:08:23.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}More work. Lucky you.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:23.46,0:08:24.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我在那里见你
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.46,0:08:24.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I'll see you out there.
Dialogue: 2,0:08:24.67,0:08:25.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很抱歉 我必须走了
Dialogue: 1,0:08:24.67,0:08:25.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sorry, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:34.72,0:08:36.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoo!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:01.29,0:09:02.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Awoo!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.86,0:09:32.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:43.17,0:09:44.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来帮你 蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.17,0:09:44.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I got you, Spidey!
Dialogue: 2,0:09:44.54,0:09:45.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我不需要你的·.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.54,0:09:45.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no. I don't need your. . .
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:00.18,0:10:01.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！ 小心！
Dialogue: 1,0:10:00.18,0:10:01.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! Heads up!
Dialogue: 2,0:10:03.06,0:10:06.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧 孩子？ 好 你没事 再见
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.06,0:10:06.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay, kid? Yeah, you're okay. See ya later.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:10.90,0:10:12.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}光看外表是看不出来的·
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.90,0:10:12.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You wouldn't know it just by looking at it,
Dialogue: 2,0:10:12.45,0:10:16.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但就是这条街曾经被彻底摧毁· 在纽约之战中
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.45,0:10:16.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but this very street was completely destroyed in the Battle of New York.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:23.79,0:10:25.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.79,0:10:25.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:27.17,0:10:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.17,0:10:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:51.69,0:10:52.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.69,0:10:52.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克 搞什么？ 你刚用货车撞我！
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.66,0:10:57.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The hell, Frank? You just hit me with the van!
Dialogue: 2,0:10:57.70,0:10:59.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别再抱怨了
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.70,0:10:59.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Quit your whimpering.
Dialogue: 2,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克 我们不要再那样做
Dialogue: 1,0:10:59.08,0:11:00.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We're not doing that again, Frank.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得很对
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.70,0:11:02.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're goddamn right we're not.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:02.20,0:11:04.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次你必须给我让开
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.20,0:11:04.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This time you're gonna get the hell outta my way.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说不是救你的命？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you mean instead of saving your life?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:06.00,0:11:09.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你又要提斯塔滕岛那破事吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.00,0:11:09.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Eh, you gonna talk about that Staten Island bullshit again?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:09.38,0:11:14.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你说的 不是我／天啊／听好 你不能在每一个情况…… 随意开枪
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.38,0:11:14.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, well, you said it, not me.／Jeez.／Look, man, you can't just shoot yourself out of every situation.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:14.22,0:11:15.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无辜的人可能会受伤
Dialogue: 1,0:11:14.22,0:11:15.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Innocent people get hurt.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:15.68,0:11:18.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得那辆坦克里会有谁 蠢货？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:15.68,0:11:18.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who do you think's downrange of that tank, dumb-dumb?
Dialogue: 2,0:11:23.47,0:11:24.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}随你便吧
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.47,0:11:24.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Suit yourself.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:28.15,0:11:29.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蠢货
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.15,0:11:29.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jackass.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:29.23,0:11:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这可恶的家伙
Dialogue: 1,0:11:29.23,0:11:31.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This freakin' guy.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:45.16,0:11:47.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死……
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.16,0:11:47.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Motherf...
Dialogue: 2,0:11:47.42,0:11:48.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}回家吧 弗兰克！
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.42,0:11:48.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Go home, Frank!
Dialogue: 2,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要杀了这孩子
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.30,0:11:54.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna kill this kid.
Dialogue: 2,0:11:58.55,0:11:59.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(来电 德沃尔夫)
Dialogue: 2,0:11:59.64,0:12:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-德沃尔夫？  -你要不要把那玩意儿停下来？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:59.64,0:12:01.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-DeWolff?   -Are you gonna stop that thing or what?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:02.01,0:12:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它直接冲向损管拘留中心
Dialogue: 1,0:12:02.01,0:12:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's heading straight for the Damage Control Detention Center.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:04.60,0:12:05.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在努力
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.60,0:12:05.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'mtrying.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:05.68,0:12:10.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再努力点／那里有很多可怕的人被拘留在那里 （损管局 西分局）／你认为是谁把他们关在那里？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.68,0:12:10.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Try harder.／There's a lot of scary dudes locked up in there.／Well, who do you think put them in there?
Dialogue: 2,0:12:10.40,0:12:14.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧 蝎子 搬迁日
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.40,0:12:14.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go, Scorpion. Moving day.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.01,0:12:43.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please! Evac now!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:44.76,0:12:45.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 各位 快离开！
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.76,0:12:45.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, everybody, clear out!
Dialogue: 2,0:12:45.97,0:12:47.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个人有武器并且很危险
Dialogue: 1,0:12:45.97,0:12:47.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This guy is armed and dangerous.
Dialogue: 2,0:12:58.32,0:13:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下车 夫人
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.32,0:13:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh. . . Get out of the vehicle, ma'am.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:01.95,0:13:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也有同样的想法
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.95,0:13:03.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I was thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在哪里？
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where am I?
Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么……
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.64,0:13:24.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What the. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:13:27.31,0:13:28.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.31,0:13:28.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Move!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:28.93,0:13:30.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把她留下来问话 清空大楼
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.93,0:13:30.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep her for questioning. Clear the building.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:33.86,0:13:35.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}享受这段旅程吧 蝎子
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.86,0:13:35.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Enjoy the ride, Scorpion!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.86,0:13:38.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在超高度戒备监狱里很难见到日光
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.86,0:13:38.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You won't be seeing much daylight in Supermax.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.53,0:13:41.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蝎子是夜行性动物 朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.53,0:13:41.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Scorpions are nocturnal, buddy.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:44.45,0:13:46.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大楼正遭到攻击
Dialogue: 1,0:13:44.45,0:13:46.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The building is under attack.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:46.12,0:13:47.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}立刻把囚犯带离这里！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.12,0:13:47.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get the prisoner out of here now!
Dialogue: 2,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}长官！
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.00,0:13:54.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sir!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:12.77,0:14:14.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必须马上起飞！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.77,0:14:14.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You gotta take off now!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:14.40,0:14:16.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大楼已被攻破 快！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:14.40,0:14:16.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The building has been breached. Go! Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:16.81,0:14:19.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开动它！ 快走！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.81,0:14:19.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, fire it up! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:24.61,0:14:26.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（美国损管局）
Dialogue: 2,0:14:27.82,0:14:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}计划改变了！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:27.82,0:14:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Change of plans!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:29.62,0:14:31.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带他到贝尔维尤的直升机停机坪
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.62,0:14:31.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Take him to the helipad at Bellevue.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:32.25,0:14:35.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么？  -这是梅茨格局长的命令 快去！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.25,0:14:35.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-What?   -That's an order from Director Metzger. Go!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:35.54,0:14:36.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在！
Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.54,0:14:36.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Now!
Dialogue: 2,0:14:36.67,0:14:37.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到
Dialogue: 1,0:14:36.67,0:14:37.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy that.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:48.68,0:14:50.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！ 什么.·.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.68,0:14:50.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey! What. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:14:50.43,0:14:52.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是如何上来这里的？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.43,0:14:52.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-How did I get up here? Uh. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:14:56.14,0:14:59.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠 救我 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.14,0:14:59.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man, save me, would you?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:04.86,0:15:05.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是谁？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.86,0:15:05.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who are you?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:07.12,0:15:08.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以看到我
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.12,0:15:08.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You can see me.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:08.66,0:15:10.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我 你是谁
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.66,0:15:10.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me who you are.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:11.24,0:15:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先说
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.24,0:15:12.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-You first.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.33,0:15:17.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.92,0:15:21.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}_
Dialogue: 2,0:15:23.38,0:15:24.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你竟能把我赶出来
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.38,0:15:24.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You pushed me out.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:24.72,0:15:26.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有趣
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.72,0:15:26.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Interesting.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:26.59,0:15:28.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是什么东西？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:26.59,0:15:28.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:28.18,0:15:30.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你尝试跳入我的脑袋吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.18,0:15:30.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you just try to jump into my mind?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:30.35,0:15:33.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在你一直追逐我的这段时间里·
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.35,0:15:33.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, the whole time you've been chasing me,
Dialogue: 2,0:15:34.18,0:15:36.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你忘了问自己一个非常重要的问题
Dialogue: 1,0:15:34.18,0:15:36.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}you forgot to ask yourself a very important question.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:38.73,0:15:40.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么东西在坦克里？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.73,0:15:40.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's in the tank?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:41.98,0:15:43.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走吧！ 快走
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.98,0:15:43.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Go! Move.
Dialogue: 2,0:15:57.75,0:15:58.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:57.75,0:15:58.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,0:15:59.96,0:16:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 1,0:15:59.96,0:16:01.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-What just happened?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:04.09,0:16:05.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.09,0:16:05.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Idon'tknow.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:07.30,0:16:08.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做得好
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.30,0:16:08.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, good job.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:08.38,0:16:09.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做得好 蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.38,0:16:09.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, way to go, Spidey.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:09.55,0:16:11.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们没事吧？ 你还好吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:09.55,0:16:11.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You guys okay? You good?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:11.34,0:16:16.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发誓 他们说我所做的 我一点都不记得／没事 让这些人好好照顾你
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.34,0:16:16.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I swear. All the things they said I did, I don't remember doing any of them.／It's okay, it's okay. Look, let these people take good care of you.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:16.52,0:16:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我绝不会伤害你
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.52,0:16:17.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I would never hurt you.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一好 -我爱你 蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay.   -I love you, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:16:19.10,0:16:20.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. All right, buddy. All right.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:20.65,0:16:22.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿 你有什么消息？  -听好
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.65,0:16:22.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, what do you got?   -Here, get this.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:22.82,0:16:24.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直升机载蝎子去了贝尔维尤
Dialogue: 1,0:16:22.82,0:16:24.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Chopper took Scorpion to Bellevue.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:24.57,0:16:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十分钟后 一名警卫直接把他带出了门外
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.57,0:16:26.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ten minutes later, a guard walked him right out the door.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:26.99,0:16:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.99,0:16:28.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Mmm-hmm.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:28.32,0:16:29.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坦克呢
Dialogue: 1,0:16:28.32,0:16:29.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What about the tank?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:29.49,0:16:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在布鲁克林的损管部门仓库被偷的
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.49,0:16:32.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stolen from the Damage Control warehouse in Brooklyn.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}司机是在那里工作的清洁工
Dialogue: 1,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Driver was a janitor who worked there.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:34.33,0:16:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有动机吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:34.33,0:16:35.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You got a motive?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:35.41,0:16:37.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有 没有犯罪记录
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.41,0:16:37.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Nada. And no criminal record.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:37.79,0:16:39.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蝎子一定是控制了她
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.79,0:16:39.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Scorpion must've gotten to her somehow.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 可能
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Maybe.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:42.71,0:16:44.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可能” 是什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.71,0:16:44.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean, "maybe"?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说 我不知道
Dialogue: 1,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I. . . I don't know.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:47.01,0:16:48.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是我认识一个人可能知道
Dialogue: 1,0:16:47.01,0:16:48.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But I know someone that might.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:48.42,0:16:49.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.42,0:16:49.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where you going?
Dialogue: 2,0:16:49.59,0:16:51.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你继续追查蝎子的线索
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.59,0:16:51.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You keep following the leads on Scorpion.
Dialogue: 2,0:16:51.34,0:16:53.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要去跟一个人谈谈
Dialogue: 1,0:16:51.34,0:16:53.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna go talk to someone.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:08.57,0:17:12.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是布莱顿海滩3250号吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.57,0:17:12.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, uh, is this 3250 Brighton Beach?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:16.70,0:17:17.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,0:17:16.70,0:17:17.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:18.54,0:17:20.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我知道那是什么意思
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.54,0:17:20.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I know what that means.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:25.42,0:17:26.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脱掉你的衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.42,0:17:26.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Take off your clothes.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:28.51,0:17:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.51,0:17:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, what?
Dialogue: 2,0:17:31.13,0:17:33.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在浴池里不穿衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:17:31.13,0:17:33.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't wear clothes in the banya.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脱掉紧身衣
Dialogue: 1,0:17:34.26,0:17:35.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ditch the leotard.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:36.72,0:17:38.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是紧身衣
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.72,0:17:38.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is not a leotard.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.93,0:17:40.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的短信说这里是你的办公室
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.93,0:17:40.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Your text said that this was your office.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:42.23,0:17:43.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是我的办公室
Dialogue: 1,0:17:42.23,0:17:43.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is my office.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:44.52,0:17:46.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下来
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.52,0:17:46.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get in.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:46.19,0:17:48.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不必了 谢谢 我就·.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.19,0:17:48.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I'm fine, thanks. I'll just. . .
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.28,0:17:49.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wah-wah.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:49.48,0:17:50.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的办公室 我的规则
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.48,0:17:50.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My office, my rules.
Dialogue: 2,0:17:50.94,0:17:54.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样你就能享受 一个美好放松的浸泡·
Dialogue: 1,0:17:50.94,0:17:54.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This way, you get to enjoy a nice, relaxing soak,
Dialogue: 2,0:17:54.91,0:17:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我也能看到你没带任何武器·
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.91,0:17:57.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and I get to see that you don't have any weapons,
Dialogue: 2,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}双赢
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.29,0:17:58.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and we both win.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:00.66,0:18:01.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.66,0:18:01.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:10.96,0:18:13.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？ 你从不脱掉那个？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.96,0:18:13.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Really? What, you never take that off?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:13.51,0:18:15.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我.· 这违背了图匿名的目的
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.51,0:18:15.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I. . . You know, it defeats the whole anonymous thing.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:15.80,0:18:20.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使是你的女朋友 或男朋友或任何东西？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.80,0:18:20.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Even for your girlfriend or boyfriend or whatever?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}网上有很多猜测
Dialogue: 1,0:18:20.93,0:18:22.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There's a lot of conjecture online.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:23.35,0:18:25.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有一些非常震撼的艺术画作品 你看了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:23.35,0:18:25.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And super graphic artwork. Have you seen?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:26.10,0:18:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和十个神秘客的那个 那是·
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.10,0:18:28.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The one with you and the ten Mysterios, it's. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:18:28.90,0:18:31.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看过了 我……
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.90,0:18:31.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I've. . . . . I've seen it. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:18:31.23,0:18:32.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老实说 很难忘记
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.23,0:18:32.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's hard to unsee, to be honest.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:32.78,0:18:34.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是我没有朋友 我基本上都是独来独往
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.78,0:18:34.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But, look, I don't have anyone. I just kinda keep to myself.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:35.62,0:18:37.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}独自一个人？ 一直都是？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.62,0:18:37.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All by yourself? All the time?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难怪你那么伤心
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.20,0:18:38.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No wonder you're so sad.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:38.87,0:18:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我没有伤心 -一点点
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.87,0:18:41.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm not so sad.   -A little bit.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:41.12,0:18:43.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以谈我来这里要谈的事
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.12,0:18:43.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Could we just talk about what I came here to talk to you about,
Dialogue: 2,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于破坏控制的袭击吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}the attack on Damage Control?
Dialogue: 2,0:18:44.58,0:18:48.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 那更倾向于你的强项
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.58,0:18:48.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. So, that is more your area.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:49.21,0:18:51.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}例如无关紧要的事
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.21,0:18:51.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like, small potato stuff.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:52.21,0:18:58.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反观复仇者专注于更重要的大事
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.21,0:18:58.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whereas the New Avengers are focusing on big potato stuff.
Dialogue: 2,0:18:59.35,0:19:02.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 不只是这样·
Dialogue: 1,0:18:59.35,0:19:02.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, okay. Well, there's more to it than that, you Know, the, uh. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:19:03.56,0:19:06.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}司机和其他帮忙的人……
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.56,0:19:06.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}. . . the driver and the others who were helping,
Dialogue: 2,0:19:06.10,0:19:08.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}犹如有一个人通过他们和我说话
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.10,0:19:08.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}it was like someone was talking to me through them.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:08.69,0:19:11.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}犹如有一个人通过他们的眼睛看我
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.69,0:19:11.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like someone was looking at me through their eyes.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:11.19,0:19:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你认为是思想控制？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.19,0:19:13.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're wondering if it's mind control?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:13.49,0:19:16.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一正是 -就像他们在红房间控制我那样？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.49,0:19:16.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Exactly.   -Like how they used on me in the Red Room?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:16.16,0:19:17.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一正是 -还有其他寡妇？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.16,0:19:17.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Exactly.   -And the other widows?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:17.86,0:19:19.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一对 -对 不是 我不这么认为
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.86,0:19:19.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Right. No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:19.91,0:19:24.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我更觉得他们被附身了
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.91,0:19:24.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I actually think it's probably more like possession.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:24.66,0:19:26.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}附身？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.66,0:19:26.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Possession?   -Hmm. Hmm.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:26.96,0:19:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像鬼或恶魔？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.96,0:19:28.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like a ghost or a demon.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:28.96,0:19:30.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一天啊 -或者在俄罗斯 我们有莱西
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.96,0:19:30.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, man.   -Or in Russia, we have leshy.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:30.75,0:19:34.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莱西统治森林并可以附身·
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.75,0:19:34.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Leshy rules the forest and can possess. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:19:36.84,0:19:37.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.84,0:19:37.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管是什么 他们在寻找一些东西
Dialogue: 1,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever it is, they are looking for something.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:40.60,0:19:44.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是损管局设施.· 这个月第四次被袭击
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.60,0:19:44.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the fourth attack on the Damage Control facility this month.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:44.93,0:19:46.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你认为他们在找什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.93,0:19:46.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And what do you think they're looking for?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:46.60,0:19:47.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.60,0:19:47.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Idon'tknow.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:47.90,0:19:49.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是你知道吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.90,0:19:49.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But you know what?
Dialogue: 2,0:19:49.48,0:19:51.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}经过了今天的袭击……
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.48,0:19:51.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}After the attack today,
Dialogue: 2,0:19:51.65,0:19:55.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}触发了跨部门的网络安全警报
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.65,0:19:55.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}there was a cross-agency cybersecurity alert that got triggered.
Dialogue: 2,0:19:56.07,0:19:59.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人利用中转站30名员工的凭证
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.07,0:19:59.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone accessed the Damage Control restricted servers
Dialogue: 2,0:19:59.53,0:20:02.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}访问了损管局限制服务器
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.53,0:20:02.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}using credentials from employees from the way station.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们都在找同一样东西
Dialogue: 1,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They all searched for the same thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.75,0:20:07.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}V-Max.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.58,0:20:10.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}V-Max.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:12.04,0:20:13.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.04,0:20:13.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 2,0:20:13.55,0:20:16.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它可以是外星人科技……
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.55,0:20:16.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it could be alien tech,
Dialogue: 2,0:20:16.38,0:20:20.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或秘密武器项目……
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.38,0:20:20.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}or secretive weapon programs,
Dialogue: 2,0:20:20.14,0:20:23.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者发射代码或……
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.14,0:20:23.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}or launch codes or. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:20:24.77,0:20:26.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道 这需要你自己去弄清楚
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.77,0:20:26.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, this is for you to figure out.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:26.93,0:20:31.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是小土豆级别的事情· 一好／不是大土豆脑力活的事情／你不必生气 天啊
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.93,0:20:31.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-This is small, baby potato stuff. . .／Okay, okay.   -. . . not big potato brain stuff.／You don't have to shout about it. Jeez.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:31.90,0:20:33.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我自己去问损管局
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.90,0:20:33.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe I'll just go ask Damage Control myself.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:36.44,0:20:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗 你不再完全匿名了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:36.44,0:20:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, you're not completely anonymous anymore.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:39.36,0:20:41.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看到你的肚脐了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:39.36,0:20:41.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I've seen your belly button.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:41.20,0:20:44.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好 -再见
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.20,0:20:44.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Bye.
Dialogue: 2,0:20:50.33,0:20:54.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（美国损管局）
Dialogue: 2,0:21:09.35,0:21:10.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊
Dialogue: 1,0:21:09.35,0:21:10.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:11.81,0:21:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨 我约了
Dialogue: 1,0:21:11.81,0:21:13.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, I got an appointment with, uh. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:21:13.48,0:21:14.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梅茨格局长 是的
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.48,0:21:14.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Director Metzger. Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:14.86,0:21:16.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请穿过扫描器
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.86,0:21:16.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please step through the scanner.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:19.28,0:21:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}检测到增强型人类
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.28,0:21:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Enhanced human detected.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:21.99,0:21:23.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}超强强度
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.99,0:21:23.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Superior strength.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:24.03,0:21:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}超强敏捷
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.03,0:21:26.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Superior agility.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:26.16,0:21:27.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}敏锐的感官
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.16,0:21:27.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Heightened senses.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:27.87,0:21:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外源DNA 蛛形纲动物
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.87,0:21:30.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Exogenous DNA. Arachnid.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:31.66,0:21:33.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请摘下面具进行身份验证
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.66,0:21:33.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please remove your face covering for identity scan.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 不行 我不能这样做
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.00,0:21:35.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, I can't do that.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:35.29,0:21:37.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这不可能 -不摘下面具……
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.29,0:21:37.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-That's not possible.   -Failure to remove your face covering
Dialogue: 2,0:21:37.42,0:21:39.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}将导致采取防御措施
Dialogue: 1,0:21:37.42,0:21:39.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}will result in defensive measures.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:39.42,0:21:41.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}防御措施？ 你在说什么……
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.42,0:21:41.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Defensive measures? What are you talk. . .
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.34,0:21:42.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:42.38,0:21:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}各位！ 我不能脱下面具 我……
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.38,0:21:44.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Guys, guys, I can't take my mask off. I'm. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:21:44.80,0:21:46.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.80,0:21:46.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:46.93,0:21:49.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没事 放松
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.93,0:21:49.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-He's all right. At ease.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:53.56,0:21:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.56,0:21:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My apologies.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:55.52,0:21:56.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们很高兴你来了这里
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.52,0:21:56.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We are so glad you're here.
Dialogue: 2,0:21:57.27,0:21:59.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比尔 梅茨格 损管局局长 你好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.27,0:21:59.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bill Metzger, Director of Damage Control. How are you?
Dialogue: 2,0:21:59.98,0:22:01.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很好 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.98,0:22:01.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm good, thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:01.57,0:22:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们必须加强这里的保安…… 但我希望我们没有吓到你
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.57,0:22:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We had to beef up security around here, but I hope we didn't give you a fright.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:04.32,0:22:06.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一点都没有 -好 走吧 这边请
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.32,0:22:06.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, not at all.   -All right, come on. This way.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:08.16,0:22:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一层主要用于科研和行政办公
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.16,0:22:10.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This floor is mostly research and administrative.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:11.04,0:22:14.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}楼下是事故清理部门· 实验室和特工培训室
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.04,0:22:14.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Downstairs, we have incident cleanup, laboratories, agent training.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.62,0:22:16.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:16.13,0:22:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿 他们在这里干什么？  -没事
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.13,0:22:17.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, what are they doing here?   -It's okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:18.80,0:22:20.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}手合会 现在替我们工作
Dialogue: 1,0:22:18.80,0:22:20.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The Hand works for us now.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:20.92,0:22:22.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你抓他们进来后 我发觉……
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.92,0:22:22.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}After you brought them in, I realized that
Dialogue: 2,0:22:22.68,0:22:25.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}基本上 他们是一群没有领导者的孩子
Dialogue: 1,0:22:22.68,0:22:25.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}fundamentally, they're a group of kids without a leader.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:25.26,0:22:27.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们需要的只是一点指引
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.26,0:22:27.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All they needed was a little direction.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:27.26,0:22:29.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}突然间 所有让他们变得危险的因素……
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.26,0:22:29.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Then, suddenly, all the things that made them dangerous
Dialogue: 2,0:22:29.22,0:22:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都变成了 我们安保团队中不可或缺的一部分
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.22,0:22:31.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}turned them into an invaluable part of our security team.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:37.27,0:22:40.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以视我们面临的诸多威胁 都是危险的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.27,0:22:40.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You can look at the many threats that face us and see only danger.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.40,0:22:42.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或你能从中看到机会
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.40,0:22:42.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Or you can see opportunity.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:44.03,0:22:45.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.03,0:22:45.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:49.99,0:22:51.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇 看那个
Dialogue: 1,0:22:49.99,0:22:51.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow, look at that.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:52.04,0:22:54.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在震动人手中 这些东西成了累赘
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.04,0:22:54.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}In the hands of Shocker, these are a nuisance.
Dialogue: 2,0:22:56.46,0:22:58.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这并不意味着 我们不能从这项技术中学习
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.46,0:22:58.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But it doesn't mean we can't learn from the technology,
Dialogue: 2,0:22:58.25,0:22:59.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者尊重这项创新
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.25,0:22:59.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}or respect the innovation.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.63,0:23:04.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的使命是将破坏性能量 转化为有用的能量
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.63,0:23:04.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Our mission is to redirect destructive energy into something useful.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:04.72,0:23:06.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是损管局的真正含义
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.72,0:23:06.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the true meaning of Damage Control.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:11.76,0:23:12.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要小心那东西
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.76,0:23:12.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Be careful with that.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.89,0:23:14.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这边
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.89,0:23:14.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Right this way.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:18.40,0:23:19.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要和你谈
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.40,0:23:19.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I, uh. . . I wanted to talk to you
Dialogue: 2,0:23:19.77,0:23:21.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于贵局近期遭受的攻击
Dialogue: 1,0:23:19.77,0:23:21.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}about the recent attacks on the agency.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:21.90,0:23:23.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}四次 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.90,0:23:23.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There's been four, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:23:23.82,0:23:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请坐
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.82,0:23:24.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please have a seat.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:26.03,0:23:27.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得对
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.03,0:23:27.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You are right.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:27.95,0:23:30.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来我们面临着无法控制的威胁
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.95,0:23:30.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It appears we're faced with a threat we can't control.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:30.99,0:23:32.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一种我们甚至看不见的威胁
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.99,0:23:32.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}One we can't even see.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.87,0:23:36.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是你可以
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.87,0:23:36.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But you can.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:36.96,0:23:38.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看了监控录像
Dialogue: 1,0:23:36.96,0:23:38.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw the security footage.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我还看了德沃尔夫警探的报告
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.04,0:23:42.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I also read Detective DeWolff's report.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:43.21,0:23:45.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我相信你完全明白我们面临的挑战
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.21,0:23:45.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I believe you understand exactly what we're up against.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:45.72,0:23:49.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个能够进入人们思想的人或事物
Dialogue: 1,0:23:45.72,0:23:49.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Someone or something that can hop into people's minds.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:50.55,0:23:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是进不去你的
Dialogue: 1,0:23:50.55,0:23:51.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But not yours.
Dialogue: 2,0:23:51.64,0:23:54.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 它尝试了 但是不能
Dialogue: 1,0:23:51.64,0:23:54.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I mean, it tried, but it couldn't.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:03.52,0:24:05.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要老实对你说
Dialogue: 1,0:24:03.52,0:24:05.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna be honest with you.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:05.94,0:24:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在处境非常不利
Dialogue: 1,0:24:05.94,0:24:07.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We're on our heels right now.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:08.40,0:24:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果它真的进来了 并且找到了它想要的东西
Dialogue: 1,0:24:08.40,0:24:11.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}God forbid if it were to get in here and find whatever it is it's looking for,
Dialogue: 2,0:24:11.28,0:24:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那后果将不堪设想
Dialogue: 1,0:24:11.28,0:24:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}the consequences could be unimaginable.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:17.79,0:24:20.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我猜看／它要找的东西就在那巨大的金库里？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:17.79,0:24:20.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, let me guess, is whatever it's looking for／in that giant vault?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:23.71,0:24:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些东西 因为我的工作性质
Dialogue: 1,0:24:23.71,0:24:25.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There are some things, because of the nature of my job
Dialogue: 2,0:24:26.05,0:24:27.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能告诉你
Dialogue: 1,0:24:26.05,0:24:27.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I cannot tell you.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:27.80,0:24:30.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是我相信你是我们最佳的防御机制
Dialogue: 1,0:24:27.80,0:24:30.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But I believe you are our best defense against this.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:30.68,0:24:32.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是唯一能感觉到它的人
Dialogue: 1,0:24:30.68,0:24:32.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the only one who can sense it.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:32.68,0:24:34.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是唯一对它免疫的人
Dialogue: 1,0:24:32.68,0:24:34.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the only one who's immune to it.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:34.72,0:24:36.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我指望你打败它
Dialogue: 1,0:24:34.72,0:24:36.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm counting on you to defeat it.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:39.90,0:24:41.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}局长 你说得真好
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.90,0:24:41.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a pretty good speech, Director.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:42.73,0:24:44.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会尽力而为 我答应你
Dialogue: 1,0:24:42.73,0:24:44.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll do everything that I can, I promise.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:45.90,0:24:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么你就是损管局的朋友了
Dialogue: 1,0:24:45.90,0:24:48.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, then consider yourself a friend of Damage Control.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:48.28,0:24:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:24:48.28,0:24:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:50.24,0:24:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会联络你
Dialogue: 1,0:24:50.24,0:24:51.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 2,0:24:52.57,0:24:54.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想问……
Dialogue: 1,0:24:52.57,0:24:54.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Uh, I wanted to ask, um. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:24:55.54,0:24:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对 "V-Max 这个词有什么概念吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:55.54,0:24:58.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}the phrase "V-Max" doesn't mean anything to you, does it?
Dialogue: 2,0:24:59.62,0:25:02.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有 你从哪儿听来的？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:59.62,0:25:02.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Where'd you hear that?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:02.50,0:25:05.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是 你明白的 因为超级英雄这个身份的性质
Dialogue: 1,0:25:02.50,0:25:05.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, it's just, you know, nature of being a superhero,
Dialogue: 2,0:25:05.42,0:25:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有些东西我是不能告诉你的
Dialogue: 1,0:25:05.42,0:25:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}there are some things I just can't tell ya.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:08.09,0:25:09.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无论如何 我们会再见
Dialogue: 1,0:25:08.09,0:25:09.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway, I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:10.43,0:25:11.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们做得很好 加油
Dialogue: 1,0:25:10.43,0:25:11.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You guys are doing great. Keep it up.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:12.34,0:25:14.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不认为梅茨格知道的比我们多……
Dialogue: 1,0:25:12.34,0:25:14.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think Metzger knows any more than we do,
Dialogue: 2,0:25:14.51,0:25:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉他 我会尽我所能提供帮助
Dialogue: 1,0:25:14.51,0:25:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but I told him I'd do whatever I can to help.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:16.64,0:25:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想帮忙吗？ 你能做的最好的事·
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.64,0:25:19.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanna help? The best thing you could do
Dialogue: 2,0:25:19.10,0:25:21.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是找到蝎子 他是我们唯一的线索
Dialogue: 1,0:25:19.10,0:25:21.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}is find Scorpion. He's our only lead.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:21.31,0:25:25.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道 我已经让全城所有的摄像头·／都对他进行面部识别扫描了
Dialogue: 1,0:25:21.31,0:25:25.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I know. I have every camera in the city／running a facial recognition scan for him.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:25.61,0:25:28.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠 这听起来非常违法 我就当没听见吧
Dialogue: 1,0:25:25.61,0:25:28.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That sounds super illegal, Spider-Man. I'mma pretend I didn't hear that.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:28.99,0:25:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许这样最好
Dialogue: 1,0:25:28.99,0:25:30.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, probably for the best.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:30.45,0:25:31.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过他要是敢露面 我们就会发现他
Dialogue: 1,0:25:30.45,0:25:31.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But look, if he shows his face, we'll know.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:31.99,0:25:33.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们有迷你啤酒桶吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:25:31.99,0:25:33.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you have any mini-kegs?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:34.28,0:25:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在后面
Dialogue: 1,0:25:34.28,0:25:35.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Down at the end.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:35.53,0:25:36.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:25:35.53,0:25:36.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:39.79,0:25:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我稍后给你回电话
Dialogue: 1,0:25:39.79,0:25:40.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll call you back.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:43.12,0:25:45.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Aha.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:45.96,0:25:46.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}冷静
Dialogue: 1,0:25:45.96,0:25:46.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Easy.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:51.13,0:25:54.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们也有鲨鱼火能量饮料吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:25:51.13,0:25:54.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, uh, also, you got any Sharkfire Energy?
Dialogue: 2,0:25:54.64,0:25:56.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的
Dialogue: 1,0:25:54.64,0:25:56.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:56.01,0:25:57.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(鲨鱼火能量饮料）
Dialogue: 2,0:25:57.18,0:25:58.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不
Dialogue: 1,0:25:57.18,0:25:58.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:58.56,0:26:00.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不要 那东西会杀了你
Dialogue: 1,0:25:58.56,0:26:00.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want any. That stuff will kill you.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:00.77,0:26:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}期末考期间 我的朋友们都在喝这种东西
Dialogue: 1,0:26:00.77,0:26:02.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, all my friends were drinking them during finals
Dialogue: 2,0:26:02.48,0:26:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在他们都上瘾了
Dialogue: 1,0:26:02.48,0:26:03.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and now they're addicted.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:03.73,0:26:06.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我希望你别卖它给我
Dialogue: 1,0:26:03.73,0:26:06.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And so I'm gonna need you to not sell me any.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:06.82,0:26:07.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住我的脸
Dialogue: 1,0:26:06.82,0:26:07.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Memorize my face.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:09.15,0:26:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请不要把任何鲨鱼火卖给这个人
Dialogue: 1,0:26:09.15,0:26:12.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please do not sell this guy any Sharkfire.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:13.57,0:26:14.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 随便你
Dialogue: 1,0:26:13.57,0:26:14.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure. Whatever.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:15.70,0:26:16.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实 我要一瓶
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.70,0:26:16.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Actually, I'll take one.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:17.66,0:26:18.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最后一瓶
Dialogue: 1,0:26:17.66,0:26:18.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Last one.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:18.91,0:26:20.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者两瓶
Dialogue: 1,0:26:18.91,0:26:20.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe two.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:20.37,0:26:22.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后从此不要再卖给我
Dialogue: 1,0:26:20.37,0:26:22.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And then never sell me any.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:24.08,0:26:26.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死的
Dialogue: 1,0:26:24.08,0:26:26.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- Damn it.
Dialogue: 2,0:26:59.28,0:27:00.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喂 内德！
Dialogue: 1,0:26:59.28,0:27:00.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yo, Ned!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:00.54,0:27:01.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么？  -内德！
Dialogue: 1,0:27:00.54,0:27:01.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, what? Ned!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:01.91,0:27:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一给我 -好朋友 谢谢你
Dialogue: 1,0:27:01.91,0:27:03.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Give me that.   -Oh, my guy, appreciate you.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:03.62,0:27:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-走吧！  -好的 兄弟
Dialogue: 1,0:27:03.62,0:27:05.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Let's go!   -Yeah, man.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:05.25,0:27:06.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一走！ 一好！ 你们几点到的？
Dialogue: 1,0:27:05.25,0:27:06.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let'sgo!
Dialogue: 2,0:27:40.87,0:27:43.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你需要喝一杯 快拿
Dialogue: 1,0:27:40.87,0:27:43.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You need a drink. Take this, take this, take it.
Dialogue: 2,0:27:43.62,0:27:44.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:27:43.62,0:27:44.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:47.79,0:27:48.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:22.12,0:28:23.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（蜘蛛侠在欧洲多次被发现？
Dialogue: 2,0:28:23.83,0:28:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（他可能是英国人吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:28:25.20,0:28:26.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（蜘蛛侠揭秘 这位拉丁裔跑酷天才)
Dialogue: 2,0:28:26.58,0:28:27.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（会不会就是蛛网荡人？
Dialogue: 2,0:28:27.79,0:28:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(不是他)
Dialogue: 1,0:28:32.46,0:28:33.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:35.00,0:28:36.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Um. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:28:36.38,0:28:39.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来你偶然发现了我的壁板
Dialogue: 1,0:28:36.38,0:28:39.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}See you've stumbled across my board.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:39.26,0:28:40.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发誓 我绝对不是那种怪人
Dialogue: 1,0:28:39.26,0:28:40.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not one of those weirdos, I swear.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:41.34,0:28:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在高中时 他曾多次 救过我和我朋友的命
Dialogue: 1,0:28:41.34,0:28:43.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He actually saved me and my friends' lives a few times in high school.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:44.85,0:28:49.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真酷 -是的／从那时起 我一直在努力弄清楚他是谁
Dialogue: 1,0:28:44.85,0:28:49.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, cool. Yeah, yeah.／And ever since, I've just been trying to figure out who he is.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:49.39,0:28:53.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}并非要向世人揭露他的真面目 只是想知道 你明白吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:28:49.39,0:28:53.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Not to unmask him to the world or anything, just to know, you know?
Dialogue: 2,0:28:53.69,0:28:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}并希望能当面向他致谢
Dialogue: 1,0:28:53.69,0:28:55.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And to, hopefully, thank him face to face.
Dialogue: 2,0:28:58.49,0:29:01.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我开发了这个应用程序 来监控他的行踪
Dialogue: 1,0:28:58.49,0:29:01.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I actually created this app that monitors his sightings.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:02.16,0:29:03.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等 你开发了蜘蛛侠追踪器？
Dialogue: 1,0:29:02.16,0:29:03.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, you created Spidey Tracker?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:03.78,0:29:05.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你听说过它？ 很好
Dialogue: 1,0:29:03.78,0:29:05.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You heard of it? Nice.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:06.45,0:29:08.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠在哪里？
Dialogue: 1,0:29:06.45,0:29:08.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,0:29:08.12,0:29:10.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里有一个聊天室
Dialogue: 1,0:29:08.12,0:29:10.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Little chat room right there.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:10.29,0:29:12.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我们知道他肯定来自皇后区
Dialogue: 1,0:29:10.29,0:29:12.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, we know he's definitely from Queens.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:12.88,0:29:14.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这并不算什么惊天发现
Dialogue: 1,0:29:12.88,0:29:14.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Not the biggest revelation.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:14.59,0:29:19.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我已经缩小了范围· 锁定了两名主嫌
Dialogue: 1,0:29:14.59,0:29:19.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But I have been able to narrow it down to two prime suspects.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:20.09,0:29:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（罗杰 哈灵顿 科学）
Dialogue: 2,0:29:23.22,0:29:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 如果你知道他们是谁的话· 你肯定会大吃一惊
Dialogue: 1,0:29:23.22,0:29:26.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, if you knew who they were, it would really blow your mind.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:26.60,0:29:28.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我肯定
Dialogue: 1,0:29:26.60,0:29:28.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'msure.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:28.39,0:29:29.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}顺便一提 我是内德
Dialogue: 1,0:29:28.39,0:29:29.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ned, by the way.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:30.31,0:29:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……
Dialogue: 1,0:29:30.31,0:29:31.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I'm, um. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:29:31.52,0:29:33.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊 我们的家里大概有50人
Dialogue: 1,0:29:31.52,0:29:33.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}God, there's, like, people in our apartment.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:34.02,0:29:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从统计学角度来说…… 这表示他们当中 至少有两个是反社会人格者……
Dialogue: 1,0:29:34.02,0:29:36.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Statistically speaking, that means at least two of them are sociopaths,
Dialogue: 2,0:29:37.28,0:29:39.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这还挺酷的
Dialogue: 1,0:29:37.28,0:29:39.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-which is kind of cool.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:41.61,0:29:42.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这花真美
Dialogue: 1,0:29:41.61,0:29:42.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice flowers.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:43.82,0:29:47.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是乔迁礼物
Dialogue: 1,0:29:43.82,0:29:47.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, they're, uh, a housewarming gift.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:47.24,0:29:48.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真的吗？  -是的
Dialogue: 1,0:29:47.24,0:29:48.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Really?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:48.37,0:29:51.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}大多数人带啤酒和薯片
Dialogue: 1,0:29:48.37,0:29:51.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, okay. Most people just brought beer and chips.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:51.21,0:29:52.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}花很漂亮
Dialogue: 1,0:29:51.21,0:29:52.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's very nice.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:52.50,0:29:53.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是MJ
Dialogue: 1,0:29:52.50,0:29:53.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I'm MJ.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:54.67,0:29:58.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是……我是梅纳德
Dialogue: 1,0:29:54.67,0:29:58.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm, uh. . . uh, Maynard.
Dialogue: 2,0:29:59.01,0:30:00.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梅纳德
Dialogue: 1,0:29:59.01,0:30:00.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Maynard.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:01.13,0:30:03.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩不认识对方？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:01.13,0:30:03.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you two don't know each other?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:03.59,0:30:05.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我是邻居
Dialogue: 1,0:30:03.59,0:30:05.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, no, I'm a neighbor.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:05.64,0:30:06.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}友好的邻居
Dialogue: 1,0:30:05.64,0:30:06.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm, friendly neighbor.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:10.52,0:30:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:30:10.52,0:30:11.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:12.14,0:30:13.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}面试顺利吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:12.14,0:30:13.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, how was the interview?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:14.35,0:30:15.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要把花放进水里
Dialogue: 1,0:30:14.35,0:30:15.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna go put these in water.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:16.02,0:30:17.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}幸会 梅纳德 书呆子
Dialogue: 1,0:30:16.02,0:30:17.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It was nice to meet you, Maynard. Nerd.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:17.94,0:30:18.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梅纳德 是的
Dialogue: 1,0:30:17.94,0:30:18.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Maynard. Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:19.57,0:30:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:30:19.57,0:30:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:21.36,0:30:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去了吗？ 请告诉我说你去了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:21.36,0:30:24.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you go? Please tell me that you went.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:24.24,0:30:25.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 我去过了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:24.24,0:30:25.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. No, I went.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:25.45,0:30:26.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:25.45,0:30:26.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:26.99,0:30:28.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我拿到那份工作了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:26.99,0:30:28.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And I got the job.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:28.20,0:30:30.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天 MJ 太棒了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:28.20,0:30:30.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, MJ, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:30.41,0:30:32.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我拒绝了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:30.41,0:30:32.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I turned it down.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:32.29,0:30:33.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:32.29,0:30:33.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:33.54,0:30:35.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想为那些没有灵魂的公司工作
Dialogue: 1,0:30:33.54,0:30:35.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I don't wanna work for some soulless corporation.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:35.92,0:30:38.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们并非全都没有灵魂
Dialogue: 1,0:30:35.92,0:30:38.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They're not all soulless.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:39.76,0:30:41.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 他们大多都没有灵魂
Dialogue: 1,0:30:39.76,0:30:41.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. They're all mostly soulless.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:41.72,0:30:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难道你不想要医疗保险吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:41.72,0:30:43.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But don't you want, like, health insurance?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:43.68,0:30:45.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我当然要 但是要付出什么代价？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:43.68,0:30:45.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, of course I do. But at what cost?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:46.01,0:30:47.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}取决于您的自付额
Dialogue: 1,0:30:46.01,0:30:47.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Depends on your deductible.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:48.72,0:30:50.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说你的原则？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:48.72,0:30:50.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you mean, like, your principles?
Dialogue: 2,0:30:50.52,0:30:51.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是的 -对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:30:50.52,0:30:51.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes.   -Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:30:51.68,0:30:53.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道 我知道这听起很俗气·
Dialogue: 1,0:30:51.68,0:30:53.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. I Know it sounds cheesy,
Dialogue: 2,0:30:53.10,0:30:55.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是有些东西告诉我·
Dialogue: 1,0:30:53.10,0:30:55.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but something is just telling me
Dialogue: 2,0:30:55.52,0:30:59.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我应该等待…… 一些伟大的事 你知道吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:55.52,0:30:59.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}that I'm supposed to be waiting for something great, you know?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:00.23,0:31:04.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 敬等待一些伟大的事
Dialogue: 1,0:31:00.23,0:31:04.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Well, um, to, uh, waiting for something great.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:04.78,0:31:06.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等待美好的事物到来
Dialogue: 1,0:31:04.78,0:31:06.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}To waiting for something great.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:06.57,0:31:08.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等待结束了
Dialogue: 1,0:31:06.57,0:31:08.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, the wait is over.
