Dialogue: 1,0:31:08.78,0:31:10.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Uh-oh.   -To your new home.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:10.87,0:31:12.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}朋友 这是最棒的
Dialogue: 1,0:31:10.87,0:31:12.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dude, this is top-shelf.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:12.29,0:31:13.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像你
Dialogue: 1,0:31:12.29,0:31:13.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just like you.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:13.41,0:31:16.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Aw!   -Aw! Dude.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:16.71,0:31:18.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要把它藏起来
Dialogue: 1,0:31:16.71,0:31:18.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm gonna hide this.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:20.13,0:31:21.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又从他身上找到的
Dialogue: 1,0:31:20.13,0:31:21.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I lifted this off of him again.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:23.42,0:31:26.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果内德需要千条鲨鱼的能量呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:31:23.42,0:31:26.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But what if Ned needs the fire of a thousand sharks?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:26.13,0:31:28.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是指心悸吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:31:26.13,0:31:28.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-You mean heart palpitations?
Dialogue: 2,0:31:29.47,0:31:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你不可能拯救所有人 一我可以试试
Dialogue: 1,0:31:29.47,0:31:31.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-You can't save everyone.   -I can try.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:33.72,0:31:34.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是我的乖女孩
Dialogue: 1,0:31:33.72,0:31:34.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 2,0:31:51.37,0:31:52.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 我要……
Dialogue: 1,0:31:51.37,0:31:52.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. I gotta. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:32:13.52,0:32:16.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当我们进入麻省理工 我们应该一起住
Dialogue: 1,0:32:13.52,0:32:16.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}When we get into MIT, we should live together.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:17.06,0:32:18.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是的 当然 -好 我喜欢
Dialogue: 1,0:32:17.06,0:32:18.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, for sure. I'd love that.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:19.35,0:32:22.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}重新开始 我们在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:32:19.35,0:32:22.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Be a fresh start. And we'll all be together.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:23.78,0:32:25.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 你说得对
Dialogue: 1,0:32:23.78,0:32:25.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, no, you're right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:25.24,0:32:26.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}重新开始
Dialogue: 1,0:32:25.24,0:32:26.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fresh start.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:29.45,0:32:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会忘了我是谁
Dialogue: 1,0:32:29.45,0:32:30.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna forget who I am.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:31.62,0:32:33.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}忘了你？ 在说什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:31.62,0:32:33.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Forget who you are? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 2,0:32:33.49,0:32:37.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事 我会来找你…… 我会解释一切
Dialogue: 1,0:32:33.49,0:32:37.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay. I'm gonna come and find you, and I'll explain everything.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:38.96,0:32:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我爱……  -等等
Dialogue: 1,0:32:38.96,0:32:40.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I love. . .   -Just wait.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:41.46,0:32:43.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等待并在再见我的时候告诉我
Dialogue: 1,0:32:41.46,0:32:43.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait and tell me when you see me again.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:48.05,0:32:52.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我叫彼得 帕克 我要一杯咖啡
Dialogue: 1,0:32:48.05,0:32:52.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My name is Peter Parker, and I would like a coffee.
Dialogue: 2,0:32:52.64,0:32:53.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（我们很乐意招待你）
Dialogue: 2,0:32:53.72,0:32:55.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有别的吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:53.72,0:32:55.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there anything else?
Dialogue: 2,0:33:05.32,0:33:06.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有了
