Dialogue: 2,0:33:22.67,0:33:23.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（我叫彼得 帕克)
Dialogue: 2,0:33:23.88,0:33:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（你不记得我 但是我有一些-）
Dialogue: 1,0:34:08.05,0:34:08.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:10.38,0:34:11.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:13.68,0:34:17.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为你不必…… 再听我的话 因为你有超能力？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:13.68,0:34:17.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You think you don't have to listen to me now that you've got powers?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:22.23,0:34:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这整件事可以很可怕
Dialogue: 1,0:34:22.23,0:34:27.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, this. . . this whole thing can get really scary.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:28.19,0:34:29.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:34:28.19,0:34:29.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that?
Dialogue: 2,0:34:30.57,0:34:32.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 已经很可怕了
Dialogue: 1,0:34:30.57,0:34:32.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, yeah, it's already pretty scary.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:34.45,0:34:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的
Dialogue: 1,0:34:34.45,0:34:35.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:36.03,0:34:38.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且事情可以改变得很快·
Dialogue: 1,0:34:36.03,0:34:38.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And things can change, like. . . . . . very quickly,
Dialogue: 2,0:34:38.99,0:34:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以我们现在甚至无法想象的方式
Dialogue: 1,0:34:38.99,0:34:41.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}in ways that we can't even imagine right now.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:41.91,0:34:43.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我 我知道
Dialogue: 1,0:34:41.91,0:34:43.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Believe me, I Know.
Dialogue: 2,0:34:46.58,0:34:47.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不认为你知道
Dialogue: 1,0:34:46.58,0:34:47.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think you do know.
