Dialogue: 1,0:36:50.58,0:36:51.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, cute dog.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:51.88,0:36:52.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, sh. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:36:58.43,0:36:59.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,0:36:58.43,0:36:59.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
