Dialogue: 1,0:37:20.32,0:37:23.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi, Peter. You have new alerts.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:23.74,0:37:25.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请查看讯息
Dialogue: 1,0:37:23.74,0:37:25.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please check backlog.
