Dialogue: 1,0:37:31.83,0:37:35.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What is happening?
Dialogue: 2,0:37:35.63,0:37:39.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（人类蛛形纲动物）／你的身体扫描结果显示激素水平激增
Dialogue: 1,0:37:35.63,0:37:39.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The results of your body scan show a surge in the hormones
Dialogue: 2,0:37:39.42,0:37:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}与你的蛛形纲动物DNA有关……
Dialogue: 1,0:37:39.42,0:37:41.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}associated with your arachnid DNA,
Dialogue: 2,0:37:41.80,0:37:44.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(丝腺 吐丝器 有机丝网) 最终形成有机丝状吐丝器·
Dialogue: 1,0:37:41.80,0:37:44.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}resulting in the formation of organic web spinnerets
Dialogue: 2,0:37:44.76,0:37:47.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以及危险地增强感觉受体
Dialogue: 1,0:37:44.76,0:37:47.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and dangerously heightened sensory receptors.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:47.81,0:37:49.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 但是我感觉良好
Dialogue: 1,0:37:47.81,0:37:49.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- Okay, but I feel fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:37:50.14,0:37:53.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（为什么蜘蛛的眼睛 看起来是黑色的）／长期隔离或情感创伤 可能是导致这种突变的原因／
Dialogue: 1,0:37:50.14,0:37:53.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Prolonged isolation or emotional trauma／could be contributing to this
Dialogue: 2,0:37:53.94,0:37:57.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(感官超负荷的迹象） 你最近经历过什么创伤性事件吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:37:53.94,0:37:57.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}sudden change.／Have you experienced any recent traumatic events?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:00.57,0:38:01.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得？
Dialogue: 1,0:38:00.57,0:38:01.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Peter?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:02.20,0:38:03.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事 EV
Dialogue: 1,0:38:02.20,0:38:03.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm fine, E. V.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:03.82,0:38:05.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看起来不像没事
Dialogue: 1,0:38:03.82,0:38:05.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't seem fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:05.28,0:38:07.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我建议你花点时间重新平衡一下
Dialogue: 1,0:38:05.28,0:38:07.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I recommend you take -some time to rebalance.
Dialogue: 2,0:38:07.99,0:38:09.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那不是一个选项 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:38:07.99,0:38:09.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, that's not really an option, is it?
Dialogue: 2,0:38:26.26,0:38:28.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}机械式蛛丝发射器和有机蛛丝
Dialogue: 1,0:38:26.26,0:38:28.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Mechanical web shooters and organic webs
