Dialogue: 2,0:43:19.72,0:43:21.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快叫医护
Dialogue: 1,0:43:19.72,0:43:21.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Somebody get a medic.
