Dialogue: 1,0:43:43.87,0:43:44.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is she okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:45.29,0:43:46.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一她没事吧？ -不！
Dialogue: 1,0:43:45.29,0:43:46.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-ls she okay? No!
Dialogue: 2,0:43:46.71,0:43:48.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-放开我……  -不！ 你怎么搞的？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:46.71,0:43:48.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Just let me go. . .   -Don't! What is going on with you?
