Dialogue: 1,0:43:51.21,0:43:53.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but he was possessed by whatever hijacked that tank, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:43:54.05,0:43:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我可以……  -好了 你听好 冷静
Dialogue: 1,0:43:54.05,0:43:56.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Look, please can I just. . .   -All right, listen. Slow down.
