Dialogue: 1,0:44:03.10,0:44:04.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You almost killed a cop.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:07.40,0:44:08.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是你
Dialogue: 1,0:44:07.40,0:44:08.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This isn't you.
