Dialogue: 1,0:44:10.65,0:44:13.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If you act like this again, I cannot protect you.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:14.24,0:44:17.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管是什么 你必须处理好它
Dialogue: 1,0:44:14.24,0:44:17.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever this is, you need to fix it.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:38.26,0:44:40.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}通过晶格色动力学·
Dialogue: 1,0:44:38.26,0:44:40.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Through lattice chromodynamics,
Dialogue: 2,0:44:41.93,0:44:45.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以将时间和空间排列成网格状
Dialogue: 1,0:44:41.93,0:44:45.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}we can arrange time and space in a grid.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:45.72,0:44:50.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这使我们能够模拟…… 夸克与质子的结合
Dialogue: 1,0:44:45.72,0:44:50.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Which allows us to simulate the quarks binding into the protons.
