Dialogue: 1,0:44:51.73,0:44:53.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Cindy, is this a question about protons
Dialogue: 2,0:44:54.07,0:44:56.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是关于复仇者联盟的？
Dialogue: 1,0:44:54.07,0:44:56.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-or more stuff about Avengers?
Dialogue: 2,0:44:56.24,0:44:59.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 各位 我喜欢讲故事……
Dialogue: 1,0:44:56.24,0:44:59.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Guys, I love to tell stories,
Dialogue: 2,0:44:59.70,0:45:02.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你们也知道 在学校 我偶尔也得教你们一些物理知识
Dialogue: 1,0:44:59.70,0:45:02.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but you know I. . . I gotta teach you some physics at some point here.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:07.08,0:45:09.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 问吧 辛迪
Dialogue: 1,0:45:07.08,0:45:09.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Let it rip, Cindy.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:09.42,0:45:12.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果灭霸那么担心人口过剩……
Dialogue: 1,0:45:09.42,0:45:12.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If Thanos was so worried about over-population,
Dialogue: 2,0:45:12.67,0:45:15.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他为什么不直接用魔法手套 制造更多食物呢？
