Dialogue: 1,0:45:19.76,0:45:21.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Arthur, you wanna answer that question?
Dialogue: 2,0:45:22.72,0:45:26.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}浩克 砸！
Dialogue: 1,0:45:22.72,0:45:26.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hulk smash!
Dialogue: 2,0:45:29.73,0:45:30.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是答案
Dialogue: 1,0:45:29.73,0:45:30.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There you have it.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:31.44,0:45:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}打扰一下 班纳博士 我……
Dialogue: 1,0:45:31.44,0:45:34.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Uh, excuse me, Dr. Banner, I, um. . .
Dialogue: 1,0:45:35.32,0:45:36.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:45:36.86,0:45:41.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你还好吗？  -不好意思 只是头疼／你有时间吗？ 我想和你谈谈你的抑制器
Dialogue: 1,0:45:36.86,0:45:41.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-You okay?   -Yeah, sorry, it's just a headache.／Um, have you got a minute? I wanted to talk to you about your inhibitor.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:42.45,0:45:46.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然可以 别担心 它有安全保障措施
Dialogue: 1,0:45:42.45,0:45:46.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Sure. Don't worry. It's got fail-safes.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:46.45,0:45:50.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会在食堂 变成那个绿色的大型狂暴怪物机器
Dialogue: 1,0:45:46.45,0:45:50.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna turn into the big green raging monster machine in the cafeteria.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:51.21,0:45:53.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但如果你看到 我把这东西摘下来 赶紧跑
Dialogue: 1,0:45:51.21,0:45:53.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But if you do see me with this thing off, run.
Dialogue: 2,0:45:57.26,0:46:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 但是你使用的是靶向特异性…… 短干扰RNA 对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:57.26,0:46:00.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, but you're using target-specific short interfering RNA, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:02.05,0:46:04.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就像抑制基因一样· 你只是把伽马射线也加进去了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:02.05,0:46:04.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like gene silencing, you're just incorporating the gamma radiation?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:07.60,0:46:08.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说你叫什么名字？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:07.60,0:46:08.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What'd you say your name was?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:10.02,0:46:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}内德利兹
Dialogue: 1,0:46:10.02,0:46:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, Ned. . . Leeds.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:13.27,0:46:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你找到了抑制DNA表达的方法·
Dialogue: 1,0:46:13.27,0:46:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So you found a way to suppress the expression of DNA
Dialogue: 2,0:46:16.40,0:46:19.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使它因为伽马射线…… 正在发生突变 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:16.40,0:46:19.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}even as it's undergoing the mutation due to gamma radiation, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:19.44,0:46:21.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一是的 一好 那我的问题是……
Dialogue: 1,0:46:19.44,0:46:21.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yes.   -Okay, SO my question is,
Dialogue: 2,0:46:22.74,0:46:27.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果DNA因其他原因发生突变 是否也会出现同样的情况？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:22.74,0:46:27.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}would that same thing be possible with DNA that's mutating for another reason?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:29.74,0:46:30.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么原因？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:29.74,0:46:30.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What's the reason?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:32.25,0:46:34.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道
Dialogue: 1,0:46:32.25,0:46:34.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. Uh. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:46:34.79,0:46:38.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}假设宿主基因组…… 与某种外来DNA混合在一起
Dialogue: 1,0:46:34.79,0:46:38.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's say that the. . . the host genome is mixed with some kind of foreign DNA.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:38.84,0:46:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理论上
Dialogue: 1,0:46:38.84,0:46:39.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Theoretically.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:41.01,0:46:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}理论上？ 是的 那有可能
Dialogue: 1,0:46:41.01,0:46:43.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Theoretically? Yes, that's possible. Yes.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:44.59,0:46:47.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么 能否只抑制部分DNA表达呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:44.59,0:46:47.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, could you suppress only some parts of that DNA expression?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:47.93,0:46:50.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比如抑制有害的部分 只保留好的部分？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:47.93,0:46:50.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like the bad aspects but just keep all of the good stuff?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:51.35,0:46:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说…… 如果我只想保留浩克部分特质？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:51.35,0:46:54.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You mean, like, if I wanted to keep some parts of Hulk but not others?
Dialogue: 2,0:46:54.44,0:46:55.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对
Dialogue: 1,0:46:54.44,0:46:55.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 2,0:46:55.86,0:47:00.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这将极其危险且复杂 但是……
Dialogue: 1,0:46:55.86,0:47:00.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It would be enormously dangerous and complex, but. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:47:01.36,0:47:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你能够靶向正确的mRNA链·
Dialogue: 1,0:47:01.36,0:47:05.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}if you were able to target the correct MRNA strand. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:47:06.03,0:47:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有可能
Dialogue: 1,0:47:06.03,0:47:07.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Possibly.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:07.20,0:47:09.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等 所以你可以 开启或关闭这个突变基因·
Dialogue: 1,0:47:07.20,0:47:09.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, so you could just turn the mutating gene on and off
Dialogue: 2,0:47:09.74,0:47:12.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要你在mRNA转变之前 进行就行了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:09.74,0:47:12.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}as long as you do it before the mRNA transcription?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:12.91,0:47:13.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有可能
Dialogue: 1,0:47:12.91,0:47:13.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:16.17,0:47:18.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你运用同样的思路 你甚至可以·
Dialogue: 1,0:47:16.17,0:47:18.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, if you apply the same thinking, you could even. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:47:19.09,0:47:21.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开发出某种自动抑制机制……
Dialogue: 1,0:47:19.09,0:47:21.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}develop some kind of automatic inhibitor
Dialogue: 2,0:47:21.21,0:47:24.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以适应任何类型的突变
Dialogue: 1,0:47:21.21,0:47:24.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}that would just adjust to any type of mutation.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:25.26,0:47:28.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在你说的是一种能够通用抑制器.·
Dialogue: 1,0:47:25.26,0:47:28.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, now you're talking about a universal inhibitor
Dialogue: 2,0:47:28.18,0:47:31.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以控制任何拥有超能力的人
Dialogue: 1,0:47:28.18,0:47:31.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}that would control anyone who has any powers.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:32.68,0:47:33.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是一个危险的想法
Dialogue: 1,0:47:32.68,0:47:33.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a dangerous idea.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:35.10,0:47:37.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 但是只是理论上 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:35.10,0:47:37.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, yeah. But it's theoretical, right?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:39.82,0:47:41.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不是我的学生 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:39.82,0:47:41.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not one of my students, are ya?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:43.82,0:47:45.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我是一名研究生
Dialogue: 1,0:47:43.82,0:47:45.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-No. I'm a grad student.   -Hmm.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:46.16,0:47:48.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……
Dialogue: 1,0:47:46.16,0:47:48.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I've, uh. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:47:48.24,0:47:49.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经占用你太多时间了
Dialogue: 1,0:47:48.24,0:47:49.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I've taken enough of your time.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:49.41,0:47:51.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得去图书馆还几本书
Dialogue: 1,0:47:49.41,0:47:51.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I gotta get some books back to the library.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:51.91,0:47:53.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}图书馆在那边
Dialogue: 1,0:47:51.91,0:47:53.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The library is that way.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:55.25,0:47:57.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对 是的
Dialogue: 1,0:47:55.25,0:47:57.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Duh.
Dialogue: 2,0:47:57.50,0:47:58.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会如何决定？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:57.50,0:47:58.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How would you decide?
Dialogue: 2,0:47:59.71,0:48:00.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:59.71,0:48:00.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What'sthat?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:01.80,0:48:03.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么样的特性算好 什么样的算坏？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:01.80,0:48:03.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what parts of nature are good or bad?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:04.59,0:48:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你试图控制某种 需要表达的部分呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:04.59,0:48:08.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What if you're trying to control the expression of something that needs to be expressed?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:14.39,0:48:15.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你学习好运 内德
Dialogue: 1,0:48:14.39,0:48:15.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck with your studies, Ned.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:17.85,0:48:19.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你 教授
Dialogue: 1,0:48:17.85,0:48:19.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Professor.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:20.11,0:48:21.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像爬行动物……
Dialogue: 1,0:48:20.11,0:48:21.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like reptiles. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:48:21.27,0:48:24.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一天啊 两栖动物和节肢动物· （抑制器原型 2.1 一制造进度）／蜘蛛在其生命周期的
Dialogue: 1,0:48:21.27,0:48:24.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, God.   -. . . amphibians and arthropods,／spiders
Dialogue: 2,0:48:24.15,0:48:27.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关键阶段会蜕皮
Dialogue: 1,0:48:24.15,0:48:27.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}shed skin -at key points in their life cycles.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:27.28,0:48:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个过程被称为蜕皮
Dialogue: 1,0:48:27.28,0:48:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-The process is known as molting.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:29.45,0:48:31.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}第四抑制器原型已完成
Dialogue: 1,0:48:29.45,0:48:31.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fourth inhibitor prototype complete.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:31.99,0:48:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜕皮是一个自然的·
Dialogue: 1,0:48:31.99,0:48:33.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}While molting is a natural
Dialogue: 2,0:48:33.16,0:48:35.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是蜘蛛生命周期的一部分· 一好 拜托
Dialogue: 1,0:48:33.16,0:48:35.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-part of a spider's life cycle. . . Okay, come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:35.54,0:48:37.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这会让蜘蛛变得容易受到威胁
Dialogue: 1,0:48:35.54,0:48:37.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}. . . /f can leave the spider vulnerable to threats.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:37.58,0:48:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}上传第七次制造的抑制器测试版
Dialogue: 1,0:48:37.58,0:48:39.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Upload inhibitor beta build seven.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:40.00,0:48:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这一过程是由激素变化引发的·
Dialogue: 1,0:48:40.00,0:48:41.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}. . . process is initiated by hormonal changes. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:48:41.38,0:48:43.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已上传 你想进行测试吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:48:41.38,0:48:43.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uploaded. Would you like to run a test?
Dialogue: 2,0:48:44.17,0:48:45.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 跑吧
Dialogue: 1,0:48:44.17,0:48:45.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, run it.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:45.26,0:48:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几小时到几天／(编译固件)／蜘蛛的生命周期分为三个阶段
Dialogue: 1,0:48:45.26,0:48:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}. . . few hours to several days.／Spiders have three stages in their life cycle.
Dialogue: 2,0:48:50.97,0:48:54.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每个阶段都以不同的生理变化为特征
Dialogue: 1,0:48:50.97,0:48:54.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Each stage is characterized by physical changes,
Dialogue: 2,0:48:54.26,0:48:59.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其中最大的变化发生在 美丽的成虫期
Dialogue: 1,0:48:54.26,0:48:59.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}with the largest changes occurring during the beautiful transition to adulthood.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:02.06,0:49:03.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成功熬过的蜘蛛……
Dialogue: 1,0:49:02.06,0:49:03.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}For those who make it through,
Dialogue: 2,0:49:03.94,0:49:06.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜕皮相当于一种重生
Dialogue: 1,0:49:03.94,0:49:06.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}molting amounts to a kind of rebirth.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:06.32,0:49:07.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以关掉那蜘蛛视频吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:49:06.32,0:49:07.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you turn that spider stuff off?
Dialogue: 2,0:49:07.78,0:49:09.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关掉视频
Dialogue: 1,0:49:07.78,0:49:09.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Turning off video.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:10.03,0:49:11.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-抑制器已激活 一好 来吧
Dialogue: 1,0:49:10.03,0:49:11.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-lnhibitor active.   -Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:11.57,0:49:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托
Dialogue: 1,0:49:11.57,0:49:13.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:14.49,0:49:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}留意我的生命体征
Dialogue: 1,0:49:14.49,0:49:16.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep an eye on my vitals.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:18.46,0:49:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抑制器已激活
Dialogue: 1,0:49:18.46,0:49:20.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Inhibitor engaged.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:23.96,0:49:27.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}将蛛形纲动物激素 抑制到你的基础水平 （人类蛛形纲动物激素水平）
Dialogue: 1,0:49:23.96,0:49:27.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Suppressing arachnid hormones to your baseline levels.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:30.43,0:49:31.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,0:49:30.43,0:49:31.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:35.47,0:49:37.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 EV 我们开始吧
Dialogue: 1,0:49:35.47,0:49:37.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, E. V. , let's do this.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:37.06,0:49:39.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}启动现场测试一
Dialogue: 1,0:49:37.06,0:49:39.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Initiating field test one.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:40.98,0:49:46.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这行得通／警告 抑制器过热 功能正在降低
Dialogue: 1,0:49:40.98,0:49:46.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's working. Alert.／-lnhibitor is overheating. Functionality reducing.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:46.19,0:49:47.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 我感觉到
Dialogue: 1,0:49:46.19,0:49:47.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm sensing that.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:47.98,0:49:54.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}警告 感官超负荷运转
Dialogue: 1,0:49:47.98,0:49:54.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Alert. Senses are overloaded.   -Senses are overloaded.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:54.16,0:49:56.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蛛丝炸弹已启动
Dialogue: 1,0:49:54.16,0:49:56.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Web grenades activated.
Dialogue: 2,0:49:58.70,0:50:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了
Dialogue: 1,0:49:58.70,0:50:00.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, sh. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:50:12.18,0:50:14.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抑制器实地测试一 失败
Dialogue: 1,0:50:12.18,0:50:14.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Inhibitor field test one, failure.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:17.39,0:50:20.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:17.39,0:50:20.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yo, Spider-Man, you okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:20.89,0:50:22.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事 我只是在尝试一些新科技
Dialogue: 1,0:50:20.89,0:50:22.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I'm just trying out some new tech.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:23.52,0:50:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了去除在你体内的怪物？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:23.52,0:50:26.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah. To get rid of that monster inside you?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:31.86,0:50:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是没能感觉到我吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:31.86,0:50:33.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Still can't sense me, huh?
Dialogue: 2,0:50:34.95,0:50:36.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜你的科技不管用
Dialogue: 1,0:50:34.95,0:50:36.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Guess your technology isn't working.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:37.99,0:50:40.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我唯一遇过·
Dialogue: 1,0:50:37.99,0:50:40.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, you're the only person I've met that I can't. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:50:41.37,0:50:42.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能进入的人
Dialogue: 1,0:50:41.37,0:50:42.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}hop into.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:43.42,0:50:45.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我肯定这令你很懊恼
Dialogue: 1,0:50:43.42,0:50:45.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sure that's really frustrating for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:45.50,0:50:46.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}终有一天我能进去
Dialogue: 1,0:50:45.50,0:50:46.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I'll get in there one day.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:47.00,0:50:48.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:47.00,0:50:48.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:48.25,0:50:49.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:50.00,0:50:55.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想知道为何一个半人 半蜘蛛的人决定帮一个
Dialogue: 1,0:50:50.00,0:50:55.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanna know why a half-human, half-spider would decide to work for an organization
Dialogue: 2,0:50:55.51,0:50:59.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}追捕任何与众不同的人的机构
Dialogue: 1,0:50:55.51,0:50:59.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}whose sworn mission is to hunt down anybody who's different.
Dialogue: 2,0:50:59.14,0:51:02.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}损管局不是因为你与众不同而追捕你
Dialogue: 1,0:50:59.14,0:51:02.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damage Control isn't after you because you're different.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:03.35,0:51:05.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们追捕你因为你很危险
Dialogue: 1,0:51:03.35,0:51:05.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They're hunting you down because you're dangerous.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:05.31,0:51:06.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在你想要什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:51:05.31,0:51:06.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, what do you want?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:07.61,0:51:11.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}既然你是一只笨蜘蛛 让我解释给你听
Dialogue: 1,0:51:07.61,0:51:11.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Since you're a very simple spider, let me spell it out for you.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:12.78,0:51:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}损管局有我要的东西
Dialogue: 1,0:51:12.78,0:51:15.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damage Control has something that I need.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:16.12,0:51:17.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦 你是说V-Max吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:51:16.12,0:51:17.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you mean V-Max?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:20.49,0:51:23.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我计划利用蝎子获得它 但是你一直挡住我
Dialogue: 1,0:51:20.49,0:51:23.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I was planning to use Scorpion to get it, but you keep getting in my way.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:24.46,0:51:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会一直挡住你
Dialogue: 1,0:51:24.46,0:51:26.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I will always be in your way.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:27.04,0:51:29.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你确定吗 彼得 帕克？
Dialogue: 1,0:51:27.04,0:51:29.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you sure about that, Peter Parker?
Dialogue: 2,0:51:34.80,0:51:37.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的公寓简直就像个讽刺剧·
Dialogue: 1,0:51:34.80,0:51:37.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, your apartment is kinda like a parody
Dialogue: 2,0:51:37.97,0:51:41.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个悲伤的20多岁单身汉会住的地方
Dialogue: 1,0:51:37.97,0:51:41.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}of where you think a sad single guy in his 20s might live.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:41.72,0:51:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}外卖盒、重量训练器械、蛋白粉
Dialogue: 1,0:51:41.72,0:51:46.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Take-out containers, free weights, protein powder.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:51.28,0:51:52.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说谎
Dialogue: 1,0:51:51.28,0:51:52.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're bluffing.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:52.69,0:51:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得 你很容易找到
Dialogue: 1,0:51:52.69,0:51:54.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, you're not hard to track down, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:55.20,0:51:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少对我来说不难
Dialogue: 1,0:51:55.20,0:51:58.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, at least not for someone like me.
Dialogue: 2,0:51:59.53,0:52:01.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不过我确实发现了一件有趣的事情
Dialogue: 1,0:51:59.53,0:52:01.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I did find one interesting thing, though.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:01.70,0:52:02.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（我们很乐意招待你）
Dialogue: 2,0:52:02.87,0:52:04.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}偏偏在一个奇怪的地方
Dialogue: 1,0:52:02.87,0:52:04.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}In of all places. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:52:06.37,0:52:07.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有个咖啡杯
Dialogue: 1,0:52:06.37,0:52:07.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}coffee cup.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:10.04,0:52:11.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}EV 展示家居工作站
Dialogue: 1,0:52:10.04,0:52:11.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}E. V. , display home work station.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:14.30,0:52:17.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你花了四年时间 试图将彼得 帕克从世上抹去？
Dialogue: 1,0:52:14.30,0:52:17.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You spent four years erasing Peter Parker from existence?
Dialogue: 2,0:52:18.76,0:52:21.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难怪蜘蛛想要吞噬宿主
Dialogue: 1,0:52:18.76,0:52:21.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No wonder the spider's trying to swallow up the man.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:21.89,0:52:23.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我怀疑MJ是否还能认出你
Dialogue: 1,0:52:21.89,0:52:23.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I wonder if MJ would even recognize you.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:27.31,0:52:28.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我应该去看看她怎么样了
Dialogue: 1,0:52:27.31,0:52:28.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I might go see how she's doing.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:29.02,0:52:30.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我绝不会允许它发生
Dialogue: 1,0:52:29.02,0:52:30.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna let that happen.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:30.23,0:52:32.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 她的室友挺好的……
Dialogue: 1,0:52:30.23,0:52:32.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, her roommate was nice enough
Dialogue: 2,0:52:32.23,0:52:34.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把新地址发布到了网上
Dialogue: 1,0:52:32.23,0:52:34.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-to post a new address online.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:34.44,0:52:37.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样如何？ 我们比赛看谁先到
Dialogue: 1,0:52:34.44,0:52:37.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How about this? I'll race you there.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:37.61,0:52:38.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你碰她……
Dialogue: 1,0:52:37.61,0:52:38.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If you touch her. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:52:39.28,0:52:40.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最好开始摆荡了
Dialogue: 1,0:52:39.28,0:52:40.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Better start swinging.
Dialogue: 2,0:52:40.95,0:52:42.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很快
Dialogue: 1,0:52:40.95,0:52:42.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'mfast.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:05.68,0:53:06.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:06.85,0:53:08.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去MJ家路途遥远
Dialogue: 1,0:53:06.85,0:53:08.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's a long way to MJ's.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:08.98,0:53:11.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你最好加快速度
Dialogue: 1,0:53:08.98,0:53:11.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-You better pick up the pace.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:18.36,0:53:20.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}EV 追踪生理异常情况
Dialogue: 1,0:53:18.36,0:53:20.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}E. V. , track physical anomalies.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:21.53,0:53:24.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}寻找众人之间的生理异常
Dialogue: 1,0:53:21.53,0:53:24.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Searching for physical anomalies -between subjects.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:24.58,0:53:25.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}请候命
Dialogue: 1,0:53:24.58,0:53:25.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please stand by.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:30.46,0:53:32.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感谢各位今天的光临
Dialogue: 1,0:53:30.46,0:53:32.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you all so much for coming today.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:38.55,0:53:40.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很抱歉
Dialogue: 1,0:53:38.55,0:53:40.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh. . . I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:41.05,0:53:43.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为蜘蛛侠欢呼.·
Dialogue: 1,0:53:41.05,0:53:43.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Give it up for Spider-Man,
Dialogue: 2,0:53:43.10,0:53:46.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了他生命中的挚爱而奋力拼搏 但情况不太乐观
Dialogue: 1,0:53:43.10,0:53:46.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}in a race for the love of his life, and it's not looking good.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:48.60,0:53:50.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}加油 蜘蛛侠 跟上！
Dialogue: 1,0:53:48.60,0:53:50.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, Spidey. Keep up.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:51.94,0:53:52.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉 对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:53:51.94,0:53:52.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me. Sorry.
Dialogue: 2,0:53:56.78,0:53:58.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(新婚 约翰与露西)
Dialogue: 2,0:54:01.82,0:54:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,0:54:01.82,0:54:02.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:06.49,0:54:08.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}EV 把这些数据和其他数据一起比对
Dialogue: 1,0:54:06.49,0:54:08.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}E. V. , run these numbers with the others.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:11.62,0:54:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}分析跳跃距离的规律
Dialogue: 1,0:54:11.62,0:54:14.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Analyzing jump distances for patterns.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:16.34,0:54:17.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把跳跃数据给我
Dialogue: 1,0:54:16.34,0:54:17.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get me that jump data.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:18.09,0:54:19.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}计算中
Dialogue: 1,0:54:18.09,0:54:19.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Calculating.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:22.97,0:54:24.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快 我需要答案！
Dialogue: 1,0:54:22.97,0:54:24.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, I need an answer!
Dialogue: 2,0:54:26.22,0:54:27.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}计算完成
Dialogue: 1,0:54:26.22,0:54:27.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Calculations complete.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:43.40,0:54:45.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的跳跃半径是有限制的 对吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:54:43.40,0:54:45.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You have a limit to your jump radius, don't ya?
Dialogue: 2,0:54:46.16,0:54:47.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}十米
Dialogue: 1,0:54:46.16,0:54:47.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thirty-three feet.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:48.24,0:54:50.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没看到上面这里有谁可以让你附身
Dialogue: 1,0:54:48.24,0:54:50.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't see anybody up here for you to hop into.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:51.87,0:54:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}非常聪明
Dialogue: 1,0:54:51.87,0:54:53.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Very clever.
Dialogue: 2,0:54:53.46,0:54:56.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正如我所说 你不能接近她
Dialogue: 1,0:54:53.46,0:54:56.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like I said, you're not getting near her.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:10.64,0:55:13.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嘿 -MJ！ 对不起 但是你有危险
Dialogue: 1,0:55:10.64,0:55:13.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey, hey.／I'm sorry, but you're in danger.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:13.81,0:55:14.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你的室友在哪里？  -什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:55:13.81,0:55:14.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Where's your roommate?   -What?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:14.94,0:55:16.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}内德在哪里？
Dialogue: 1,0:55:14.94,0:55:16.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where'sNed?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:16.10,0:55:17.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和朋友在波士顿 为什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:55:16.10,0:55:17.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, in Boston with friends. Why?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:17.36,0:55:18.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好 你必须跟我走
Dialogue: 1,0:55:17.36,0:55:18.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, good. You gotta come with me.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:18.73,0:55:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？ 我不知道你是否是真的蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,0:55:18.73,0:55:20.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What? I don't know if you're the real Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:20.53,0:55:22.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我不跟你走 -我们没时间
Dialogue: 1,0:55:20.53,0:55:22.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm not coming with you.   -We don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:22.11,0:55:24.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-拜托 快来 -你必须离开我的家
Dialogue: 1,0:55:22.11,0:55:24.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Please. Come on.   -You need to get out of my apartment.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:24.36,0:55:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听好 这听起来很疯狂……
Dialogue: 1,0:55:24.36,0:55:25.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, this is gonna sound insane,
Dialogue: 2,0:55:25.82,0:55:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是有一个人在追踪你 他很危险 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:55:25.82,0:55:28.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but there is someone who is after you who is really dangerous, okay?
Dialogue: 2,0:55:28.41,0:55:30.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我向你保证 我会保护你的安全
Dialogue: 1,0:55:28.41,0:55:30.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And I promised you that I would keep you safe.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:30.28,0:55:33.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托 你必须相信我 拜托
Dialogue: 1,0:55:30.28,0:55:33.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, you just have to trust me. Come on.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:36.71,0:55:37.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,0:55:36.71,0:55:37.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:44.47,0:55:45.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蛛丝 停
Dialogue: 1,0:55:44.47,0:55:45.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Web. Stop.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:49.14,0:55:50.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蛛丝 停
Dialogue: 1,0:55:49.14,0:55:50.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Web. Stop.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:54.31,0:55:55.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蛛丝 停
Dialogue: 1,0:55:54.31,0:55:55.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Web. Stop.
Dialogue: 2,0:55:59.86,0:56:02.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你没事吧？ 一是 我没事
Dialogue: 1,0:55:59.86,0:56:02.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- Are you okay? Yeah, yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:02.44,0:56:04.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我们在上面这里应该安全
Dialogue: 1,0:56:02.44,0:56:04.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Uh, we should be safe up here.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:05.03,0:56:06.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我们要逃离什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:05.03,0:56:06.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, safe from what?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:06.20,0:56:08.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不确定
Dialogue: 1,0:56:06.20,0:56:08.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, I'm not entirely sure.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:08.87,0:56:10.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 他们想要我什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:08.87,0:56:10.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, what do they want with me?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:10.49,0:56:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我不知道 一你不知道？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:10.49,0:56:12.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. You don't know?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:13.37,0:56:18.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不合理 为何他们选择我？／(银)／我希望我可以告诉你 我只是·
Dialogue: 1,0:56:13.37,0:56:18.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't make any sense. Why would they choose me?／Um, I wish I could tell you. I just. . .
Dialogue: 1,0:56:18.79,0:56:19.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:56:21.42,0:56:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们认识对方 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:21.42,0:56:23.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We knew each other, didn't we?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:26.63,0:56:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:26.63,0:56:27.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:28.64,0:56:29.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是唯一解释
Dialogue: 1,0:56:28.64,0:56:29.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the only explanation.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:31.30,0:56:32.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这件事困扰我好几年了
Dialogue: 1,0:56:31.30,0:56:32.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's been driving me crazy for years,
Dialogue: 2,0:56:32.76,0:56:35.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠救过我或内德的无数次经历
Dialogue: 1,0:56:32.76,0:56:35.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}all the times that Spider-Man saved either me or Ned.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:35.85,0:56:36.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在华盛顿纪念碑·
Dialogue: 1,0:56:35.85,0:56:36.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It was the Washington Monument,
Dialogue: 2,0:56:37.02,0:56:39.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后是伦敦、布拉格和夜猴酒吧
Dialogue: 1,0:56:37.02,0:56:39.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and then it was London and Prague and the Night Monkey.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:40.48,0:56:42.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}两次是巧合 但一次又一次……
Dialogue: 1,0:56:40.48,0:56:42.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, twice is a coincidence, but over and over again. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:56:45.32,0:56:47.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们彼此认识 告诉我我错了
Dialogue: 1,0:56:45.32,0:56:47.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We knew each other. Tell me I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:49.07,0:56:50.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你错了
Dialogue: 1,0:56:49.07,0:56:50.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:50.24,0:56:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们是什么关系？ 同学、朋友或其他关系？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:50.24,0:56:53.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What were we? Were we classmates or friends or something?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:53.62,0:56:55.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你在说什么
Dialogue: 1,0:56:53.62,0:56:55.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I. . . I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 2,0:56:56.04,0:56:57.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者我们之间还有更进一步的关系？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:56.04,0:56:57.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Were we something more?
Dialogue: 2,0:56:59.37,0:57:01.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我记不起来
Dialogue: 1,0:56:59.37,0:57:01.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I just, I can't. . . I can't remember.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:01.84,0:57:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我感觉我的大脑被搅乱了
Dialogue: 1,0:57:01.84,0:57:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And I feel like someone scrambled my brain.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:03.92,0:57:05.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有你知道原因
Dialogue: 1,0:57:03.92,0:57:05.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're the only one who would know why.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:06.42,0:57:08.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真疯狂 我不能……
Dialogue: 1,0:57:06.42,0:57:08.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is crazy. I can't. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:57:08.26,0:57:10.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你不能告诉我真相
Dialogue: 1,0:57:08.26,0:57:10.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know that you can't tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:13.14,0:57:14.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是我需要知道
Dialogue: 1,0:57:13.14,0:57:14.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But I need to know.
Dialogue: 2,0:57:19.56,0:57:21.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或许我内心深处还保留着一些记忆
Dialogue: 1,0:57:19.56,0:57:21.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe there's a part of me that still remembers.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:02.19,0:58:03.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得
Dialogue: 1,0:58:02.19,0:58:03.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Peter.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:05.23,0:58:06.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}MJ.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:06.40,0:58:07.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得
Dialogue: 1,0:58:06.40,0:58:07.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:13.74,0:58:15.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很想你
Dialogue: 1,0:58:13.74,0:58:15.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I've missed you so much.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:20.41,0:58:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我无法相信你想起来了
Dialogue: 1,0:58:20.41,0:58:22.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe you figured it out.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:22.54,0:58:23.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道
Dialogue: 1,0:58:22.54,0:58:23.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Idid.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:29.34,0:58:31.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧 彼得 摸她
Dialogue: 1,0:58:29.34,0:58:31.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Go ahead, Peter. Touch her.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:33.22,0:58:34.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱她
Dialogue: 1,0:58:33.22,0:58:34.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hold her.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:35.89,0:58:37.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你渴望很久了
Dialogue: 1,0:58:35.89,0:58:37.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You've been wanting to for so long.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:46.23,0:58:47.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真爱之吻打破咒语……
Dialogue: 1,0:58:46.23,0:58:47.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}True love's kiss breaks the spell
Dialogue: 2,0:58:48.78,0:58:50.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}促成了这对命运多的恋人的重聚
Dialogue: 1,0:58:48.78,0:58:50.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and reunites the star-crossed lovers.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:52.86,0:58:54.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}MJ会呕
Dialogue: 1,0:58:52.86,0:58:54.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}MJ would vomit.
Dialogue: 2,0:58:56.78,0:58:58.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真的是一只笨蜘蛛 不是吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:58:56.78,0:58:58.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You really are a simple spider, aren't you?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:01.96,0:59:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白为何你喜欢她
Dialogue: 1,0:59:01.96,0:59:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I see why you like her.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:03.62,0:59:04.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她……
Dialogue: 1,0:59:03.62,0:59:04.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She's,uh...
Dialogue: 2,0:59:05.83,0:59:07.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她聪明
Dialogue: 1,0:59:05.83,0:59:07.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}she'ssmart...
Dialogue: 2,0:59:07.79,0:59:08.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}风趣
Dialogue: 1,0:59:07.79,0:59:08.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}funny...
Dialogue: 2,0:59:09.71,0:59:11.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有点坏和扭曲
Dialogue: 1,0:59:09.71,0:59:11.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and a little dark and twisted.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:15.05,0:59:16.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真可悲
Dialogue: 1,0:59:15.05,0:59:16.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it is sad.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:17.26,0:59:20.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}里面这里没有你……
Dialogue: 1,0:59:17.26,0:59:20.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There is, like, no thoughts of you in here. . .
Dialogue: 2,0:59:21.77,0:59:22.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或什么的
Dialogue: 1,0:59:21.77,0:59:22.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}whatsoever.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:24.52,0:59:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是你知道的 不是吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:59:24.52,0:59:25.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But you knew that, didn't you?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:27.23,0:59:28.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个怪物
Dialogue: 1,0:59:27.23,0:59:28.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a monster.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:29.48,0:59:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你像我爱她那样爱过一个人
Dialogue: 1,0:59:29.48,0:59:31.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If you loved someone the way that I love her,
Dialogue: 2,0:59:31.36,0:59:34.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么你就会明白你正在做的事情 是不可饶恕的
Dialogue: 1,0:59:31.36,0:59:34.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}then you'd know that what you're doing right now is unforgivable.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:34.24,0:59:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:59:34.24,0:59:35.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 2,0:59:42.33,0:59:45.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗 有些人甚至愿意付出生命 只为了能最后拥抱一下自己所爱的人
Dialogue: 1,0:59:42.33,0:59:45.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, some people would kill to hold the person they love one last time.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:47.29,0:59:48.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}马上停下
Dialogue: 1,0:59:47.29,0:59:48.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it now.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:56.05,0:59:57.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oof.
Dialogue: 2,0:59:58.47,0:59:59.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得 你没时间了
Dialogue: 1,0:59:58.47,0:59:59.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're running out of time, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:01.01,1:00:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很快 就不只是你的朋友 会忘记彼得 帕克
Dialogue: 1,1:00:01.01,1:00:04.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Soon enough, it won't just be your friends who don't remember Peter Parker.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:06.02,1:00:07.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或许你应该给自己写封信
Dialogue: 1,1:00:06.02,1:00:07.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe you should write a letter to yourself.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:12.36,1:00:13.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从她身体出来
Dialogue: 1,1:00:12.36,1:00:13.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of her.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:14.94,1:00:16.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得 现在谁是怪物了？
Dialogue: 1,1:00:14.94,1:00:16.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who's the monster now, Peter?
Dialogue: 1,1:00:39.68,1:00:40.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}MJ.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:41.30,1:00:43.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}MJ 不要 天啊
Dialogue: 1,1:00:41.30,1:00:43.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}MJ. No, no, no. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:43.72,1:00:45.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊 拜托 不要 醒醒
Dialogue: 1,1:00:43.72,1:00:45.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God, please, no, come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:45.43,1:00:47.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}醒醒
Dialogue: 1,1:00:45.43,1:00:47.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:47.18,1:00:49.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感谢上天
Dialogue: 1,1:00:47.18,1:00:49.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, thank God. Oh,
Dialogue: 2,1:00:49.81,1:00:52.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事
Dialogue: 1,1:00:49.81,1:00:52.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you're okay. Oh,
Dialogue: 2,1:00:52.82,1:00:54.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很抱歉
Dialogue: 1,1:00:52.82,1:00:54.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:56.53,1:00:58.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停 等等 停 拜托 我投降
Dialogue: 1,1:00:56.53,1:00:58.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop. Wait, wait, stop, please, I'll quit.
Dialogue: 2,1:00:58.86,1:01:00.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你赢了 不要伤害她
Dialogue: 1,1:00:58.86,1:01:00.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You. . . You win, you win, you win. Just don't hurt her.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:04.04,1:01:05.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是个废物 蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,1:01:04.04,1:01:05.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a mess, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:08.21,1:01:09.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要我愿意.·
Dialogue: 1,1:01:08.21,1:01:09.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Anytime I want. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:01:09.83,1:01:11.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就可以成为我想成为的人
Dialogue: 1,1:01:09.83,1:01:11.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I can be anyone I want.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:12.42,1:01:14.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你保护不了MJ
Dialogue: 1,1:01:12.42,1:01:14.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So you can't protect MJ,
Dialogue: 2,1:01:15.55,1:01:17.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}甚至无法阻止她伤害自己
Dialogue: 1,1:01:15.55,1:01:17.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}even from herself.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:24.35,1:01:26.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这真是一封很棒的信
Dialogue: 1,1:01:24.35,1:01:26.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It really is a nice letter.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:26.98,1:01:28.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是有点累赘
Dialogue: 1,1:01:26.98,1:01:28.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Little heavy-handed.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:28.10,1:01:29.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是不错
Dialogue: 1,1:01:28.10,1:01:29.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But not bad.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:39.28,1:01:40.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（寻找目标……）
Dialogue: 2,1:01:40.49,1:01:42.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（寻获目标！ 名字不详）
Dialogue: 2,1:01:48.25,1:01:50.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事 我要带你去一个安全的地方
Dialogue: 1,1:01:48.25,1:01:50.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're okay. I'm gonna take you someplace safe.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:50.87,1:01:51.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:01:50.87,1:01:51.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 2,1:01:53.29,1:01:54.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带我去3165号.·
Dialogue: 1,1:01:53.29,1:01:54.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Take me to 3165. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:01:54.59,1:01:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拉斐特街
Dialogue: 1,1:01:54.59,1:01:55.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Lafayette Street.
Dialogue: 2,1:01:55.92,1:01:58.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正在导航至帝国州立大学
Dialogue: 1,1:01:55.92,1:01:58.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Navigating to Empire State University.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:03.30,1:02:04.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一等！ 好
Dialogue: 1,1:02:03.30,1:02:04.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, wait, Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:06.85,1:02:07.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我抱着你 一你确定吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:02:06.85,1:02:07.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I got you. Are you sure?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:07.97,1:02:08.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是的 -好
Dialogue: 1,1:02:07.97,1:02:08.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yep.   -Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:09.06,1:02:10.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我觉得我滑了一下
Dialogue: 1,1:02:09.06,1:02:10.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I feel like I'm slipping a little bit.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:10.27,1:02:11.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你没有滑下 一好
Dialogue: 1,1:02:10.27,1:02:11.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-You're not slipping. Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:13.19,1:02:14.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事
Dialogue: 1,1:02:13.19,1:02:14.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're okay, you're Okay, you're okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:14.52,1:02:16.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我没事
Dialogue: 1,1:02:14.52,1:02:16.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah, yeah. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:19.03,1:02:20.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,1:02:19.03,1:02:20.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:20.57,1:02:21.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以慢下来……
Dialogue: 1,1:02:20.57,1:02:21.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can we just slow down
Dialogue: 2,1:02:21.95,1:02:23.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一会 好吗？  -我们快到了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:21.95,1:02:23.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-for like two seconds, please?   -Well, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:23.32,1:02:25.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 但是你刚才说我被思维控制了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:23.32,1:02:25.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah, but you just told me I was mind controlled.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:25.74,1:02:27.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-严格上来说不是 -你很幸运我相信那种东西 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:02:25.74,1:02:27.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, not technically. I mean, you're lucky I believe in that stuff, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:27.99,1:02:29.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为各国政府多年来一直在这样做
Dialogue: 1,1:02:27.99,1:02:29.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Because governments have been doing it for years,
Dialogue: 2,1:02:29.20,1:02:30.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尤其是法国
Dialogue: 1,1:02:29.20,1:02:30.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-especially the French.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:30.87,1:02:34.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你没事吧？ 一没事……／对不起 我只是要带你 去一个安全的地方 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:02:30.87,1:02:34.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you okay? Yeah. . .／Look. Sorry. I'm just trying to take you someplace safe, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:02:39.21,1:02:40.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得不安全
Dialogue: 1,1:02:39.21,1:02:40.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't feel safe.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:42.42,1:02:43.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:42.42,1:02:43.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 2,1:02:48.56,1:02:50.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对不起 -小心！
Dialogue: 1,1:02:48.56,1:02:50.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry. Oh, watch out!
Dialogue: 2,1:02:59.36,1:03:00.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你变弱了 孩子
Dialogue: 1,1:02:59.36,1:03:00.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're losing it, kid.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:00.99,1:03:03.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为你在老远就预料到
Dialogue: 1,1:03:00.99,1:03:03.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thought you'd be able to see that coming a mile away.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:03.61,1:03:04.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有病吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:03.61,1:03:04.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:04.78,1:03:06.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一你差点杀了我们 -什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:04.78,1:03:06.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-You could've killed us. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:06.41,1:03:08.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不请自来 你认为会发生什么事？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:06.41,1:03:08.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You show up to my house unannounced, what do you think's gonna happen?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:08.99,1:03:10.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一等 这是你的家？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:08.99,1:03:10.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, this is your house?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:10.16,1:03:11.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不 不要 -她是什么人？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:10.16,1:03:11.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, no. Don't, don't, don't.   -Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:11.66,1:03:12.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是什么人？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:11.66,1:03:12.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:12.75,1:03:14.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她……
Dialogue: 1,1:03:12.75,1:03:14.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She's,um...
Dialogue: 2,1:03:14.42,1:03:16.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的
Dialogue: 1,1:03:14.42,1:03:16.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, you Know.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:16.38,1:03:18.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我不知道 所以我才问你
Dialogue: 1,1:03:16.38,1:03:18.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I don't Know. That's why I just asked you.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:18.54,1:03:21.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有危险 弗兰克 我需要你的帮助 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:18.54,1:03:21.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She's in danger, Frank. Look, I need your help, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:21.46,1:03:23.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-看来是 -拜托 你欠我
Dialogue: 1,1:03:21.46,1:03:23.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, looks like it. Well, come on. You owe me.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:23.59,1:03:26.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-拜托……  -你不厌倦那故事吗？ 一斯塔滕岛！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:23.59,1:03:26.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ah, for. . . Aren't you sick of this story? Staten Island!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:26.55,1:03:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}喉 斯塔滕岛
Dialogue: 1,1:03:26.55,1:03:28.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Nah, Staten Island.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:28.10,1:03:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还要我做什么？ 我救了你的命
Dialogue: 1,1:03:28.10,1:03:30.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What more do you want me to do? I literally saved your life.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:30.64,1:03:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯了 孩子！
Dialogue: 1,1:03:30.64,1:03:31.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're out of your mind, kid!
Dialogue: 2,1:03:31.72,1:03:33.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么 难道我要救你两次 你才会帮我？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:31.72,1:03:33.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-What, I gotta save it twice／-to get a favor out of you?   -That guy couldn't
Dialogue: 2,1:03:33.54,1:03:35.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}／即使那家伙拿着一把米 也撒不中我／你觉得这怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:33.54,1:03:35.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-hit me／-with a handful of rice.   -I mean, what does that sound like to
Dialogue: 2,1:03:35.35,1:03:37.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}／一他完全在我掌控中 -一个毒贩正准备枪杀一个人／-我看到他就在那儿 -然后我用蛛丝
Dialogue: 1,1:03:35.35,1:03:37.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-you?／-I had him exactly where I want him.   -A drug dealer was gonna shoot
Dialogue: 2,1:03:37.17,1:03:38.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}缠住了枪
Dialogue: 1,1:03:37.17,1:03:38.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-a guy. . .／-I'm seein' him right there.   -. . . then I webbed the gun
Dialogue: 2,1:03:39.06,1:03:40.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-从毒贩手里夺了下来 -我非常清楚我·
Dialogue: 1,1:03:39.06,1:03:40.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-out of the drug dealer's hand. . .   -I Know exactly what
Dialogue: 2,1:03:40.19,1:03:41.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-他正要……  -然后把那个毒贩·
Dialogue: 1,1:03:40.19,1:03:41.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm completely up for.   -. . . and then kicked that drug dealer. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:03:41.57,1:03:42.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-好 没问题 继续 -踢进储物箱
Dialogue: 1,1:03:41.57,1:03:42.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Okay, fine, go ahead.   -. . . back into a storage container.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:42.69,1:03:44.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这个你怎么说？  -你觉得怎样？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:42.69,1:03:44.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-What would you call that?   -What does that sound like to you?
Dialogue: 2,1:03:45.45,1:03:46.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不管 我只想回家
Dialogue: 1,1:03:45.45,1:03:46.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't care. I just wanna go home.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:47.53,1:03:49.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是很好的主意 快走
Dialogue: 1,1:03:47.53,1:03:49.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's an excellent idea. Kick rocks.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:49.83,1:03:52.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一回家 -不 等等 弗兰克 等等／拜托
Dialogue: 1,1:03:49.83,1:03:52.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Go home. No, no, wait, wait.／Frank, wait. Please.
Dialogue: 2,1:03:53.66,1:03:57.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我必须保护她安全 好吗？ 而我无处可去
Dialogue: 1,1:03:53.66,1:03:57.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I have got to keep her safe, okay? And I don't have anywhere else to go.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:01.25,1:04:02.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你喜欢辣椒吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:01.25,1:04:02.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You like chili?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:03.51,1:04:04.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我制作辣椒
Dialogue: 1,1:04:03.51,1:04:04.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I made chili.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:06.30,1:04:07.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧 就……
Dialogue: 1,1:04:06.30,1:04:07.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Just. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:04:08.14,1:04:09.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心阔剑地雷
Dialogue: 1,1:04:08.14,1:04:09.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}watch out for the claymores.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:09.35,1:04:11.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不想接下来两周都得捡你的碎片
Dialogue: 1,1:04:09.35,1:04:11.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't wanna pick up pieces of you for the next two weeks.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:13.35,1:04:15.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我绝对不吃那辣椒
Dialogue: 1,1:04:13.35,1:04:15.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, I definitely would not eat that chili.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:17.35,1:04:19.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是说那个疯子……
Dialogue: 1,1:04:17.35,1:04:19.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, you telling me that maniac
Dialogue: 2,1:04:19.23,1:04:22.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胡搞坦克的疯子…… 居然只是个青少年？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:19.23,1:04:22.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}behind all that tank nonsense is nothing but a goddamn teenager?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:22.65,1:04:23.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不只是坦克
Dialogue: 1,1:04:22.65,1:04:23.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And it's not just the tank,
Dialogue: 2,1:04:23.82,1:04:26.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而是过去一个月来 对损管局的所有攻击
Dialogue: 1,1:04:23.82,1:04:26.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}it's every attack on Damage Control this past month.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:26.49,1:04:28.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个小孩如何学会开坦克？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:26.49,1:04:28.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And how does a kid learn how to drive a tank?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:28.49,1:04:29.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道 弗兰克
Dialogue: 1,1:04:28.49,1:04:29.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, Frank.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:29.74,1:04:31.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在街道上把你打得屁滚尿流
Dialogue: 1,1:04:29.74,1:04:31.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Beat your ass all over the street like that.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:31.33,1:04:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她没有把我打得屁滚尿流
Dialogue: 1,1:04:31.33,1:04:33.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She did not beat my ass.／Eh.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:33.70,1:04:34.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你的家人？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:33.70,1:04:34.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This your family?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:37.79,1:04:39.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以远离那里吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:37.79,1:04:39.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Would you get the hell away from that?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:40.25,1:04:42.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听好 这房子有一条规则
Dialogue: 1,1:04:40.25,1:04:42.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I got one rule in this house.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:42.54,1:04:45.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不准碰和移动任何东西
Dialogue: 1,1:04:42.54,1:04:45.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't touch anything. You don't move anything.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:45.38,1:04:48.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也绝对不能问我 关于任何事情的问题
Dialogue: 1,1:04:45.38,1:04:48.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You sure as shit don't ask me any goddamn questions about anything.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:49.97,1:04:51.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以是三条规则？
Dialogue: 1,1:04:49.97,1:04:51.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-So, three rules?
Dialogue: 2,1:04:54.26,1:04:55.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我明白你为何喜欢她
Dialogue: 1,1:04:54.26,1:04:55.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I see why you like her.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:56.68,1:04:58.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去穿裤子
Dialogue: 1,1:04:56.68,1:04:58.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll go put some pants on.
Dialogue: 2,1:04:59.56,1:05:01.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要碰那辣肉酱
Dialogue: 1,1:04:59.56,1:05:01.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't touch the chili.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:02.82,1:05:03.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢他
Dialogue: 1,1:05:02.82,1:05:03.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I like him.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:04.65,1:05:05.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你当然喜欢
Dialogue: 1,1:05:04.65,1:05:05.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course you do.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:07.24,1:05:10.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我从HUD中提取了这张图片 并将其输入到系统中运行
Dialogue: 1,1:05:07.24,1:05:10.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So I managed to pull this image from my HUD and run it through the system.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:13.99,1:05:15.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是谁？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:13.99,1:05:15.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is she?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:15.16,1:05:17.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}几个月前还是默默无闻
Dialogue: 1,1:05:15.16,1:05:17.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Until a couple months ago, nobody.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:18.54,1:05:21.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她进出领养家庭 精神病院……
Dialogue: 1,1:05:18.54,1:05:21.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She was in and out of foster care, psych hospitals,
Dialogue: 2,1:05:21.17,1:05:23.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}最终她逃走了 从此销声圈匿迹
Dialogue: 1,1:05:21.17,1:05:23.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and then eventually she ran away and dropped off the grid.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:23.38,1:05:25.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于她的信息.· 几乎都被抹去了
Dialogue: 1,1:05:23.38,1:05:25.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There's hardly any information about her that hasn't been scrubbed.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:25.67,1:05:29.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她被归类为心灵感应者 现在知道她的名字了
Dialogue: 1,1:05:25.67,1:05:29.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But she's classified as a telepath. And now we have a name.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:29.76,1:05:32.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（琴 伊莱恩 格雷)
Dialogue: 2,1:05:33.47,1:05:34.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}33琴 格雷
Dialogue: 1,1:05:33.47,1:05:34.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"Jean Grey. "
Dialogue: 2,1:05:36.35,1:05:37.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的
Dialogue: 1,1:05:36.35,1:05:37.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:37.39,1:05:40.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些是她还没袭击的损管局地点……
Dialogue: 1,1:05:37.39,1:05:40.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}These are the Damage Control sites that she hasn't hit yet,
Dialogue: 2,1:05:40.23,1:05:41.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以如果她露脸……
Dialogue: 1,1:05:40.23,1:05:41.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}so if she surfaces,
Dialogue: 2,1:05:41.73,1:05:43.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我的脸部追踪程序会察觉她
Dialogue: 1,1:05:41.73,1:05:43.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}then my facial tracking program will pick her up.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:44.73,1:05:45.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,1:05:44.73,1:05:45.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:45.90,1:05:47.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？ 然后呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:45.90,1:05:47.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah? What then?
Dialogue: 2,1:05:49.70,1:05:52.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要担心 然后万 照顾好她就行了
Dialogue: 1,1:05:49.70,1:05:52.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Well, don't worry about "what then. "   -Just look after her.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:52.36,1:05:57.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要担心吗？／我难道就得坐在这里 照顾你女朋友吗？／我不需要被照顾 她不是我的女朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:05:52.36,1:05:57.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Don't worry about it, huh?／I'm just supposed to sit here and babysit your girlfriend?／-I don't need to be babysat, so yeah.   -She's not my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 2,1:05:57.95,1:06:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了 什么计划？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:57.95,1:06:00.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, all right. Look, what's the plan, huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:00.16,1:06:06.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是希望你的脸部追踪程序有效？／然后你让自己被杀 我必须照顾她一辈子？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:00.16,1:06:06.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just gonna hope that your facial tracking program works?／And you get yourself killed, I gotta watch her the rest of my life?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:06.13,1:06:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会被杀 弗兰克 我能捉到她 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:06.13,1:06:08.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna get killed, Frank. I can catch her, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:08.42,1:06:09.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是……
Dialogue: 1,1:06:08.42,1:06:09.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ijust...
Dialogue: 2,1:06:09.59,1:06:12.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只需要修复一下我的抑制器就行了
Dialogue: 1,1:06:09.59,1:06:12.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I just have to fix my inhibitor and then I'll be good to go.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:12.68,1:06:14.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你需要什么材料？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:12.68,1:06:14.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, what do you need to do that?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:15.47,1:06:19.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克 你没有 我要这样做的东西 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:15.47,1:06:19.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Frank. You do not have what I need to do that, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:20.56,1:06:21.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真会要嘴皮子
Dialogue: 1,1:06:20.56,1:06:21.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know you've got some mouth on you.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:22.06,1:06:23.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在想什么 你有防静电垫
Dialogue: 1,1:06:22.06,1:06:23.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you think, you have an anti-static mat,
Dialogue: 2,1:06:24.06,1:06:25.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}音调探头和微型工具？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:24.06,1:06:25.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}a tonal probe, and micro tools?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:26.36,1:06:27.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些材料我都有
Dialogue: 1,1:06:26.36,1:06:27.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I got all that shit.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:28.32,1:06:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为了什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:28.32,1:06:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What for?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:29.40,1:06:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-炸弹 -答对了
Dialogue: 1,1:06:29.40,1:06:30.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Bombs.   -Bingo.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:32.32,1:06:34.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}难以置信
Dialogue: 1,1:06:32.32,1:06:34.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 2,1:06:46.34,1:06:48.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得给某人打个电话安全吗
Dialogue: 1,1:06:46.34,1:06:48.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, do you think it's safe to maybe call someone
Dialogue: 2,1:06:48.63,1:06:50.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让他们知道我没事？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:48.63,1:06:50.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and let them know I'm okay?
Dialogue: 1,1:06:52.76,1:06:53.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh...
Dialogue: 2,1:06:54.76,1:06:55.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}例如你的男朋友？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:54.76,1:06:55.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 2,1:06:56.68,1:06:59.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 例如我的室友
Dialogue: 1,1:06:56.68,1:06:59.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm, no. Like my roommate.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:59.85,1:07:01.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, um. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:07:03.31,1:07:05.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得那不是个好主意 因为·
Dialogue: 1,1:07:03.31,1:07:05.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think that's such a good idea, you know, because. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:07:06.86,1:07:08.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她已经知道他是谁了
Dialogue: 1,1:07:06.86,1:07:08.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}she already knows who he is,
Dialogue: 2,1:07:08.32,1:07:10.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她可以潜入任何她想潜入的人 所所以·
Dialogue: 1,1:07:08.32,1:07:10.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and she can inhabit anyone she wants, so. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:07:10.32,1:07:11.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的
Dialogue: 1,1:07:10.32,1:07:11.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Right. Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:11.49,1:07:12.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 你说得对
Dialogue: 1,1:07:11.49,1:07:12.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, yeah, yeah. You're right.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:12.86,1:07:15.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-对不起 -不 没事 我明白
Dialogue: 1,1:07:12.86,1:07:15.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-SOrry. No, it's fine. I totally get it.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:17.70,1:07:18.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我打给我的男朋友·
Dialogue: 1,1:07:17.70,1:07:18.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If I called my boyfriend,
Dialogue: 2,1:07:19.91,1:07:22.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他会问一堆 我无法回答的问题·
Dialogue: 1,1:07:19.91,1:07:22.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}he'd just ask me a bunch of questions that I couldn't answer,
Dialogue: 2,1:07:22.16,1:07:25.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后他就会说我又在隐瞒什么
Dialogue: 1,1:07:22.16,1:07:25.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and then he'd tell me I was being withholding again.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:25.67,1:07:27.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-隐瞒？  -是的
Dialogue: 1,1:07:25.67,1:07:27.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Withholding? Yep.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:27.67,1:07:29.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的男朋友听起来很糟糕
Dialogue: 1,1:07:27.67,1:07:29.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sounds like your boyfriend's kind of a jerk.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:32.34,1:07:33.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是为何他觉得你隐瞒？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:32.34,1:07:33.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But why'd he think you're withholding?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:34.47,1:07:38.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道 你告诉我 帘布后的蒙面义警
Dialogue: 1,1:07:34.47,1:07:38.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. You tell me, masked vigilante behind the curtain.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:39.18,1:07:40.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Um...
Dialogue: 2,1:07:40.60,1:07:42.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 我明白你的意思
Dialogue: 1,1:07:40.60,1:07:42.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I see your point.
Dialogue: 2,1:07:44.27,1:07:45.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:44.27,1:07:45.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So what about you?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:45.98,1:07:46.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:45.98,1:07:46.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What about me?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:47.94,1:07:51.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有蜘蛛侠夫人吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:47.94,1:07:51.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, do you have a Mrs. Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,1:07:53.32,1:07:55.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有没有蜘蛛侠夫人？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:53.32,1:07:55.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Do I have a Mrs. Spider-Man? Um. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:07:59.12,1:08:00.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有
Dialogue: 1,1:07:59.12,1:08:00.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:01.83,1:08:02.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么没有？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:01.83,1:08:02.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why not?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:03.00,1:08:04.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么没有？ 因为我……
Dialogue: 1,1:08:03.00,1:08:04.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why not? Because I'm. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:08:06.42,1:08:08.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很明显我有太多要隐瞒了
Dialogue: 1,1:08:06.42,1:08:08.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm too withholding, obviously.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:09.34,1:08:11.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同病相怜
Dialogue: 1,1:08:09.34,1:08:11.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Welcome to the club.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:17.43,1:08:18.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}曾经有一个人
Dialogue: 1,1:08:17.43,1:08:18.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There was someone.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:19.85,1:08:21.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-真的吗？  -是的
Dialogue: 1,1:08:19.85,1:08:21.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Really?   -Yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:24.23,1:08:25.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:24.23,1:08:25.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What happened?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:26.06,1:08:27.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……
Dialogue: 1,1:08:26.06,1:08:27.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I,uh...
Dialogue: 2,1:08:28.73,1:08:30.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我必须让她离开
Dialogue: 1,1:08:28.73,1:08:30.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I had to let her go.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:31.48,1:08:32.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}保护她安全
Dialogue: 1,1:08:31.48,1:08:32.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}To keep her safe.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:36.90,1:08:38.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 你一定很难过
Dialogue: 1,1:08:36.90,1:08:38.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry. That must have been really hard for you.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:40.32,1:08:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的
Dialogue: 1,1:08:40.32,1:08:42.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, it was. Yeah. It is.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:43.41,1:08:44.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的很难过
Dialogue: 1,1:08:43.41,1:08:44.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It is really hard.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:46.79,1:08:48.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:48.83,1:08:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:48.83,1:08:49.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:08:50.04,1:08:51.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事 我……
Dialogue: 1,1:08:50.04,1:08:51.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Yeah, yeah, I'm okay. I, uh. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:08:51.21,1:08:52.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗 我要过来
Dialogue: 1,1:08:51.21,1:08:52.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what, I'm just gonna come over.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:52.67,1:08:54.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一等
Dialogue: 1,1:08:52.67,1:08:54.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, hold on, hold on.
Dialogue: 2,1:08:56.38,1:08:57.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么回事？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:56.38,1:08:57.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-What's going on? Um. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:08:57.55,1:08:59.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它总是过热
Dialogue: 1,1:08:57.55,1:08:59.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It just keeps overheating on me.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:00.22,1:09:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}困扰我几天了
Dialogue: 1,1:09:00.22,1:09:01.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's been stumping me for days.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:02.68,1:09:03.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在我转修航天学之前
Dialogue: 1,1:09:02.68,1:09:03.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Before I switched to aerospace,
Dialogue: 2,1:09:03.85,1:09:07.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我原本打算主修生物化学工程 你介意让我·
Dialogue: 1,1:09:03.85,1:09:07.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I was gonna major in biochemical engineering, so, do you mind if I. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:09:07.89,1:09:09.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然不介意
Dialogue: 1,1:09:07.89,1:09:09.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, for sure.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:09.23,1:09:10.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来 坐下
Dialogue: 1,1:09:09.23,1:09:10.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Here. There you go.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:14.52,1:09:15.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇
Dialogue: 1,1:09:14.52,1:09:15.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:18.57,1:09:20.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这装置本身·
Dialogue: 1,1:09:18.57,1:09:20.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So, does the device itself. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:09:20.70,1:09:24.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它会发出任何类型的辐射· 或磁场吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:20.70,1:09:24.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, does it generate any kind of radiation or a magnetic field?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:24.45,1:09:25.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为那肯定会造成干扰
Dialogue: 1,1:09:24.45,1:09:25.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause that would definitely interfere.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:26.04,1:09:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 它有一个微磁场
Dialogue: 1,1:09:26.04,1:09:28.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, it has a micro magnetic field,
Dialogue: 2,1:09:28.04,1:09:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在设计中已经考虑到了这一点
Dialogue: 1,1:09:28.04,1:09:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but I accounted for that in the design.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:30.08,1:09:31.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 那你的制服呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:30.08,1:09:31.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, what about your suit?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:32.04,1:09:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它实际上会融入织物中
Dialogue: 1,1:09:32.04,1:09:33.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, it actually dissipates into the fabric,
Dialogue: 2,1:09:33.88,1:09:35.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蛮酷的
Dialogue: 1,1:09:33.88,1:09:35.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}which is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:36.34,1:09:37.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,1:09:36.34,1:09:37.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:40.38,1:09:41.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:40.38,1:09:41.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What about those?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:42.64,1:09:43.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么那些？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:42.64,1:09:43.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What about what?
Dialogue: 2,1:09:46.22,1:09:48.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的护目镜或不管你怎么称呼它们
Dialogue: 1,1:09:46.22,1:09:48.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Your goggles, or whatever you call 'em.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:48.85,1:09:52.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它们会产生一个能量场 它可以很小 但是……
Dialogue: 1,1:09:48.85,1:09:52.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, they would create a field. It would be tiny, but. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:09:54.19,1:09:56.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是它在你的头里 非常靠近抑制器
Dialogue: 1,1:09:54.19,1:09:56.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But it's on your head, which is very close to the inhibitor.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:56.61,1:09:58.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以这可能造成过热
Dialogue: 1,1:09:56.61,1:09:58.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Which is probably why it's overheating.
Dialogue: 2,1:09:58.94,1:10:00.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}MJ 你是天才
Dialogue: 1,1:09:58.94,1:10:00.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, MJ, that is genius.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:02.57,1:10:03.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 这一定成功
Dialogue: 1,1:10:02.57,1:10:03.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, this has to work.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:06.74,1:10:09.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抑制器已激活
Dialogue: 1,1:10:06.74,1:10:09.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Inhibitor engaged.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:10.50,1:10:13.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（人型蛛形纲动物）／抑制某些蛛形纲动物激素
Dialogue: 1,1:10:10.50,1:10:13.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Suppressing selected arachnid hormones.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:14.75,1:10:16.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 感觉好多了
Dialogue: 1,1:10:14.75,1:10:16.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. That feels better.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:16.84,1:10:18.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绝对好多了
Dialogue: 1,1:10:16.84,1:10:18.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That feels totally better.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:18.72,1:10:21.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的脑袋很清晰
Dialogue: 1,1:10:18.72,1:10:21.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my head feels so clear.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:21.51,1:10:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蛛丝
Dialogue: 1,1:10:21.51,1:10:22.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Web, web.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:22.84,1:10:24.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有射有机蛛丝
Dialogue: 1,1:10:22.84,1:10:24.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm not shooting organic webs.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:25.01,1:10:27.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天 MJ 真的成功了
Dialogue: 1,1:10:25.01,1:10:27.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God, Mu, that, like, totally worked.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:28.31,1:10:30.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做着的东西 真是太厉害了
Dialogue: 1,1:10:28.31,1:10:30.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, this is some really intense stuff you're working on here.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:33.65,1:10:35.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 它真的很重要
Dialogue: 1,1:10:33.65,1:10:35.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, yeah, it's really important.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:37.77,1:10:41.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 但是这就像 这就像改变你的DNA一样
Dialogue: 1,1:10:37.77,1:10:41.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, but this is like, I mean, this is like altering your DNA.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:42.70,1:10:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这东西一般是·怎么说呢 给怪物戴的
Dialogue: 1,1:10:42.70,1:10:46.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, this is the kind of stuff you put on, like, I don't Know, like a monster.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:48.41,1:10:52.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你看到在过去几天.·／发生在我身上的事…… 那你可能会明白
Dialogue: 1,1:10:48.41,1:10:52.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, if you've seen what's been happening to me／over the last couple days, then you might understand.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:53.58,1:10:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经和你一起几个小时了
Dialogue: 1,1:10:53.58,1:10:55.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, I've been with you for the last few hours
Dialogue: 2,1:10:55.08,1:10:56.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是我所看到的
Dialogue: 1,1:10:55.08,1:10:56.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and that's not what I've seen.
Dialogue: 2,1:10:57.04,1:10:58.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你看到什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:10:57.04,1:10:58.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And what have you seen?
Dialogue: 2,1:10:59.38,1:11:00.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从我这边的帘布看？
Dialogue: 1,1:10:59.38,1:11:00.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}From my side of the curtain?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:02.63,1:11:06.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个可能在改变的好人
Dialogue: 1,1:11:02.63,1:11:06.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A really good guy who might just be changing.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:11.27,1:11:14.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我无意越界 我让你继续你的
Dialogue: 1,1:11:11.27,1:11:14.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I don't mean to overstep. I'll, uh, let you get back to it.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:27.58,1:11:28.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（嗨 我的名字是彼得 帕克）
Dialogue: 2,1:11:28.70,1:11:30.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（你不记得我 但是我有些东西……）
Dialogue: 2,1:11:36.29,1:11:37.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也睡不着吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:36.29,1:11:37.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't sleep either, huh?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:38.38,1:11:39.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要咖啡吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:38.38,1:11:39.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You want coffee?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:40.25,1:11:41.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,1:11:40.25,1:11:41.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sure.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:42.51,1:11:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你修好你的东西了吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:42.51,1:11:43.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You get your shit fixed?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:44.68,1:11:47.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 我已经戴了整晚
Dialogue: 1,1:11:44.68,1:11:47.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. I've been wearing it all night.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:47.47,1:11:48.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}目前为止 一切都很好
Dialogue: 1,1:11:47.47,1:11:48.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So far, So good.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:49.47,1:11:51.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我做了另一个通用的
Dialogue: 1,1:11:49.47,1:11:51.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I made this other one universal.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:51.31,1:11:55.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我能把它戴在琴身上 它应该可以完全封闭她的能力
Dialogue: 1,1:11:51.31,1:11:55.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So if I could get it on Jean, it should completely shut down her powers.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:55.85,1:11:58.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道还有其他可行的办法吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:11:55.85,1:11:58.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. You know what else would work?
Dialogue: 2,1:11:58.40,1:11:59.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开枪射她
Dialogue: 1,1:11:58.40,1:11:59.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You just shoot her.
Dialogue: 2,1:11:59.82,1:12:00.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好
Dialogue: 1,1:11:59.82,1:12:00.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:03.69,1:12:04.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊
Dialogue: 1,1:12:03.69,1:12:04.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:05.57,1:12:08.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这绝对是我这辈子见过最荒唐的事
Dialogue: 1,1:12:05.57,1:12:08.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That has gotta be the goofiest shit I ever seen in my life.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:08.66,1:12:11.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你甚至不能脱掉面具 来喝杯咖啡？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:08.66,1:12:11.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What, you can't even take the mask off to drink a cup of coffee?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:12.95,1:12:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要介意 弗兰克 我对所有人都这样
Dialogue: 1,1:12:12.95,1:12:16.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't take it personally, Frank. It stays on for everybody.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:17.00,1:12:18.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使是她？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:17.00,1:12:18.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Even her?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:20.50,1:12:21.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是谁 孩子？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:20.50,1:12:21.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who is she, kid?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:21.71,1:12:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道
Dialogue: 1,1:12:21.71,1:12:22.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Idon'tknow.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:22.80,1:12:24.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扯淡 她是谁？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:22.80,1:12:24.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Eh! That's horseshit. Who is she?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:24.92,1:12:26.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉你 我不知道她是谁 你在做什么？ 你在乎她／一你假装你不是 为什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:24.92,1:12:26.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I'm telling you, I don't Know who she is.   -What are you doin'? You care
Dialogue: 2,1:12:26.76,1:12:28.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我不在乎她
Dialogue: 1,1:12:26.76,1:12:28.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-about her.／-You're pretending not to. Why?   -I don't care about her.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:28.68,1:12:30.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道她是谁 弗兰克 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:28.68,1:12:30.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I don't know who she is, Frank. Okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:30.60,1:12:33.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一个亲人都没有 像你一样 独来独往
Dialogue: 1,1:12:30.60,1:12:33.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't have anybody. I'm like you. I just keep to myself.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:33.43,1:12:34.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你像我？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:33.43,1:12:34.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're like me?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:35.81,1:12:37.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我多少事 孩子？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:35.81,1:12:37.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you know about me, kid?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:38.15,1:12:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你认为这是一个选择吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:38.15,1:12:39.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You think this is a choice?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:39.48,1:12:42.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样生活是一种生活方式吗？ 你这么认为吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:39.48,1:12:42.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Living like this, it's a lifestyle? Is that what you think?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:42.77,1:12:44.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子 这是一个惩罚
Dialogue: 1,1:12:42.77,1:12:44.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kid, this is a sentence.
Dialogue: 2,1:12:45.44,1:12:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗……
Dialogue: 1,1:12:45.44,1:12:46.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know somethin'. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:12:47.24,1:12:48.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我有一秒……
Dialogue: 1,1:12:47.24,1:12:48.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If I had one second,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:49.62,1:12:52.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我所爱的人还活着 你以为我会躲在面具后面吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:49.62,1:12:52.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}people I love were still breathing, you think I'd be hiding behind a mask?
Dialogue: 2,1:12:53.41,1:12:55.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得我会假装成我不是的那种人
Dialogue: 1,1:12:53.41,1:12:55.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You think I'd pretend to be something that I'm not,
Dialogue: 2,1:12:55.66,1:12:57.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像个懦夫一样行事吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:12:55.66,1:12:57.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}acting like a goddamn coward?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:00.21,1:13:01.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(警告 犯罪进行中)
Dialogue: 2,1:13:02.00,1:13:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（面部扫描结果完全匹配）
Dialogue: 2,1:13:03.04,1:13:04.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发现了匹配的面部特征
Dialogue: 1,1:13:03.04,1:13:04.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I got a facial match.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:08.55,1:13:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她现在在曼哈顿的损管局总部
Dialogue: 1,1:13:08.55,1:13:10.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She's at the Damage Control HQ in Manhattan.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:10.84,1:13:12.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要走了 好
Dialogue: 1,1:13:10.84,1:13:12.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I gotta go. Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:16.56,1:13:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会没事的
Dialogue: 1,1:13:16.56,1:13:18.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:18.64,1:13:19.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我保证
Dialogue: 1,1:13:18.64,1:13:19.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll see to it.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:22.81,1:13:23.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你 弗兰克
Dialogue: 1,1:13:22.81,1:13:23.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks, Frank.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:30.70,1:13:31.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:34.95,1:13:36.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要让他一个人去吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:13:34.95,1:13:36.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You just gonna let him go by himself?
Dialogue: 2,1:13:38.04,1:13:39.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得他可能需要你
Dialogue: 1,1:13:38.04,1:13:39.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I think he might need you.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:39.92,1:13:41.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Eh.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:42.34,1:13:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像你需要他在斯塔滕岛一样
Dialogue: 1,1:13:42.34,1:13:44.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Kinda like you needed him on Staten Island.
Dialogue: 2,1:13:47.96,1:13:49.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的
Dialogue: 1,1:13:47.96,1:13:49.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:09.57,1:14:10.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（没有搜索结果 是否重新搜索？
Dialogue: 2,1:14:26.42,1:14:28.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比尔 你不可能永远躲着我
Dialogue: 1,1:14:26.42,1:14:28.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't hide from me forever, Bill.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:29.09,1:14:32.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的门很坚固 但是你要担心的是墙壁
Dialogue: 1,1:14:29.09,1:14:32.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You've got a strong door, but it's the wall you have to worry about.
Dialogue: 2,1:14:33.34,1:14:34.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是谁和你要什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:14:33.34,1:14:34.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Who are you and what do you want?
Dialogue: 2,1:14:40.10,1:14:41.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是琴 格雷·
Dialogue: 1,1:14:40.10,1:14:41.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm Jean Grey. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:14:42.44,1:14:44.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我要什么
Dialogue: 1,1:14:42.44,1:14:44.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and you know what I want.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:44.71,1:15:45.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴？
Dialogue: 1,1:15:44.71,1:15:45.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean?
Dialogue: 2,1:15:46.50,1:15:49.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你居然搜我？ 我脸都红了
Dialogue: 1,1:15:46.50,1:15:49.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You looked me up? I'm blushing.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:50.42,1:15:52.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我说过你的女朋友会发生什么事…… 如果你挡住我
Dialogue: 1,1:15:50.42,1:15:52.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I told you what would happen to your girl if you got in my way.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:53.76,1:15:55.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能再接近她了
Dialogue: 1,1:15:53.76,1:15:55.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not getting near her again.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:55.93,1:15:58.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也肯定不能进去金库里
Dialogue: 1,1:15:55.93,1:15:58.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're definitely not getting inside that vault.
Dialogue: 2,1:15:58.60,1:15:59.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许不能
Dialogue: 1,1:15:58.60,1:15:59.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm, maybe not.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:07.06,1:16:08.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是这个家伙可以
Dialogue: 1,1:16:07.06,1:16:08.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But this guy might.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:11.19,1:16:13.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 你不知道你面对的是什么
Dialogue: 1,1:16:11.19,1:16:13.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean, you don't know what you're dealing with.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:13.94,1:16:16.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和班纳有很多共同点
Dialogue: 1,1:16:13.94,1:16:16.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, you and Banner have a lot in common.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:16.78,1:16:21.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}双方都在打一场注定失败的仗…… 对抗你内心的怪物
Dialogue: 1,1:16:16.78,1:16:21.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Both fighting a losing battle against the monster that lives inside you.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:21.37,1:16:23.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 这是浩克 你不能
Dialogue: 1,1:16:21.37,1:16:23.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean, this is the Hulk, you can't just. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:16:31.84,1:16:34.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么东西？
Dialogue: 1,1:16:31.84,1:16:34.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:34.26,1:16:36.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}原来如此
Dialogue: 1,1:16:34.26,1:16:36.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:38.14,1:16:41.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}尝试用抑制你的方式来抑制我？
Dialogue: 1,1:16:38.14,1:16:41.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Trying to muzzle me like you muzzle yourself?
Dialogue: 2,1:16:41.60,1:16:43.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能让你进去那里
Dialogue: 1,1:16:41.60,1:16:43.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't let you in there.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:43.18,1:16:45.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不管V-Max是是什么 你不会得到
Dialogue: 1,1:16:43.18,1:16:45.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whatever V-Max is, you're not getting it.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:45.77,1:16:47.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我势在必得
Dialogue: 1,1:16:45.77,1:16:47.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like hell I'm not.
Dialogue: 2,1:16:47.31,1:16:48.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}糟了
Dialogue: 1,1:16:47.31,1:16:48.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:00.99,1:17:02.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 不要这样做
Dialogue: 1,1:17:00.99,1:17:02.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean, don't do this.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:03.49,1:17:04.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}省点力气
Dialogue: 1,1:17:03.49,1:17:04.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Save your breath.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:24.89,1:17:26.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}IGUN CLICKS]
Dialogue: 2,1:17:29.94,1:17:31.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克 你在这里做什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:17:29.94,1:17:31.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Frank, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 2,1:17:31.86,1:17:33.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为我在做什么？ 我在救你
Dialogue: 1,1:17:31.86,1:17:33.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What you think I'm doing? I'm saving your ass.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:33.52,1:17:35.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这超越了你能应付的 朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:17:33.52,1:17:35.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This is way above your pay grade, dude.
Dialogue: 2,1:17:35.65,1:17:37.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-我们的对手是浩克 一糟了！
Dialogue: 1,1:17:35.65,1:17:37.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-We're fighting the Hulk.   -Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 2,1:17:59.51,1:18:00.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}认真的吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:17:59.51,1:18:00.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 1,1:18:03.26,1:18:05.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-IGASPS, PANTS]
Dialogue: 2,1:18:11.56,1:18:14.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}出来！
Dialogue: 1,1:18:11.56,1:18:14.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- Get out!
Dialogue: 2,1:18:20.36,1:18:22.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不要射他！  -你疯了吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:20.36,1:18:22.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Stop shooting him!   -Are you out of your goddamn mind?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:22.95,1:18:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他--问题不是班纳！ 是她
Dialogue: 1,1:18:22.95,1:18:25.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He's. . . Banner's not the problem! She is.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:38.88,1:18:40.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为我叫你留在家照顾MJ
Dialogue: 1,1:18:38.88,1:18:40.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought I told you to stay home and watch MJ.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:40.67,1:18:41.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是
Dialogue: 1,1:18:40.67,1:18:41.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, you did.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:41.84,1:18:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后她叫我来照顾你
Dialogue: 1,1:18:41.84,1:18:43.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And then she tells me I gotta come watch you.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:45.05,1:18:46.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一等 她真的这样对你说？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:45.05,1:18:46.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, did she actually say that to you?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:46.68,1:18:48.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小子 你脸红了吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:46.68,1:18:48.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Are you blushing, daffodil?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:49.73,1:18:50.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没有脸红
Dialogue: 1,1:18:49.73,1:18:50.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not blushing.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:52.60,1:18:55.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死的 我就知道我该带火力更强的枪
Dialogue: 1,1:18:52.60,1:18:55.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Goddamn it. I knew I should have brought a bigger gun.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:55.61,1:18:56.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好主意 带火力更强的枪
Dialogue: 1,1:18:55.61,1:18:56.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a good idea, "Bring a bigger gun. "
Dialogue: 2,1:18:56.90,1:18:58.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想怎么做 给他挠痒挠到死？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:56.90,1:18:58.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you gonna do, tickle him to death?
Dialogue: 2,1:18:58.15,1:18:59.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 计划有变
Dialogue: 1,1:18:58.15,1:18:59.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Look, change of plan.
Dialogue: 2,1:18:59.57,1:19:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先给浩克戴上这个 然后我们去找琴
Dialogue: 1,1:18:59.57,1:19:02.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}First, we get this on the Hulk, then we go after Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:02.36,1:19:03.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有一个更好的计划
Dialogue: 1,1:19:02.36,1:19:03.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I got one better.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:03.61,1:19:05.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是造成人员伤亡最严重的威胁
Dialogue: 1,1:19:03.61,1:19:05.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the highest casualty-producing threat.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:05.57,1:19:08.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去制服它 我去找源头 我拿下它 明白吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:19:05.57,1:19:08.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You contain it. I go find the source. I take it down. You got it?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:09.41,1:19:11.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只是想避免与浩克战斗吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:19:09.41,1:19:11.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you just trying to get out of fighting the Hulk?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:12.92,1:19:14.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我猜是 -好 随便吧 朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:19:12.92,1:19:14.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I guess so. Okay, whatever, dude.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:14.50,1:19:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我来处理这个
Dialogue: 1,1:19:14.50,1:19:15.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I got this.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:16.08,1:19:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-等一等 不 弗兰克 一什么事？
Dialogue: 1,1:19:16.08,1:19:17.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Wait, no, Frank, Frank.   -What?
Dialogue: 2,1:19:17.84,1:19:23.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要杀她！／不要叫我心软／你知道吗？ 我要这样做 我要用我的方式来做
Dialogue: 1,1:19:17.84,1:19:23.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Do not kill her!／Don't start with that soft serve bullshit.／You know something? I'm gonna do this, I'm gonna do it my way.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:23.38,1:19:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去吧
Dialogue: 1,1:19:23.38,1:19:25.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just. . . just go, just go.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:25.84,1:19:28.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有不要接近她十米内！
Dialogue: 1,1:19:25.84,1:19:28.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And don't get within feet! Enh. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:19:28.14,1:19:29.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真恼人
Dialogue: 1,1:19:28.14,1:19:29.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So frustrating.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:44.36,1:19:45.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 1,1:19:49.87,1:19:51.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa!
Dialogue: 2,1:19:51.24,1:19:53.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这家伙的心理创伤真不一般
Dialogue: 1,1:19:51.24,1:19:53.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This guy's got issues.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:54.87,1:19:57.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 天啊
Dialogue: 1,1:19:54.87,1:19:57.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 2,1:19:57.79,1:20:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 又发生了？ 糟了
Dialogue: 1,1:19:57.79,1:20:00.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, not again. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:01.30,1:20:03.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}班纳博士？ 是是你吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:01.30,1:20:03.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dr. Banner? Is that you?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:03.92,1:20:07.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠 发生了什么事？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:03.92,1:20:07.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man. What happened?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:07.09,1:20:08.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在哪里？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:07.09,1:20:08.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where am I?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:08.22,1:20:10.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一嘿 一这一切是我做的吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:08.22,1:20:10.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hey, hey, hey.   -Did I do all this?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:10.14,1:20:11.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-你……  -我有没有伤害到人？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:10.14,1:20:11.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-You. . .   -Did I hurt anyone?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:11.60,1:20:14.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是你的错 她进入你的思想／你不受控制
Dialogue: 1,1:20:11.60,1:20:14.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not your fault. She was in your mind.／You weren't in control.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:14.18,1:20:17.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我失去了我的抑制器 一这里／这是唯一能把那怪物困在里面的东西／没事 我这里有另一个
Dialogue: 1,1:20:14.18,1:20:17.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I lost my inhibitor. Look here, here.／It's the only thing keeping the monster
Dialogue: 2,1:20:17.31,1:20:20.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}／我要你戴上它
Dialogue: 1,1:20:17.31,1:20:20.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}inside.／It's okay. I got another one here.／I just need you to put this on.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:20.52,1:20:22.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-这是什么？  -这是通用的
Dialogue: 1,1:20:20.52,1:20:22.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-What is it? It's universal.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:22.32,1:20:23.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}应该可以用在你身上
Dialogue: 1,1:20:22.32,1:20:23.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It should work on you.
Dialogue: 1,1:20:28.95,1:20:29.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:33.00,1:20:35.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托 先生 这大楼里有其他人 快戴上它
Dialogue: 1,1:20:33.00,1:20:35.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Please, sir, there's people in the building. Just put it on.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:38.17,1:20:40.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:38.17,1:20:40.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:40.34,1:20:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的头 我想她破坏了一一些东西！
Dialogue: 1,1:20:40.34,1:20:43.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My head. I think she broke something!
Dialogue: 2,1:20:43.67,1:20:44.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她还在里面吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:43.67,1:20:44.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is she still in there?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:44.96,1:20:46.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不
Dialogue: 1,1:20:44.96,1:20:46.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:46.30,1:20:47.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是另一个人
Dialogue: 1,1:20:46.30,1:20:47.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's the other guy.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:47.55,1:20:50.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布鲁斯？ 我可以带你离开这里 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:47.55,1:20:50.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bruce? Look, I can get you out of here, okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:20:50.72,1:20:52.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只需要你戴上这抑制器
Dialogue: 1,1:20:50.72,1:20:52.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I just need you to put that inhibitor on.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:52.26,1:20:53.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}远离我！
Dialogue: 1,1:20:52.26,1:20:53.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Get away from me!
Dialogue: 2,1:20:55.27,1:20:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他来了
Dialogue: 1,1:20:55.27,1:20:56.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He'scoming.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:57.27,1:20:58.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能控制它
Dialogue: 1,1:20:57.27,1:20:58.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ican'tcontrol.
Dialogue: 2,1:20:59.31,1:21:01.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以的 布鲁斯！ 你可以的！
Dialogue: 1,1:20:59.31,1:21:01.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, you can, Bruce!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:01.23,1:21:04.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}离开大楼！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:01.23,1:21:04.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get out of the building!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:04.73,1:21:07.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}叫所有人离开……
Dialogue: 1,1:21:04.73,1:21:07.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get everyone out of the. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:21:10.07,1:21:11.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不！
Dialogue: 1,1:21:10.07,1:21:11.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No! No!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:11.99,1:21:13.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}班纳 拜托 看着我
Dialogue: 1,1:21:11.99,1:21:13.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Banner, please. Look at me.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:16.33,1:21:19.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有班纳 没有女孩
Dialogue: 1,1:21:16.33,1:21:19.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No Banner. No girl.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:20.50,1:21:22.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只有浩克
Dialogue: 1,1:21:20.50,1:21:22.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Only Hulk.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:25.80,1:21:27.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}IGROWLS]
Dialogue: 2,1:21:32.10,1:21:33.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道你可以变成这么大
Dialogue: 1,1:21:32.10,1:21:33.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't know you could get that big.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:37.98,1:21:39.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Whoa!
Dialogue: 2,1:21:39.90,1:21:41.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得 祝你好运
Dialogue: 1,1:21:39.90,1:21:41.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck with that, Peter.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:49.53,1:21:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这里
Dialogue: 1,1:21:49.53,1:21:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}There you are.
Dialogue: 2,1:21:52.99,1:21:54.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要动·.
Dialogue: 1,1:21:52.99,1:21:54.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just hold still. . .
Dialogue: 1,1:21:57.58,1:21:58.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Stay!
Dialogue: 2,1:22:07.42,1:22:08.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊
Dialogue: 1,1:22:07.42,1:22:08.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:23.60,1:22:24.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要使用致命弹药
Dialogue: 1,1:22:23.60,1:22:24.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No lethal rounds.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:37.62,1:22:39.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}追踪爆炸时间
Dialogue: 1,1:22:37.62,1:22:39.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tracking time to detonation.
Dialogue: 2,1:22:40.29,1:22:41.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（识别主体.-检测到威胁）
Dialogue: 2,1:22:42.25,1:22:43.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(能量接触武器手套 ×)
Dialogue: 2,1:23:08.32,1:23:10.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}距离爆炸还有90秒
Dialogue: 1,1:23:08.32,1:23:10.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ninety seconds to detonation.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:10.23,1:23:12.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道！
Dialogue: 1,1:23:10.23,1:23:12.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I know!
Dialogue: 2,1:23:16.24,1:23:18.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托／(穿戴失败)
Dialogue: 1,1:23:16.24,1:23:18.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:18.33,1:23:19.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为何你的皮那么厚？
Dialogue: 1,1:23:18.33,1:23:19.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why is your skin so thick?
Dialogue: 2,1:23:19.95,1:23:21.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抑制器无法结合
Dialogue: 1,1:23:19.95,1:23:21.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Inhibitor cannot attach.
Dialogue: 2,1:23:21.20,1:23:22.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托！
Dialogue: 1,1:23:21.20,1:23:22.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:24:00.49,1:24:02.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}班纳博士……
Dialogue: 1,1:24:00.49,1:24:02.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Dr. Banner. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:24:03.58,1:24:04.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托
Dialogue: 1,1:24:03.58,1:24:04.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}please.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:06.17,1:24:07.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布鲁斯
Dialogue: 1,1:24:06.17,1:24:07.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bruce.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:08.50,1:24:10.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是彼得
Dialogue: 1,1:24:08.50,1:24:10.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It'sPeter.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:11.21,1:24:12.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是你的朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:24:11.21,1:24:12.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm your friend.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:41.99,1:24:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}布鲁斯
Dialogue: 1,1:24:41.99,1:24:43.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bruce.
Dialogue: 2,1:24:48.21,1:24:50.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（警告：3秒后爆炸)
Dialogue: 2,1:25:02.31,1:25:05.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}放下你的枪 不然下一颗子弹将会在你的头里
Dialogue: 1,1:25:02.31,1:25:05.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Throw down your guns, or you'll get the next one in the head.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:16.40,1:25:17.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在哪里？
Dialogue: 1,1:25:16.40,1:25:17.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is she?
Dialogue: 2,1:25:31.29,1:25:32.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做了什么……
Dialogue: 1,1:25:31.29,1:25:32.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What did you. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:25:32.38,1:25:33.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 结束了
Dialogue: 1,1:25:32.38,1:25:33.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's over, Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:25:48.94,1:25:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}萨拉
Dialogue: 1,1:25:48.94,1:25:49.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sara.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:01.24,1:26:02.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是我的枪吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:01.24,1:26:02.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that my gun?
Dialogue: 2,1:26:11.38,1:26:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人受伤吗？ 只只是我吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:11.38,1:26:14.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is anyone hurt? It's just me?
Dialogue: 2,1:26:15.04,1:26:16.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有人受伤吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:15.04,1:26:16.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is anyone hurt?
Dialogue: 2,1:26:17.88,1:26:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,1:26:17.88,1:26:18.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man...
Dialogue: 2,1:26:21.64,1:26:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你救了我的命
Dialogue: 1,1:26:21.64,1:26:22.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:23.64,1:26:25.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还救了不知多少条生命
Dialogue: 1,1:26:23.64,1:26:25.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And you saved God knows how many lives
Dialogue: 2,1:26:25.26,1:26:27.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你确保她没找到 她要在里面找的东西
Dialogue: 1,1:26:25.26,1:26:27.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}by making sure she didn't find what she was looking for in there.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:28.06,1:26:29.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还在里面 我们正在送她出来
Dialogue: 1,1:26:28.06,1:26:29.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Still inside. We got her coming through.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:30.52,1:26:32.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在她昏迷之前 她想说一些东西
Dialogue: 1,1:26:30.52,1:26:32.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Before she passed out, she tried to say something.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:33.52,1:26:36.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一个名字 萨拉 你有印象吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:33.52,1:26:36.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A name, Sara. Does that mean something to you?
Dialogue: 2,1:26:37.53,1:26:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在你把抑制器扎进她身上之前
Dialogue: 1,1:26:37.53,1:26:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Before you got the inhibitor on her,
Dialogue: 2,1:26:40.36,1:26:42.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她曾短暂地占据了我的思想
Dialogue: 1,1:26:40.36,1:26:42.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}she managed to get in my mind for a moment.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:43.91,1:26:47.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}萨拉是我最近去世的 一位同事的名字…… 我曾与她密切合作
Dialogue: 1,1:26:43.91,1:26:47.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sara was the name of someone I worked closely with that recently passed.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:47.99,1:26:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很遗憾听到
Dialogue: 1,1:26:47.99,1:26:49.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:50.58,1:26:54.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定是萨拉的记忆影响到她
Dialogue: 1,1:26:50.58,1:26:54.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Somehow the memory of Sara must have affected her.
Dialogue: 2,1:26:57.38,1:27:00.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很想和她谈谈…… 当她醒来后 如果可以的话
Dialogue: 1,1:26:57.38,1:27:00.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, I'd love to talk to her when she wakes up, if that's all right.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:00.22,1:27:04.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然 她将会被转移去罗斯福岛的设施
Dialogue: 1,1:27:00.22,1:27:04.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course. She'll be transferred to our facility on Roosevelt Island.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:04.34,1:27:06.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我和你一样渴望让她开口说话……
Dialogue: 1,1:27:04.34,1:27:06.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, I'm just as eager to get her talking as you are,
Dialogue: 2,1:27:06.76,1:27:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我们不要一天之内让她太累
Dialogue: 1,1:27:06.76,1:27:08.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but let's not strain her too much in one day.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:09.31,1:27:10.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然
Dialogue: 1,1:27:09.31,1:27:10.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:11.14,1:27:12.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你 蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,1:27:11.14,1:27:12.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:12.56,1:27:13.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不客气
Dialogue: 1,1:27:12.56,1:27:13.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My pleasure.
Dialogue: 1,1:27:25.49,1:27:26.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}MJ!
Dialogue: 2,1:27:26.58,1:27:28.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}成功了 她被拘留了
Dialogue: 1,1:27:26.58,1:27:28.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It worked. She's in custody.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:28.95,1:27:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在安全了
Dialogue: 1,1:27:28.95,1:27:30.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're safe now.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:33.25,1:27:34.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你留下了这个
Dialogue: 1,1:27:33.25,1:27:34.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You left this.
Dialogue: 2,1:27:42.55,1:27:43.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你故意让我发现它的吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:42.55,1:27:43.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you want me to find it?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:45.93,1:27:48.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不
Dialogue: 1,1:27:45.93,1:27:48.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Um. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:27:49.01,1:27:50.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以解释 我……
Dialogue: 1,1:27:49.01,1:27:50.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I can explain, I. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:27:50.10,1:27:51.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可以请你脱掉它吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:50.10,1:27:51.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you take that off, please?
Dialogue: 2,1:27:53.39,1:27:54.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
