Dialogue: 1,1:34:07.64,1:34:08.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-And the train was coming and he. . . I mean. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:34:08.89,1:34:10.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我直接就把她抱了起来
Dialogue: 1,1:34:08.89,1:34:10.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And I just swooped her right up.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:10.19,1:34:11.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-是的 救了我 一是的
Dialogue: 1,1:34:10.19,1:34:11.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Yep. Saved me. Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:13.40,1:34:14.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天
Dialogue: 1,1:34:13.40,1:34:14.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:16.07,1:34:17.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为何这种事情从不发生在我身上？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:16.07,1:34:17.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Why has that never happened to me?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:17.61,1:34:21.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你荡到一半想要小便呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:17.61,1:34:21.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-So what if you're mid-swing and you decide you need to pee?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:21.61,1:34:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会落在楼顶上吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:21.61,1:34:23.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you just land on top of a building?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:23.24,1:34:24.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:23.24,1:34:24.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:24.45,1:34:25.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会落到地上
Dialogue: 1,1:34:24.45,1:34:25.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you drop down to ground level
Dialogue: 2,1:34:25.54,1:34:26.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跑进咖啡厅说
Dialogue: 1,1:34:25.54,1:34:26.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and run into a coffee shop and you're like,
Dialogue: 2,1:34:26.74,1:34:28.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“嘿手 我是蜘蛛侠 我要小便
Dialogue: 1,1:34:26.74,1:34:28.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"Hey, it's Spider-Man. I need to pee"?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:28.08,1:34:29.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者你在楼顶随便找个地方？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:28.08,1:34:29.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Or do you find a rooftop somewhere?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:29.91,1:34:31.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我不会随便找个楼顶 内德
Dialogue: 1,1:34:29.91,1:34:31.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I don't find a rooftop somewhere, Ned.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:31.83,1:34:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你现在想问的问题吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:31.83,1:34:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this really what you wanna be asking him right now?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:33.92,1:34:35.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}朋友 你想问什么都可以
Dialogue: 1,1:34:33.92,1:34:35.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, dude, come on, you can ask me anything.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:35.50,1:34:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想知道我的蛛丝发射器 如何运作吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:35.50,1:34:37.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You wanna know how my web shooters work?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:37.09,1:34:38.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我已经知道它如何运作了
Dialogue: 1,1:34:37.09,1:34:38.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I already know how the web shooters work.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:38.72,1:34:40.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:38.72,1:34:40.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that right?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:40.05,1:34:43.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}显然存在某种剪切稀化流体……
Dialogue: 1,1:34:40.05,1:34:43.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, there's obviously some sort of a shear-thinning fluid
Dialogue: 2,1:34:43.22,1:34:46.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在腔室内循环流动 对吧？ 所以它可以保持液态
Dialogue: 1,1:34:43.22,1:34:46.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}that is cycling within a chamber, right? So it can keep its liquid form.
Dialogue: 2,1:34:46.81,1:34:49.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后 当你按下扳机键激活它时……
Dialogue: 1,1:34:46.81,1:34:49.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And then, when you activate it by pressing on the triggers,
Dialogue: 2,1:34:49.22,1:34:50.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它会流经一个特氟龙涡轮·
Dialogue: 1,1:34:49.22,1:34:50.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}it runs through a Teflon turbine,
Dialogue: 2,1:34:50.89,1:34:54.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后与空气接触后就会硬化 对吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:50.89,1:34:54.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and then it hardens when it interacts with the air. Right?
Dialogue: 2,1:34:56.98,1:34:59.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不确是 但是……
Dialogue: 1,1:34:56.98,1:34:59.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh. . . I mean, not exactly, but. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:34:59.86,1:35:02.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 那么告诉我蛛丝液里有什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:34:59.86,1:35:02.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay, well, then tell me what's in the web fluid.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:02.24,1:35:06.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我猜可能是某种长链聚合物／尼龙？
Dialogue: 1,1:35:02.24,1:35:06.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I would guess something like a long chain polymer.／Uh, nylon?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:06.66,1:35:07.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很接近
Dialogue: 1,1:35:06.66,1:35:07.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's pretty close.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:07.74,1:35:10.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 诺梅克斯或凯夫拉呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:35:07.74,1:35:10.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, okay. What about Nomex or, oh, Kevlar?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:13.29,1:35:15.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“好吧 保留你的秘密”
Dialogue: 1,1:35:13.29,1:35:15.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}(IMITATES FRODO] "All right, then. Keep your secrets. "
Dialogue: 2,1:35:15.21,1:35:18.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你是指龙的事故·
Dialogue: 1,1:35:15.21,1:35:18.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"If you're referring to the incident -with the dragon. . . "
Dialogue: 2,1:35:18.42,1:35:19.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我几乎没有参与
Dialogue: 1,1:35:18.42,1:35:19.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}". . . I was barely involved. "
Dialogue: 2,1:35:19.76,1:35:21.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“我只是
Dialogue: 1,1:35:19.76,1:35:21.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"All I did was simply
Dialogue: 2,1:35:21.51,1:35:23.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}轻轻推你叔叔一把 让他出门去
Dialogue: 1,1:35:21.51,1:35:23.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}"give your uncle a little nudge out the door. "
Dialogue: 2,1:35:26.01,1:35:27.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可靠的参考资料
Dialogue: 1,1:35:26.01,1:35:27.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Solid reference.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:28.31,1:35:30.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}越南法棍时间
Dialogue: 1,1:35:28.31,1:35:30.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ooh, banh mi time.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:30.10,1:35:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你叫了越南法棍外卖？
Dialogue: 1,1:35:30.10,1:35:31.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You ordered banh mis?
Dialogue: 2,1:35:31.56,1:35:32.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我订了五根越南法棍
Dialogue: 1,1:35:31.56,1:35:32.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I ordered five banh mis.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:32.85,1:35:34.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠在我们的家里 他必须吃饱
Dialogue: 1,1:35:32.85,1:35:34.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We have Spider-Man in the apartment. He's gonna get fed.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:38.32,1:35:41.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不要介意他 他只是很兴奋你在这里
Dialogue: 1,1:35:38.32,1:35:41.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sorry about him. He's just, like, very excited that you're here.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:41.53,1:35:43.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你开玩笑吗？ 这是我这么多年来最开心的一天
Dialogue: 1,1:35:41.53,1:35:43.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You kidding? This is, like, the most fun I've had in years.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:43.95,1:35:46.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很想念你们
Dialogue: 1,1:35:43.95,1:35:46.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I really missed you guys.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:47.95,1:35:49.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们看起来真的很像好朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:35:47.95,1:35:49.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You guys really do look like best friends.
Dialogue: 2,1:35:50.04,1:35:51.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,1:35:50.04,1:35:51.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:00.59,1:36:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你应该告诉他
Dialogue: 1,1:36:00.59,1:36:01.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You should tell him.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:02.34,1:36:03.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他应付得来
Dialogue: 1,1:36:02.34,1:36:03.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He can handle it.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:05.22,1:36:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 我知道
Dialogue: 1,1:36:05.22,1:36:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 1,1:36:08.93,1:36:09.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 2,1:36:13.35,1:36:16.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当她在楼顶附在你身上.·
Dialogue: 1,1:36:13.35,1:36:16.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}When she was inhabiting you on the rooftop,
Dialogue: 2,1:36:18.11,1:36:19.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她吻了我……
Dialogue: 1,1:36:18.11,1:36:19.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}she kissed me. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:36:20.36,1:36:21.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我回吻她……
Dialogue: 1,1:36:20.36,1:36:21.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and I kissed her back,
Dialogue: 2,1:36:22.07,1:36:24.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我以为是你 但我不知道
Dialogue: 1,1:36:22.07,1:36:24.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}because I. . . I thought it was you, but I didn't Know.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:25.28,1:36:27.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 1,1:36:25.28,1:36:27.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm. . . I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:28.45,1:36:29.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我认为你应该知道
Dialogue: 1,1:36:28.45,1:36:29.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I just thought you should know.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:32.16,1:36:33.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你告诉我
Dialogue: 1,1:36:32.16,1:36:33.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks for telling me.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:36.79,1:36:39.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正我也什么都不记得了 所以……
Dialogue: 1,1:36:36.79,1:36:39.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it's not like I remember anything anyway, So. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:36:40.96,1:36:42.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:36:40.96,1:36:42.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:42.13,1:36:44.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 这很奇怪 就像 有一秒我坐在我的桌子前……
Dialogue: 1,1:36:42.13,1:36:44.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. It was weird, it was like, one second I was sitting at my desk,
Dialogue: 2,1:36:45.05,1:36:46.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后下一秒我躺在街上
Dialogue: 1,1:36:45.05,1:36:46.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and the next second I was lying on the street.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:47.72,1:36:49.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道 就像熄灯一样
Dialogue: 1,1:36:47.72,1:36:49.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know, like a light switch went off.
Dialogue: 2,1:36:51.81,1:36:52.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:36:51.81,1:36:52.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:52.97,1:36:54.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以你什么都不记得？
Dialogue: 1,1:36:52.97,1:36:54.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So you don't remember anything?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:56.39,1:36:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 为什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:36:56.39,1:36:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Why?
Dialogue: 2,1:36:57.48,1:37:00.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梅茨格说他记得…… 当时他在想着一个名叫萨拉的人……
Dialogue: 1,1:36:57.48,1:37:00.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Metzger said he remembered thinking about someone named Sara,
Dialogue: 2,1:37:00.52,1:37:03.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是你却说· 你完全不记得任何东西？
Dialogue: 1,1:37:00.52,1:37:03.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but what you're saying is that you don't remember anything at all?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:05.90,1:37:08.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是 瞬间发生的
Dialogue: 1,1:37:05.90,1:37:08.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, yeah, it was instantaneous.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:08.36,1:37:09.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以才那么可怕
Dialogue: 1,1:37:08.36,1:37:09.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what made it so scary.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:11.58,1:37:12.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他骗我
Dialogue: 1,1:37:11.58,1:37:12.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}He lied to me.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:14.12,1:37:15.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（正在连接……
Dialogue: 2,1:37:15.87,1:37:17.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说你抓到莱西了
Dialogue: 1,1:37:15.87,1:37:17.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I heard you caught leshy.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:17.50,1:37:18.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 她的名字是琴 格雷
Dialogue: 1,1:37:17.50,1:37:18.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Her name's Jean Grey.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:18.88,1:37:21.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要有人帮我判断 这算“ 小” 还是 大土豆
Dialogue: 1,1:37:18.88,1:37:21.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I need some help determining the size of some potatoes.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:21.34,1:37:23.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-土豆？  -我想那是黑寡妇
Dialogue: 1,1:37:21.34,1:37:23.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Potatoes?   -I think that's Black Widow.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:23.21,1:37:25.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我认为梅茨格在一个名字上对我撒谎
Dialogue: 1,1:37:23.21,1:37:25.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I think Metzger lied to me about a name.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:25.26,1:37:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看看萨拉这个名字 跟琴有什么关系？
Dialogue: 1,1:37:25.26,1:37:28.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you see if there's a connection between Jean and someone named Sara?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:29.34,1:37:31.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这些土豆听起来很大
Dialogue: 1,1:37:29.34,1:37:31.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. These potatoes sound meager.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:33.26,1:37:35.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇 那真的是你的办公室
Dialogue: 1,1:37:33.26,1:37:35.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, wow. That really is your office.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:35.72,1:37:36.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好
Dialogue: 1,1:37:35.72,1:37:36.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:36.89,1:37:39.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}互联网、政府记录……
Dialogue: 1,1:37:36.89,1:37:39.27,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Internet, government records,
Dialogue: 2,1:37:39.35,1:37:44.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有很多关于琴 格雷的数据…… 都被损管局抹去了
Dialogue: 1,1:37:39.35,1:37:44.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and a lot of data related to Jean Grey has been scrubbed by Damage Control.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:44.15,1:37:45.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关于什么的数据？
Dialogue: 1,1:37:44.15,1:37:45.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Data about what?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:46.11,1:37:47.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她的姐姐
Dialogue: 1,1:37:46.11,1:37:47.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Her sister.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:47.82,1:37:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一等 琴有一个姐姐？
Dialogue: 1,1:37:47.82,1:37:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, Jean has a sister?
Dialogue: 2,1:37:50.86,1:37:52.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}萨拉 格雷
Dialogue: 1,1:37:50.86,1:37:52.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. Sara Grey.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:52.91,1:37:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也是一名心灵感应者
Dialogue: 1,1:37:52.91,1:37:54.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Also a telepath.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:54.70,1:37:58.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}损管局拘留她 用作研究和观察
Dialogue: 1,1:37:54.70,1:37:58.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damage Control took her into custody for study and observation.
Dialogue: 2,1:37:58.58,1:38:00.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇 你大概能猜到他们是什么意思
Dialogue: 1,1:37:58.58,1:38:00.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. I mean, you can probably guess what they mean by that.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:00.92,1:38:03.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}实验和其他侵犯人权的行为
Dialogue: 1,1:38:00.92,1:38:03.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Experimentation and other human rights violations.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:03.29,1:38:05.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}正是 等一等 你是谁？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:03.29,1:38:05.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hmm. Yes, exactly. Wait, who are you?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:05.17,1:38:06.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-嗨 内德 利兹 你的头号粉丝 一我是……
Dialogue: 1,1:38:05.17,1:38:06.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Hi. Ned Leeds. Big fan. I'm. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:38:07.01,1:38:08.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨
Dialogue: 1,1:38:07.01,1:38:08.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:08.38,1:38:09.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:38:08.38,1:38:09.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}UA, I'm sorry. Uh. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:38:09.93,1:38:12.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很高兴那个悲伤的人有朋友了
Dialogue: 1,1:38:09.93,1:38:12.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just so happy that the sad man has friends.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:15.10,1:38:17.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你 我欠你一次
Dialogue: 1,1:38:15.10,1:38:17.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks. I, uh. . . I owe you one.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:18.43,1:38:19.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}祝你好运 蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,1:38:18.43,1:38:19.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Good luck, Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:19.77,1:38:20.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再见
Dialogue: 1,1:38:19.77,1:38:20.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bye.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:20.94,1:38:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她只是在找她的姐姐……
Dialogue: 1,1:38:20.94,1:38:22.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She was just looking for her sister
Dialogue: 2,1:38:22.48,1:38:24.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我把她交给捉走她的人
Dialogue: 1,1:38:22.48,1:38:24.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and I handed her to the people that took her.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:24.69,1:38:26.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一我要走了 -嘿 彼得……
Dialogue: 1,1:38:24.69,1:38:26.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-I gotta go. Hey, Peter. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:38:26.36,1:38:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:26.36,1:38:27.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:28.40,1:38:29.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要小心 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:28.40,1:38:29.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just be careful, all right?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:31.36,1:38:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 我会的
Dialogue: 1,1:38:31.36,1:38:32.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I will.
Dialogue: 2,1:38:37.20,1:38:38.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠的名字是彼得？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:37.20,1:38:38.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man's name is Peter?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:52.55,1:38:54.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 你想成为哪一个？
Dialogue: 1,1:38:52.55,1:38:54.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean, who do you want to be?
Dialogue: 2,1:38:57.39,1:38:58.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她 粉色外套那个
Dialogue: 1,1:38:57.39,1:38:58.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Her. Pink jacket.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:00.39,1:39:01.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她太远了
Dialogue: 1,1:39:00.39,1:39:01.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She's too far.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:02.44,1:39:03.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你必须跳
Dialogue: 1,1:39:02.44,1:39:03.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna have to hop.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:03.52,1:39:04.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跳？
Dialogue: 1,1:39:03.52,1:39:04.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hop?
Dialogue: 2,1:39:04.98,1:39:07.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}首先 选一个靠近的
Dialogue: 1,1:39:04.98,1:39:07.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}First, pick someone close.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:07.69,1:39:08.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后
Dialogue: 1,1:39:07.69,1:39:08.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And then. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:39:22.87,1:39:23.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}每一次跳跃有限制
Dialogue: 1,1:39:22.87,1:39:23.92,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Each hop has a limit.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:24.54,1:39:27.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是你可以把它们串起来 并去到你想去的地方
Dialogue: 1,1:39:24.54,1:39:27.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But you can string them together and go as far as you want.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:28.42,1:39:30.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当你放开时.·
Dialogue: 1,1:39:28.42,1:39:30.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-And when you let go. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:39:30.96,1:39:32.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你马上回到你开始的地方
Dialogue: 1,1:39:30.96,1:39:32.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're right back where you started.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:33.47,1:39:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以对公园里所有人同时出手吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:39:33.47,1:39:35.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Could you do that to everyone in this park at once?
Dialogue: 2,1:39:36.68,1:39:38.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 也许有一天
Dialogue: 1,1:39:36.68,1:39:38.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, yeah, maybe one day.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:38.72,1:39:39.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你真的非常厉害
Dialogue: 1,1:39:38.72,1:39:39.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If you get really good.
Dialogue: 2,1:39:53.57,1:39:54.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怎么可以……
Dialogue: 1,1:39:53.57,1:39:54.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}How could she just. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:39:55.82,1:39:56.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}送走我们？
Dialogue: 1,1:39:55.82,1:39:56.87,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}send us away?
Dialogue: 2,1:39:58.49,1:39:59.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她不是真正的妈妈
Dialogue: 1,1:39:58.49,1:39:59.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She wasn't really a mom.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:01.87,1:40:07.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}反正不应如此／在我们改变之前 她是／如果就因为这样 你停止成为一名母亲
Dialogue: 1,1:40:01.87,1:40:07.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Not like that, anyway.／She was, before we changed.／Yeah, well, if that's all it takes for you to stop being a mom,
Dialogue: 2,1:40:07.21,1:40:08.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那她就不配当母亲
Dialogue: 1,1:40:07.21,1:40:08.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}then you're not a mom.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:09.13,1:40:11.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你有像我们这样的女儿 你怎么做？
Dialogue: 1,1:40:09.13,1:40:11.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What would you do if you had daughters like us?
Dialogue: 2,1:40:11.76,1:40:12.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会爱她们
Dialogue: 1,1:40:11.76,1:40:12.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd love them.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:16.43,1:40:18.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-尤其是红头发的那个 一闭嘴
Dialogue: 1,1:40:16.43,1:40:18.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Especially the redhead one.   -Shut up.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:20.93,1:40:22.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有对方
Dialogue: 1,1:40:20.93,1:40:22.35,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We have each other.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:23.52,1:40:24.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Mmm.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:26.10,1:40:27.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有雪糕
Dialogue: 1,1:40:26.10,1:40:27.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And we have ice cream.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:29.61,1:40:31.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-一个薄荷巧克力碎 一个巧克力？  -好
Dialogue: 1,1:40:29.61,1:40:31.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-One mint chip, one chocolate?   -Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:37.24,1:40:38.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,1:40:37.24,1:40:38.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:39.95,1:40:41.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在我知道你的玩法了
Dialogue: 1,1:40:39.95,1:40:41.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Now I know how you're playing.
Dialogue: 1,1:40:41.62,1:40:43.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Oh.
Dialogue: 2,1:40:58.97,1:41:01.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一趴下！ 一趴下！
Dialogue: 1,1:40:58.97,1:41:01.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get down!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:01.72,1:41:03.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-趴在地上！  -趴下！
Dialogue: 1,1:41:01.72,1:41:03.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get down on the ground now! Get down!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:05.98,1:41:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一趴下！ -萨拉！
Dialogue: 1,1:41:05.98,1:41:07.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sara!
Dialogue: 2,1:41:12.57,1:41:13.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 琴
Dialogue: 1,1:41:12.57,1:41:13.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}'m sorry, Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:41:14.82,1:41:16.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我必须保护你安全
Dialogue: 1,1:41:14.82,1:41:16.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 1,1:41:29.46,1:41:31.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}IGASPS, PANTS]
Dialogue: 2,1:41:58.82,1:42:01.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}主体醒了 心跳率94
Dialogue: 1,1:41:58.82,1:42:01.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Subject is awake. Heart rate is bpm.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:04.70,1:42:08.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 那行不通了 感谢蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,1:42:04.70,1:42:08.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean, that's not gonna work anymore, thanks to Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:11.25,1:42:12.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴？
Dialogue: 1,1:42:11.25,1:42:12.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Jean?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:22.30,1:42:23.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你呼吸
Dialogue: 1,1:42:22.30,1:42:23.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to breathe.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:23.64,1:42:25.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你看着我和呼吸
Dialogue: 1,1:42:23.64,1:42:25.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I need you to look at me and breathe.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:25.39,1:42:27.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:42:25.39,1:42:27.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:27.14,1:42:28.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你很安全 呼吸
Dialogue: 1,1:42:27.14,1:42:28.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're safe. Breathe.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:31.23,1:42:32.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在哪里？
Dialogue: 1,1:42:31.23,1:42:32.44,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is she?
Dialogue: 2,1:42:33.81,1:42:35.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像你姐姐一样 你被赋予一种能力
Dialogue: 1,1:42:33.81,1:42:35.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Like your sister, you've been blessed with a power
Dialogue: 2,1:42:35.82,1:42:38.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}它有可能为世界带来巨大的益处……
Dialogue: 1,1:42:35.82,1:42:38.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}that has the potential to do tremendous good in the world,
Dialogue: 2,1:42:39.36,1:42:40.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或巨大的破坏
Dialogue: 1,1:42:39.36,1:42:40.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}or tremendous damage.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:41.66,1:42:45.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像你这种能力落在一个小孩的手里· 是一个无法承受的负担
Dialogue: 1,1:42:41.66,1:42:45.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A power like yours in the hands of a child is an impossible burden.
Dialogue: 2,1:42:46.37,1:42:47.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是想想看
Dialogue: 1,1:42:46.37,1:42:47.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But imagine. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:42:48.58,1:42:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果那能力落在……
Dialogue: 1,1:42:48.58,1:42:51.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}if that power was placed in the hands of people
Dialogue: 2,1:42:51.08,1:42:52.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正懂得利用它的人的手中
Dialogue: 1,1:42:51.08,1:42:52.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}who actually Know what to do with it.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:01.47,1:43:03.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的姐姐在哪里？
Dialogue: 1,1:43:01.47,1:43:03.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is my sister?
Dialogue: 2,1:43:06.10,1:43:08.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 你将会改变世界
Dialogue: 1,1:43:06.10,1:43:08.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna change the world, Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:08.47,1:43:09.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿！
Dialogue: 1,1:43:08.47,1:43:09.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 1,1:43:13.85,1:43:15.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}_
Dialogue: 2,1:43:32.50,1:43:34.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克
Dialogue: 1,1:43:32.50,1:43:34.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-~SPIDER-MAN:Frank.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:34.33,1:43:36.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你在哪里和做什么
Dialogue: 1,1:43:34.33,1:43:36.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I Know where you are, what you're doing.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:36.34,1:43:37.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？ 如何知道？
Dialogue: 1,1:43:36.34,1:43:37.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah? And how's that?
Dialogue: 2,1:43:38.09,1:43:39.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子 我到处都有监控
Dialogue: 1,1:43:38.09,1:43:39.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I got eyes everywhere, kid.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:39.55,1:43:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(预期轨迹)
Dialogue: 2,1:43:40.96,1:43:43.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克 损管局绑架了琴的姐姐
Dialogue: 1,1:43:40.96,1:43:43.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, Frank. Damage Control kidnapped Jean's sister.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:43.55,1:43:46.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴只是尝试找她 我们搞错一切了
Dialogue: 1,1:43:43.55,1:43:46.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean was just trying to find her. We were wrong about everything.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:46.22,1:43:47.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感情用事的废话
Dialogue: 1,1:43:46.22,1:43:47.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sentimental horseshit.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:48.51,1:43:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你已经见识过她能做的和能力
Dialogue: 1,1:43:48.51,1:43:50.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You've seen what she can do and what she's capable of.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:50.68,1:43:53.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要放过她吗？ 这是你要做的吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:43:50.68,1:43:53.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What, you're gonna let her loose? Is that what you're gonna do?
Dialogue: 2,1:43:54.44,1:43:57.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我告诉你 你做你的 我用我的方式处理
Dialogue: 1,1:43:54.44,1:43:57.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll tell you right now, you do that, I handle it my way.
Dialogue: 2,1:43:58.44,1:44:00.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克 拜托 你能不能……
Dialogue: 1,1:43:58.44,1:44:00.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Frank, please, can you just. . .   -Eh. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:44:00.28,1:44:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克！
Dialogue: 1,1:44:00.28,1:44:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Frank!
Dialogue: 2,1:44:13.96,1:44:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}检查距离？
Dialogue: 1,1:44:13.96,1:44:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Distance check?
Dialogue: 2,1:44:15.12,1:44:16.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}12米的空间
Dialogue: 1,1:44:15.12,1:44:16.38,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Forty-foot clearance.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:16.46,1:44:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}封锁房间
Dialogue: 1,1:44:16.46,1:44:17.88,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Locking down the room.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:17.84,1:44:18.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}封锁中
Dialogue: 1,1:44:17.84,1:44:18.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Locking down.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:24.22,1:44:25.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}解除抑制器
Dialogue: 1,1:44:24.22,1:44:25.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Disengage inhibitor.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:26.18,1:44:27.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(抑制器解除了）
Dialogue: 2,1:44:29.76,1:44:31.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 你的能力现在完全恢复了
Dialogue: 1,1:44:29.76,1:44:31.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean, your powers are now fully operational.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:41.48,1:44:44.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你可以看到 我们在你的跳跃距离外
Dialogue: 1,1:44:41.48,1:44:44.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}As you can tell, we are beyond your jump radius.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:44.94,1:44:47.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我什么是V-Max
Dialogue: 1,1:44:44.94,1:44:47.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me what V-Max is.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:48.20,1:44:50.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是第二个问我这个东西的人
Dialogue: 1,1:44:48.20,1:44:50.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the second person to ask me about that. I. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:44:50.95,1:44:52.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真的不知道是什么
Dialogue: 1,1:44:50.95,1:44:52.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I have no idea what that means.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:52.58,1:44:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她传给我一个讯息
Dialogue: 1,1:44:52.58,1:44:54.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She sent me a message.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:54.79,1:44:56.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她尝试帮我找到她
Dialogue: 1,1:44:54.79,1:44:56.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She was trying to help me find her.
Dialogue: 2,1:44:57.58,1:45:01.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她靠心灵感应与你沟通· 在那么遥远的距离？
Dialogue: 1,1:44:57.58,1:45:01.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She communicated with you telepathically across all that distance?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:01.46,1:45:04.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们确实在那环节中 记录到了一个巨大的峰值
Dialogue: 1,1:45:01.46,1:45:04.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We did register a huge spike in that session.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:06.34,1:45:07.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好
Dialogue: 1,1:45:06.34,1:45:07.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Fascinating.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:07.51,1:45:09.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么意思 混蛋？
Dialogue: 1,1:45:07.51,1:45:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What does it mean, asshole?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:11.43,1:45:12.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道
Dialogue: 1,1:45:11.43,1:45:12.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Idon'tknow.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:13.43,1:45:14.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们开始吧
Dialogue: 1,1:45:13.43,1:45:14.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Let'sbegin.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:22.94,1:45:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们与萨拉的合作 主要集中在两个方面
Dialogue: 1,1:45:22.94,1:45:25.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Our work with Sara centered on two areas,
Dialogue: 2,1:45:25.32,1:45:27.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}找出她能力的来源
Dialogue: 1,1:45:25.32,1:45:27.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}identifying the source of her power
Dialogue: 2,1:45:27.70,1:45:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以及找到复制这种能力的方法／（神经数据扫描）／如果我们能找到一种方法来记录……
Dialogue: 1,1:45:27.70,1:45:31.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and identifying a path towards copying it.／-If we could
Dialogue: 2,1:45:31.18,1:45:34.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}／跳跃过程中心灵感应的大脑……
Dialogue: 1,1:45:31.18,1:45:34.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}find a way／to record a telepathic brain during a jump,
Dialogue: 2,1:45:34.70,1:45:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么或许我们可以在我们选择的思想
Dialogue: 1,1:45:34.70,1:45:37.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}then perhaps we could replicate those pathways
Dialogue: 2,1:45:37.83,1:45:39.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}复制这些路径
Dialogue: 1,1:45:37.83,1:45:39.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}in a mind of our choosing.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:41.00,1:45:44.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这仪器是你姐姐留下的遗产
Dialogue: 1,1:45:41.00,1:45:44.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This instrument is your sister's legacy.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:45.26,1:45:48.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们经过数月的反复试验 共同打造了它
Dialogue: 1,1:45:45.26,1:45:48.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We built this together over many months of trial and error.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:49.38,1:45:51.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望你我都能铭记她的牺牲
Dialogue: 1,1:45:49.38,1:45:51.55,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope you and I can honor her sacrifice.
Dialogue: 2,1:45:54.68,1:45:56.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:45:54.68,1:45:56.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 2,1:45:57.52,1:45:58.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}触发第一次跳跃
Dialogue: 1,1:45:57.52,1:45:58.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Trigger the first jump.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:03.57,1:46:06.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}告诉我V-Max是是什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:46:03.57,1:46:06.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tell me what V-Max is.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:06.15,1:46:07.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你把她藏在那里
Dialogue: 1,1:46:06.15,1:46:07.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I know that's where you're hiding her.
Dialogue: 1,1:46:12.12,1:46:13.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}IGASPS, PANTS]
Dialogue: 2,1:46:23.00,1:46:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她正在跳跃
Dialogue: 1,1:46:23.00,1:46:24.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She'sjumping.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:26.30,1:46:27.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}收到
Dialogue: 1,1:46:26.30,1:46:27.30,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Copy.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:27.84,1:46:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们已全面封锁 相关程序已经开始
Dialogue: 1,1:46:27.84,1:46:30.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We're in full lockdown. Process has commenced.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:30.93,1:46:31.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么程序？
Dialogue: 1,1:46:30.93,1:46:31.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What process?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:33.39,1:46:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}朋友 气氛很严肃
Dialogue: 1,1:46:33.39,1:46:35.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, whoa, that's a pretty serious look there, dude.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:36.60,1:46:38.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等！ 搞什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:46:36.60,1:46:38.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, hey, whoa! What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:38.22,1:46:40.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托 我是损管局的朋友 你在做什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:46:38.22,1:46:40.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. I'm a friend of Damage Control. What are you doin'?
Dialogue: 1,1:46:43.77,1:46:44.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Huh.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:44.86,1:46:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是你们要的 你们要打架
Dialogue: 1,1:46:44.86,1:46:46.40,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna be like that. You wanna go.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:46.52,1:46:47.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,1:46:46.52,1:46:47.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:48.03,1:46:49.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 给我一会
Dialogue: 1,1:46:48.03,1:46:49.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, well, just give me a sec.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:50.07,1:46:51.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}给我一会
Dialogue: 1,1:46:50.07,1:46:51.11,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:51.95,1:46:53.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不再是高中生了
Dialogue: 1,1:46:51.95,1:46:53.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not in high school anymore.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:55.66,1:46:57.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做拉伸吗？ 你喜欢拉伸吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:46:55.66,1:46:57.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you stretch? You a big stretcher?
Dialogue: 2,1:46:57.24,1:46:58.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这一行应该多做
Dialogue: 1,1:46:57.24,1:46:58.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you should do in your line of work.
Dialogue: 2,1:46:59.29,1:47:02.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你呢？ 你们拉伸吗？ 对你们很有益处
Dialogue: 1,1:46:59.29,1:47:02.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What about you? You guys stretch? It's so good for you.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:04.04,1:47:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:47:04.04,1:47:05.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You ready?
Dialogue: 1,1:47:05.13,1:47:07.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}_
Dialogue: 2,1:47:14.68,1:47:15.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小心你的头！
Dialogue: 1,1:47:14.68,1:47:15.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Watch your head!
Dialogue: 2,1:47:35.57,1:47:37.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 格雷在哪里？
Dialogue: 1,1:47:35.57,1:47:37.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is Jean Grey?
Dialogue: 2,1:47:38.37,1:47:40.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是第26次跳跃
Dialogue: 1,1:47:38.37,1:47:40.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That'sjump26.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:40.20,1:47:41.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记录看来不错
Dialogue: 1,1:47:40.20,1:47:41.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Recordings look good.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:41.54,1:47:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起 先生
Dialogue: 1,1:47:41.54,1:47:42.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Excuse me, sir.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:43.58,1:47:44.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一个入侵者
Dialogue: 1,1:47:43.58,1:47:44.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We have an intruder.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:49.76,1:47:51.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得对
Dialogue: 1,1:47:49.76,1:47:51.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You were right.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:51.05,1:47:53.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她比她姐姐强多了
Dialogue: 1,1:47:51.05,1:47:53.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She's much stronger than her sister.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:54.09,1:47:55.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}增加频率
Dialogue: 1,1:47:54.09,1:47:55.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Increase the frequency.
Dialogue: 2,1:47:56.84,1:47:58.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 你做得很好
Dialogue: 1,1:47:56.84,1:47:58.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're doing very well, Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:48:46.14,1:48:47.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴？
Dialogue: 1,1:48:46.14,1:48:47.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean?
Dialogue: 2,1:48:51.90,1:48:53.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 你听到我吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:48:51.90,1:48:53.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 2,1:48:59.53,1:49:00.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴？
Dialogue: 1,1:48:59.53,1:49:00.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:05.12,1:49:06.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是个杀人凶手
Dialogue: 1,1:49:05.12,1:49:06.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a murderer.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:08.67,1:49:11.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她的频率正在变化
Dialogue: 1,1:49:08.67,1:49:11.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Her frequencies are evolving.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:11.84,1:49:13.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不合理
Dialogue: 1,1:49:11.84,1:49:13.05,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:14.05,1:49:18.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我姐姐最后看到的就是这个房间
Dialogue: 1,1:49:14.05,1:49:18.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The last thing my sister saw was this room.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:18.18,1:49:20.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她的脑电波 似乎对周围的物体产生了影响
Dialogue: 1,1:49:18.18,1:49:20.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Her brainwaves are somehow affecting the objects around her.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:21.01,1:49:22.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}关闭它
Dialogue: 1,1:49:21.01,1:49:22.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shut it down.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:22.10,1:49:23.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在努力 先生
Dialogue: 1,1:49:22.10,1:49:23.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm trying, sir.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:23.39,1:49:24.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在努力是什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,1:49:23.39,1:49:24.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean you're trying?
Dialogue: 2,1:49:24.89,1:49:29.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我姐姐最后看到的 就是这个该死的房间！
Dialogue: 1,1:49:24.89,1:49:29.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The last thing my sister saw was this goddamn room!
Dialogue: 2,1:49:30.06,1:49:31.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-关闭它！  -我不能 先生
Dialogue: 1,1:49:30.06,1:49:31.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Shut it down!   -I can't, sir.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:33.02,1:49:34.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}走开
Dialogue: 1,1:49:33.02,1:49:34.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Move.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:36.49,1:49:38.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比尔 我不能让你这样做
Dialogue: 1,1:49:36.49,1:49:38.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't let you do that, Bill.
Dialogue: 2,1:49:42.12,1:49:46.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唯一能掌控这能力的人……
Dialogue: 1,1:49:42.12,1:49:46.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-The only hands that will wield this power. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:49:46.25,1:49:48.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是我
Dialogue: 1,1:49:46.25,1:49:48.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-. . . are mine.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:13.44,1:50:15.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What is happening?
Dialogue: 1,1:50:16.57,1:50:17.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Get inside.
Dialogue: 1,1:50:24.91,1:50:25.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait for me!
Dialogue: 2,1:52:01.38,1:52:03.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-什么 -你想要什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:52:01.38,1:52:03.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-What. . . What do you want?
Dialogue: 2,1:52:06.68,1:52:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 我是来帮你的
Dialogue: 1,1:52:06.68,1:52:09.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean, I'm here to help you.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:10.97,1:52:12.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你把我关在这里
Dialogue: 1,1:52:10.97,1:52:12.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You put me here.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:13.02,1:52:14.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道 我对萨拉的事很遗憾
Dialogue: 1,1:52:13.02,1:52:14.90,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, and I'm sorry about Sara,
Dialogue: 2,1:52:14.94,1:52:17.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也很抱歉我搞错了
Dialogue: 1,1:52:14.94,1:52:17.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'm sorry that I got it so wrong.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:19.27,1:52:20.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你来这里
Dialogue: 1,1:52:19.27,1:52:20.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If you came here
Dialogue: 2,1:52:20.36,1:52:23.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是为了从损管局救出一个无助的女孩 那你太迟了
Dialogue: 1,1:52:20.36,1:52:23.65,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}to save a helpless girl from Damage Control, you're too late.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:24.70,1:52:26.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们才是需要被救的人
Dialogue: 1,1:52:24.70,1:52:26.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They're the ones who need saving.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:26.57,1:52:27.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在
Dialogue: 1,1:52:26.57,1:52:27.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And now. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:52:28.53,1:52:29.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也需要被救
Dialogue: 1,1:52:28.53,1:52:29.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}so do you.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:32.00,1:52:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们来吧
Dialogue: 1,1:52:32.00,1:52:33.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Here we go.
Dialogue: 2,1:52:47.51,1:52:49.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊 那很酷
Dialogue: 1,1:52:47.51,1:52:49.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}God, that's cool.
Dialogue: 1,1:53:04.40,1:53:05.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Ow! Ow!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:10.03,1:53:12.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 拜托！
Dialogue: 1,1:53:10.03,1:53:12.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean! please!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:26.38,1:53:28.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托！
Dialogue: 1,1:53:26.38,1:53:28.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on!
Dialogue: 2,1:53:48.78,1:53:49.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么……
Dialogue: 1,1:53:48.78,1:53:49.91,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What the. . .
Dialogue: 2,1:53:51.74,1:53:52.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是不是很搞笑·
Dialogue: 1,1:53:51.74,1:53:52.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't it funny
Dialogue: 2,1:53:52.83,1:53:56.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的损管局朋友如何 开发了特别的武器
Dialogue: 1,1:53:52.83,1:53:56.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}how your friends from Damage Control developed a special weapon
Dialogue: 2,1:53:56.37,1:53:57.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来针对你？
Dialogue: 1,1:53:56.37,1:53:57.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}just for you?
Dialogue: 2,1:53:58.92,1:54:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们已经组建了 一支完整的特别行动小组
Dialogue: 1,1:53:58.92,1:54:01.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They've got a whole task force ready.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:01.67,1:54:03.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以防你不听话
Dialogue: 1,1:54:01.67,1:54:03.54,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just in case you ever get out of line.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:08.09,1:54:09.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人们是怪物
Dialogue: 1,1:54:08.09,1:54:09.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}People are monsters.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:14.43,1:54:17.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不应该信任他们 因为他们也不信任你
Dialogue: 1,1:54:14.43,1:54:17.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You shouldn't trust them any more than they trust you.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:30.07,1:54:31.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(弗兰克来电）
Dialogue: 2,1:54:31.24,1:54:32.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克 我有点忙
Dialogue: 1,1:54:31.24,1:54:32.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a little busy, Frank.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:32.49,1:54:33.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子 我们有一个问题
Dialogue: 1,1:54:32.49,1:54:33.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We got a problem, kid.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:33.82,1:54:36.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她定住了方圆一公里内的所有人
Dialogue: 1,1:54:33.82,1:54:36.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She got ahold of everyone within a kilometer of the island.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:36.70,1:54:38.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等一等 什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:54:36.70,1:54:38.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait, what?
Dialogue: 2,1:54:44.13,1:54:46.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听好 如果你要做一些事情 你最好马上做
Dialogue: 1,1:54:44.13,1:54:46.50,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, look, if you're gonna do something, you better do it now.
Dialogue: 2,1:54:46.59,1:54:47.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在努力！
Dialogue: 1,1:54:46.59,1:54:47.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'mtrying!
Dialogue: 2,1:55:13.28,1:55:14.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子！
Dialogue: 1,1:55:13.28,1:55:14.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Kid?
Dialogue: 2,1:55:14.78,1:55:16.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}该死的！
Dialogue: 1,1:55:14.78,1:55:16.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shit! Goddamn it.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:50.40,1:55:51.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我姐姐死在……
Dialogue: 1,1:55:50.40,1:55:51.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}My sister died
Dialogue: 2,1:55:51.70,1:55:52.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个房间里
Dialogue: 1,1:55:51.70,1:55:52.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}in this room,
Dialogue: 2,1:55:54.32,1:55:55.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}被这些人包围着
Dialogue: 1,1:55:54.32,1:55:55.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}surrounded by these men.
Dialogue: 2,1:55:57.28,1:55:58.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她唯一的罪是
Dialogue: 1,1:55:57.28,1:55:58.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And her only crime
Dialogue: 2,1:55:58.54,1:56:00.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她与众不同
Dialogue: 1,1:55:58.54,1:56:00.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}was that she was special.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:01.20,1:56:03.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像你
Dialogue: 1,1:56:01.20,1:56:03.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just like you.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:04.58,1:56:05.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像我
Dialogue: 1,1:56:04.58,1:56:05.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just like me.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:08.46,1:56:11.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}像我们这种人不能过正常的生活
Dialogue: 1,1:56:08.46,1:56:11.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}People like us don't get to live a normal life.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:14.47,1:56:17.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们不配拥有朋友或家人
Dialogue: 1,1:56:14.47,1:56:17.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We don't get to have friends or a family.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:19.64,1:56:21.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些人都没了
Dialogue: 1,1:56:19.64,1:56:21.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Those people are gone.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:23.85,1:56:25.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那生活结束了
Dialogue: 1,1:56:23.85,1:56:25.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That life is over.
Dialogue: 2,1:56:51.71,1:56:54.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为何你不对自己坦诚？
Dialogue: 1,1:56:51.71,1:56:54.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}So why don't you just be honest with yourself?
Dialogue: 2,1:56:57.09,1:56:58.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是彼得 帕克？
Dialogue: 1,1:56:57.09,1:56:58.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you Peter Parker?
Dialogue: 2,1:57:00.60,1:57:01.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或蜘蛛侠？
Dialogue: 1,1:57:00.60,1:57:01.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Or are you Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 2,1:57:34.96,1:57:36.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是两者
Dialogue: 1,1:57:34.96,1:57:36.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'mboth.
Dialogue: 1,1:58:13.00,1:58:14.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}_
Dialogue: 2,1:59:20.78,1:59:22.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 拜托
Dialogue: 1,1:59:20.78,1:59:22.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean, please.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:24.12,1:59:25.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这并不会纠正事情
Dialogue: 1,1:59:24.12,1:59:25.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}This won't make it right.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:27.70,1:59:29.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托 你不是杀人凶手
Dialogue: 1,1:59:27.70,1:59:29.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, come on. You're not a killer, Jean.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:29.66,1:59:30.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你根本不知道我是什么人
Dialogue: 1,1:59:29.66,1:59:30.96,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You have no idea what I am.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:32.71,1:59:34.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道你爱你的姐姐
Dialogue: 1,1:59:32.71,1:59:34.33,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I know that you loved your sister.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:37.67,1:59:40.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道失去她就像失去了一切
Dialogue: 1,1:59:37.67,1:59:40.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And I know that losing her felt like you'd lost everything.
Dialogue: 2,1:59:40.72,1:59:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你再靠近一点 他就死！ 他们都会死！
Dialogue: 1,1:59:40.72,1:59:43.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}If you come any closer, he dies! They all do!
Dialogue: 2,2:00:01.99,2:00:03.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 你知道这不会令她起死回生吧？
Dialogue: 1,2:00:01.99,2:00:03.49,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know this won't bring her back, right, Jean?
Dialogue: 2,2:00:03.57,2:00:05.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你……
Dialogue: 1,2:00:03.57,2:00:05.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-You...
Dialogue: 2,2:00:21.21,2:00:23.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别那么肯定我无法进入你的思想
Dialogue: 1,2:00:21.21,2:00:23.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't be so sure I can't get into your mind.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:25.51,2:00:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}自从上次尝试后 我的能力增强了很多
Dialogue: 1,2:00:25.51,2:00:27.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a lot more powerful since I last tried.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:37.90,2:00:39.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧
Dialogue: 1,2:00:37.90,2:00:39.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:48.20,2:00:49.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 1,2:00:50.58,2:00:51.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,2:00:53.91,2:00:57.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你以为你不必…… 再听我的话 因为你有超能力？
Dialogue: 1,2:00:53.91,2:00:57.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You think you don't have to listen to me now that you've got powers?
Dialogue: 2,2:01:02.26,2:01:07.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这整件事可以很可怕
Dialogue: 1,2:01:02.26,2:01:07.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, this. . . this whole thing can get really scary.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:07.89,2:01:08.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？
Dialogue: 1,2:01:07.89,2:01:08.93,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know that?
Dialogue: 2,2:01:27.53,2:01:29.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}已经很可怕了
Dialogue: 1,2:01:27.53,2:01:29.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It's already pretty scary.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:30.53,2:01:31.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的
Dialogue: 1,2:01:30.53,2:01:31.95,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:32.04,2:01:35.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且事情可以改变得很快·
Dialogue: 1,2:01:32.04,2:01:35.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And things can change, like, very quickly. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:01:35.08,2:01:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}以我们现在甚至无法想象的方式
Dialogue: 1,2:01:35.08,2:01:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}. . . in ways that we can't even imagine right now.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:38.17,2:01:39.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道
Dialogue: 1,2:01:38.17,2:01:39.25,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Iknow.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:39.33,2:01:40.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不
Dialogue: 1,2:01:39.33,2:01:40.67,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:43.09,2:01:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不认为你知道
Dialogue: 1,2:01:43.09,2:01:44.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think you do know.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:46.63,2:01:48.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么意思
Dialogue: 1,2:01:46.63,2:01:48.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 2,2:01:51.35,2:01:53.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是一个很特别的人
Dialogue: 1,2:01:51.35,2:01:53.06,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a really special person.
Dialogue: 2,2:01:54.68,2:01:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我希望那可以 总是让你感觉自己棒极了
Dialogue: 1,2:01:54.68,2:01:57.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And I would hope that that will always make you feel really great about yourself,
Dialogue: 2,2:01:58.69,2:02:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我知道有时候并非如此
Dialogue: 1,2:01:58.69,2:02:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but I know sometimes it doesn't.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:01.61,2:02:04.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时你会感到非常孤独
Dialogue: 1,2:02:01.61,2:02:04.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Sometimes, you'll be really lonely.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:07.65,2:02:08.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有时候·
Dialogue: 1,2:02:07.65,2:02:08.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And sometimes,
Dialogue: 2,2:02:10.20,2:02:11.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你与众不同……
Dialogue: 1,2:02:10.20,2:02:11.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}because you're special,
Dialogue: 2,2:02:14.12,2:02:17.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}人们可能会对你做出 黑暗、可怕的事情
Dialogue: 1,2:02:14.12,2:02:17.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}people can do dark, monstrous things to you.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:20.04,2:02:21.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是
Dialogue: 1,2:02:20.04,2:02:21.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But...
Dialogue: 2,2:02:22.67,2:02:24.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我要你知道的
Dialogue: 1,2:02:22.67,2:02:24.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}this is what I want you to know.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:26.09,2:02:27.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你美丽.·.
Dialogue: 1,2:02:26.09,2:02:27.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're beautiful,
Dialogue: 2,2:02:28.01,2:02:29.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱你的人
Dialogue: 1,2:02:28.01,2:02:29.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}and the people who love you,
Dialogue: 2,2:02:29.55,2:02:33.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们爱你不是因为你与众不同 我们爱你因为你是你
Dialogue: 1,2:02:29.55,2:02:33.39,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}we love you not because you're special, we love you because you're you.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:35.52,2:02:36.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要你记住这一点
Dialogue: 1,2:02:35.52,2:02:36.98,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I want you to remember that.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:39.23,2:02:41.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使感觉自己完全孤身一人
Dialogue: 1,2:02:39.23,2:02:41.23,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Even when it feels like you're totally alone.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:44.23,2:02:46.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那也是你最重要的责任
Dialogue: 1,2:02:44.23,2:02:46.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}That's your deepest responsibility.
Dialogue: 2,2:02:49.44,2:02:52.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}无论你变得多么强大 永远都不要忘记这一点
Dialogue: 1,2:02:49.44,2:02:52.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Never forget that, no matter how powerful you become.
Dialogue: 1,2:03:08.92,2:03:10.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:25.73,2:03:27.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对你姐姐的事感到抱歉
Dialogue: 1,2:03:25.73,2:03:27.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry about your sister.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:32.57,2:03:34.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对你阿姨的事感到抱歉
Dialogue: 1,2:03:32.57,2:03:34.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry about your aunt.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:37.83,2:03:39.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 你会喜欢她
Dialogue: 1,2:03:37.83,2:03:39.08,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, you would've loved her.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:42.92,2:03:44.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就因为我们失去了某人……
Dialogue: 1,2:03:42.92,2:03:44.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just because we've lost someone. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:03:48.00,2:03:50.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不代表我们必须单打独斗
Dialogue: 1,2:03:48.00,2:03:50.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't mean we have to do this alone.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:52.05,2:03:54.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说 我们不能
Dialogue: 1,2:03:52.05,2:03:54.97,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, we can't.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:55.05,2:03:56.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}相信我 我试过了
Dialogue: 1,2:03:55.05,2:03:56.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Trust me, I've been trying.
Dialogue: 2,2:03:59.93,2:04:01.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行不通
Dialogue: 1,2:03:59.93,2:04:01.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}It doesn't work.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:05.98,2:04:07.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}即使那是真的……
Dialogue: 1,2:04:05.98,2:04:07.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Even if that's true. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:04:11.57,2:04:12.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我一个亲人都没有
Dialogue: 1,2:04:11.57,2:04:12.74,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I have no one.
Dialogue: 2,2:04:17.45,2:04:18.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有我
Dialogue: 1,2:04:17.45,2:04:18.53,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You have me.
Dialogue: 1,2:04:55.66,2:04:57.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}IGASPS, PANTS]
Dialogue: 2,2:05:03.16,2:05:04.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你受伤了吗？
Dialogue: 1,2:05:03.16,2:05:04.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 2,2:05:04.62,2:05:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我很好
Dialogue: 1,2:05:04.62,2:05:06.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:11.63,2:05:12.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没事
Dialogue: 1,2:05:11.63,2:05:12.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'mokay.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:13.55,2:05:15.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-彼得 -我没事
Dialogue: 1,2:05:13.55,2:05:15.01,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Peter.   -I'm okay, I'm okay, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:15.09,2:05:16.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得 不
Dialogue: 1,2:05:15.09,2:05:16.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Peter. No.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:20.30,2:05:22.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得 不
Dialogue: 1,2:05:20.30,2:05:22.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Peter, Peter. No, no.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:22.31,2:05:25.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 彼得
Dialogue: 1,2:05:22.31,2:05:25.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}— No, no, no, Peter.／-Peter.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:25.39,2:05:27.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 你必须离开这里 他们会找你
Dialogue: 1,2:05:25.39,2:05:27.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean, you gotta get outta here. They'll be looking for you.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:27.90,2:05:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 拜托 撑住
Dialogue: 1,2:05:27.90,2:05:29.60,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No, no, no, no, no. Please, just stay with me.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:29.69,2:05:30.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托 撑住 拜托！
Dialogue: 1,2:05:29.69,2:05:30.94,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, hold on. please!
Dialogue: 2,2:05:31.02,2:05:32.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴 你.·
Dialogue: 1,2:05:31.02,2:05:32.19,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Jean, you're. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:05:33.07,2:05:34.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会没事的
Dialogue: 1,2:05:33.07,2:05:34.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:35.86,2:05:36.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快走
Dialogue: 1,2:05:35.86,2:05:36.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just go.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:39.07,2:05:40.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着我
Dialogue: 1,2:05:39.07,2:05:40.07,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at me.
Dialogue: 2,2:05:57.84,2:06:02.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天真是令人震惊 蜘蛛侠竟然身负枪伤……／出现在贝尔维尤医院……
Dialogue: 1,2:05:57.84,2:06:02.76,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Shock today,／as Spider-Man arrived at Bellevue Hospital with a bullet wound,
Dialogue: 2,2:06:03.22,2:06:04.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看起来命悬一线
Dialogue: 1,2:06:03.22,2:06:04.89,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}seemingly at death's door.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:06.73,2:06:09.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（蜘蛛侠 你是我们的英雄） 这位隐名的打击犯罪者目前情况危急
Dialogue: 1,2:06:06.73,2:06:09.73,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The reclusive crime fighter is in critical condition,
Dialogue: 2,2:06:09.81,2:06:12.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}市内顶尖的医学专家正在全力抢救他
Dialogue: 1,2:06:09.81,2:06:12.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}as the city's top medical experts work to save him.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:12.77,2:06:14.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（突发新闻 蜘蛛侠情况危急）
Dialogue: 2,2:06:16.28,2:06:19.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚 全城关注蜘蛛侠
Dialogue: 1,2:06:16.28,2:06:19.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Tonight, all eyes are on Spider-Man.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:21.07,2:06:23.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拯救了纽约无数次的英雄……
Dialogue: 1,2:06:21.07,2:06:23.41,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}The hero who saved New York so many times. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:06:23.91,2:06:26.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在他在最优秀最聪明的人手中
Dialogue: 1,2:06:23.91,2:06:26.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}is now in the hands of its best and brightest.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:26.45,2:06:27.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(纽约城爱蜘蛛侠）
Dialogue: 2,2:06:28.87,2:06:31.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而纽约的市民们正屏息以待
Dialogue: 1,2:06:28.87,2:06:31.83,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And the people of New York hold their breath.
Dialogue: 2,2:06:38.17,2:06:41.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（早日康复！
Dialogue: 2,2:06:41.34,2:06:44.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（我们爱你蜘蛛侠）
Dialogue: 2,2:07:38.69,2:07:39.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克？
Dialogue: 1,2:07:38.69,2:07:39.69,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Frank?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:43.16,2:07:44.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我在哪里？
Dialogue: 1,2:07:43.16,2:07:44.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where am I?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:46.28,2:07:48.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不 嘿 -我的面具在哪里？
Dialogue: 1,2:07:46.28,2:07:48.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, no, no, no, no. Hey.   -Where's my mask?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:48.70,2:07:50.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心 我帮你安排好了
Dialogue: 1,2:07:48.70,2:07:50.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry about that. I got you covered.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:50.08,2:07:51.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你没事
Dialogue: 1,2:07:50.08,2:07:51.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, you're good.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:51.62,2:07:53.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}琴在哪里？ 她没事吧？
Dialogue: 1,2:07:51.62,2:07:53.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where's Jean? Is she okay?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:53.08,2:07:55.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 她没事
Dialogue: 1,2:07:53.08,2:07:55.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, she's okay. She's okay.
Dialogue: 2,2:07:55.08,2:07:56.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-她在哪里？  -孩子
Dialogue: 1,2:07:55.08,2:07:56.29,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is she?
Dialogue: 2,2:07:57.59,2:07:59.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想她刚离开了
Dialogue: 1,2:07:57.59,2:07:59.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I think maybe she just left.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:00.42,2:08:05.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她利用她的巫术保住你的命
Dialogue: 1,2:08:00.42,2:08:05.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}She was, uh, using her magic voodoo shit to keep you alive.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:05.80,2:08:08.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的.她没事
Dialogue: 1,2:08:05.80,2:08:08.81,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. . . she's all right.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:15.48,2:08:16.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对不起
Dialogue: 1,2:08:15.48,2:08:16.52,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'msorry.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:21.36,2:08:22.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克 没关系
Dialogue: 1,2:08:21.36,2:08:22.82,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Frank.   -Just...Just...I'm...
Dialogue: 2,2:08:22.86,2:08:24.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是……我真的很抱歉我所做的
Dialogue: 1,2:08:22.86,2:08:24.57,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-Frank, it's okay.   -I'm really sorry for what I did.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:24.66,2:08:28.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-不 弗兰克 没关系 -不 是很多事情……／但是肯定有关系 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,2:08:24.66,2:08:28.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-No, Frank, it's okay. And it's. . .／No, it's a lot of things, but it sure as shit ain't okay, all right?
Dialogue: 2,2:08:32.04,2:08:33.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我看过……
Dialogue: 1,2:08:32.04,2:08:33.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I've seen. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:08:34.87,2:08:38.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以前看过很多勇敢行为
Dialogue: 1,2:08:34.87,2:08:38.46,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I've seen real bravery, kid, in my day.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:40.21,2:08:41.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是那个……
Dialogue: 1,2:08:40.21,2:08:41.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}But that. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:08:42.67,2:08:44.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是另一个级别
Dialogue: 1,2:08:42.67,2:08:44.09,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}that was something else.
Dialogue: 2,2:08:47.51,2:08:48.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}弗兰克 你哭了？
Dialogue: 1,2:08:47.51,2:08:48.85,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}-You crying, Frank?
Dialogue: 2,2:08:48.93,2:08:50.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我没……
Dialogue: 1,2:08:48.93,2:08:50.47,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. I ain't. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:08:57.19,2:08:59.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你和我想象中的一样
Dialogue: 1,2:08:57.19,2:08:59.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, you look the exact way I thought you would.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:00.23,2:09:01.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道的
Dialogue: 1,2:09:00.23,2:09:01.28,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You know.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:01.69,2:09:02.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}乖孩子
Dialogue: 1,2:09:01.69,2:09:02.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}A nice kid.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:05.36,2:09:06.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从来没有过像这样的朋友
Dialogue: 1,2:09:05.36,2:09:06.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Never had a friend like that.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:08.53,2:09:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们现在是朋友了吗？
Dialogue: 1,2:09:08.53,2:09:10.12,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we friends now?
Dialogue: 2,2:09:17.04,2:09:18.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我无法相信我看到你哭了
Dialogue: 1,2:09:17.04,2:09:18.63,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't believe I just saw you cry.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:18.71,2:09:20.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没哭 你在说什么？
Dialogue: 1,2:09:18.71,2:09:20.71,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}- I didn't cry. What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 2,2:09:20.75,2:09:22.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胡说
Dialogue: 1,2:09:20.75,2:09:22.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Bullshit.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:24.22,2:09:25.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好 这个
Dialogue: 1,2:09:24.22,2:09:25.80,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah, this.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:25.88,2:09:27.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们一直这样做整晚了
Dialogue: 1,2:09:25.88,2:09:27.51,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They've been doing it all night.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:27.59,2:09:30.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从你进来那一刻 他们就在那里 看一看
Dialogue: 1,2:09:27.59,2:09:30.14,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}They've been here since you walked in. Just take a look.
Dialogue: 2,2:09:39.10,2:09:40.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（早日康复）
Dialogue: 2,2:09:40.90,2:09:43.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}孩子 当你进来时 他们必须剪破你的制服……
Dialogue: 1,2:09:40.90,2:09:43.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yo, kid, when you came in, they had to cut through the suit,
Dialogue: 2,2:09:43.94,2:09:46.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是当你准备离开……
Dialogue: 1,2:09:43.94,2:09:46.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but when you're ready to split. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:09:46.86,2:09:48.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有一个计划
Dialogue: 1,2:09:46.86,2:09:48.36,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}. . . I got a plan.
Dialogue: 2,2:10:03.55,2:10:07.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(我们爱你 蜘蛛侠）
Dialogue: 2,2:10:10.30,2:10:13.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:10.30,2:10:13.18,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, it's Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:14.81,2:10:16.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:14.81,2:10:16.22,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man!
