Dialogue: 1,2:10:20.02,2:10:21.10,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:23.73,2:10:25.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}耶 蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:23.73,2:10:25.15,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:26.57,2:10:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠 你是最好的！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:26.57,2:10:28.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the best, Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:29.40,2:10:30.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:29.40,2:10:30.70,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:32.41,2:10:33.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:32.41,2:10:33.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Over here!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:34.58,2:10:35.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们爱你！
Dialogue: 1,2:10:34.58,2:10:35.79,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you!
Dialogue: 1,2:10:35.87,2:10:37.16,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:10:38.29,2:10:39.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（早日康复）
Dialogue: 2,2:10:40.08,2:10:42.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}(我们需要你）
Dialogue: 2,2:10:54.06,2:10:56.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（纽约需要它的英雄！
Dialogue: 2,2:11:03.98,2:11:09.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（紧急 拯救我们的蜘蛛侠 纽约城爱蜘蛛侠）
Dialogue: 1,2:11:03.98,2:11:09.86,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:09.94,2:11:14.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:09.94,2:11:14.03,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 1,2:11:14.12,2:11:19.20,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:11:29.34,2:11:37.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠！
Dialogue: 1,2:11:29.34,2:11:37.31,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 1,2:11:37.39,2:11:39.77,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man!
Dialogue: 2,2:12:35.16,2:12:40.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}（梅 帕克 帮助一个人就是帮助所有人)
Dialogue: 2,2:12:43.37,2:12:44.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……
Dialogue: 1,2:12:43.37,2:12:44.37,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I've, uh. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:12:47.38,2:12:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一直在想你所说的
Dialogue: 1,2:12:47.38,2:12:49.34,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Been thinking a lot about what you said.
Dialogue: 2,2:12:51.88,2:12:54.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会很高兴知道我决定 我不……
Dialogue: 1,2:12:51.88,2:12:54.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And you'd be happy to know that I've decided I'm not. . .
Dialogue: 2,2:12:56.26,2:12:58.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不会再一个人做了
Dialogue: 1,2:12:56.26,2:12:58.26,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm not gonna do this alone anymore.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:07.77,2:13:09.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想念你 梅阿姨
Dialogue: 1,2:13:07.77,2:13:09.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I miss you, May.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:17.45,2:13:19.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的背后还有点疼……
Dialogue: 1,2:13:17.45,2:13:19.45,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I've still got a little pain in my back,
Dialogue: 2,2:13:19.53,2:13:22.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是我可以· 重出江湖 如果你需要我
Dialogue: 1,2:13:19.53,2:13:22.58,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but I could probably get back out there if you need me for anything.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:22.58,2:13:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你休息
Dialogue: 1,2:13:22.58,2:13:25.04,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. What I need you to do is rest.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:25.12,2:13:27.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道 但是你必须给我一点东西
Dialogue: 1,2:13:25.12,2:13:27.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I know, but come on, you gotta give me something.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:27.25,2:13:29.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}调查有什么进展？
Dialogue: 1,2:13:27.25,2:13:29.17,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, how's the investigation going?
Dialogue: 2,2:13:29.25,2:13:32.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}梅茨格还是失踪 但是.·
Dialogue: 1,2:13:29.25,2:13:32.21,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, Metzger's still missing,
Dialogue: 2,2:13:32.25,2:13:34.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你的朋友黑寡妇……
Dialogue: 1,2:13:32.25,2:13:34.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}but your friend, Black Widow,
Dialogue: 2,2:13:34.80,2:13:37.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她一直在帮我们挖掘
Dialogue: 1,2:13:34.80,2:13:37.43,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}she's been helping us dig through all the records
Dialogue: 2,2:13:37.51,2:13:39.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}损管局尝试抹掉的记录
Dialogue: 1,2:13:37.51,2:13:39.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Damage Control tried to have scrubbed.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:40.14,2:13:42.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前几天她让我去她办公室一趟
Dialogue: 1,2:13:40.14,2:13:42.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Had me drop by her office the other day.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:42.64,2:13:43.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}感觉如何？
Dialogue: 1,2:13:42.64,2:13:43.72,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}And how was that?
Dialogue: 2,2:13:44.14,2:13:46.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的皮肤感觉棒极了
Dialogue: 1,2:13:44.14,2:13:46.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, uh, my skin feels amazing.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:48.27,2:13:49.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所有单位注意
Dialogue: 1,2:13:48.27,2:13:49.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Attention, all units.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:49.56,2:13:51.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们已确认发生一起 正在进行的银行抢劫案
Dialogue: 1,2:13:49.56,2:13:51.48,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}We have a confirmed bank robbery in progress.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:51.56,2:13:52.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你收到吗？
Dialogue: 1,2:13:51.56,2:13:52.61,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, are you getting this?
Dialogue: 2,2:13:54.24,2:13:55.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的 我去处理
Dialogue: 1,2:13:54.24,2:13:55.32,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:55.40,2:13:57.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}离开我这里不远 我可以在那里见你
Dialogue: 1,2:13:55.40,2:13:57.78,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, it's not that far from me. I could probably meet you down there.
Dialogue: 2,2:13:57.82,2:14:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不 我们可以应付抢劫案
Dialogue: 1,2:13:57.82,2:14:00.24,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}No. We can handle a robbery.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:01.20,2:14:03.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只要好好照顾自己就行了
Dialogue: 1,2:14:01.20,2:14:03.99,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Just try to take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:05.66,2:14:06.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,2:14:05.66,2:14:06.66,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:08.00,2:14:09.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你也是
Dialogue: 1,2:14:08.00,2:14:09.00,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}You too.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:10.04,2:14:11.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}替我问候EJ和玛丽
Dialogue: 1,2:14:10.04,2:14:11.75,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Say hello to EJ and Marley for me.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:12.17,2:14:14.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好
Dialogue: 1,2:14:12.17,2:14:14.13,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:16.17,2:14:17.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}蜘蛛侠问候你们
Dialogue: 1,2:14:16.17,2:14:17.59,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Spider-Man says hello.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:53.84,2:14:54.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨
Dialogue: 1,2:14:53.84,2:14:54.84,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 1,2:14:54.92,2:14:56.42,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, hey.
Dialogue: 2,2:14:58.38,2:15:01.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}带花来派对的那个 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,2:14:58.38,2:15:01.64,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, oh. Uh, flower guy, right, from. . . from the party?
Dialogue: 1,2:15:01.68,2:15:02.68,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:03.39,2:15:04.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是彼得
Dialogue: 1,2:15:03.39,2:15:04.56,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}I'mPeter.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:05.60,2:15:07.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好
Dialogue: 1,2:15:05.60,2:15:07.02,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Hello.
Dialogue: 2,2:15:25.53,2:15:26.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}彼得
Dialogue: 1,2:15:25.53,2:15:26.62,EN,,0,0,0,,{\rEN\blur0.8}Peter.
